<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">KEJ - Alkitab Ambai</book>
  <para style="h">Nunei Reantenangfo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nun.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nunei Reantenangfo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nunei Reantenangfo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nunei Reantenangfo</para>
  <para style="is">Kaiwo Dedung</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku nunei reantenangfo nini, deikariri kariri todoni Allai niari nunei tuti rorafaisi tuti inontarainesa ne, sasarifoi reantenangfo tuti nunei sobu dadirafo, kontai todoni Allai medu ria inontarainesa fo. Buku nini ato kutu we rabuang fuba boru amani,</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Robong 1-11. Kariri Allai niari nunei tuti rorafaisi tuti kariri inontarainesa na doni ma fo. Na robong ninai kontai soi kariri Adami tuti Hawai, Kaini tuti Habeli, Noki tuti foa fiabaifoi, kontai Menara Babeli.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Robong 12-50. Kariri werengno Israeli fosa ma fo. Ene wereng mano reantenang mani Abrahami. I mani wewonong paria na ne yoasoafo tuti dohong kariri Allai ne kaiwofo. Sua aha mani kariri Isaki, Abrahami kaisungfoi tuti kariri Yakupi, Isaki kaisungfoi (Yakupi nini esahui kontai we Israeli).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mayeai riria kariri Yakupi ne kaisung ewesuraya mandu fosa ene ririafoi. Yakupi ne kaisung ewesuraya mandu nini saino ewe wereng we riria Israelio suraya mandu foi ne. Na kaiwone kontai soi kariri Yakupi ne kaisungno Yusupi tuti fi kawariaio wedaya Yakupi tuti ne arikangfosa etaunaung to Mesiria eminohi naya fo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Masino buku nini soi kariri inontaraio na reantenang pari fosa ki, wape fi fuba buku nini medura ne mani, kariri fi Allai niarifo. Fi reantenang soi na buku nini mani kariri todoni Allai niari rorafaisi tuti nunei ne, tuti kife buku nei na ne kaiwo arerai dohongnai we wiro sawing inontaraine tata kaha fo. Na buku nini mani, medu fuba sewa kariri Allai mano kiutu kaiwo kariri nunei tuti dohong aiboifo we mandoni dino dohong sarawafo. Allai nani kontai andino wiwiaing tuti fiata ne inontarainesa kontai niari inontaraine ene ririafoi ne. Soi buku tawa nini weo deisaha kariri kaiwasa na nu bei, ene eroasoafo tuti ambori fiatasa we ene eroasoafo nayai darang pampang.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kaiwo na buku nei deto kutuai tonina,</para>
  <para style="io1">1:1—2:25 kariri Allai niari rorafaisi nunei tuti inontarainesa</para>
  <para style="io1">3:1-24 kariri sasarifoi wereantenang tuti dadirafo</para>
  <para style="io1">4:1—5:32 kariri Adami paria sobu Noki</para>
  <para style="io1">6:1—10:32 kariri Noki tuti Foa Fiabai foi</para>
  <para style="io1">11:1-9 kariri Menara Babeli</para>
  <para style="io1">11:10-32 kariri Semi paria sobu Abrami</para>
  <para style="io1">12:1—35:29 kariri Abrahami, Isaki tuti Yakupi itone munurorongfo</para>
  <para style="io1">36:1-43 kariri Esauwi ne ririafoi</para>
  <para style="io1">37:1—45:28 kariri Yusupi tuti ne doroi fosa</para>
  <para style="io1">46:1—50:26 kariri Inontarai Israeli fosa na nu Mesiri foi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kaiwo reantenang kariri Allai niari nuneifo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Na reantenang parifo mani, arahio Allai niari rorafaisi tuti nunei.<figure style="fig" file="HK00338C.TIF" size="span" ref="1:1">Nunei reantenangfo</figure> <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Nunei kehabi tuti tami kaharai tuti mamantitifoi tebung wedua rawanang kehabifoi sentenang. Tuti Allai Nuaninufoi da towana toninai na mereha nuwowongfo.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Allai medu deyo, “Sambewaraifa!” Ainanaya sambewarafo kaririaia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:6">2Kor. 4:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Allai firaise weo deti sambewarai nanai mahikai, ampefe kiatate sambewarafo weru mamantitifo. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Tuti Allai sahu sambewarai nani we rahida, tuti mamantitifo we diru. Dirufoi da wa, mayeai ahafoi yiwangni aha. Nana mani rahida bo reantenangfoi dinani.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Mayeai Allai medu aha deyo, “Katai kehabi bei dariai we biau merehafoi we boru.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:5">2Ptr. 3:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Ampefe Allai niari katai kehabi nani we kiatate mereha na yaifoi weru mereha bo kofafoi. Ampefe we tarai kaririai. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Ainanaya Allai sahu katai kehabi nani we rora. Dirufoi da wa tuti ahafoi yiwangni aha, nana mani rahida bo borufoi dinani.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Mayeai Allai medu aha deyo, “Mereha na rora amawawanei, fianduhi na katai bei, ambori katai sarahiai feai kawariai.” Tuti finanai kaririai. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Ainanaya Allai sahu katai sarahiafo we rei, tuti katai mereha fianduhi naifoi we rawanang. Allai firaise weo deti finanai mahikai fefe. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Ampefe Allai medu aha deyo, “Kahofane wau tifu fio tetifu bongnei kiai, fi sifuo webong tuti wekamamieifoi, ambori kamieifoi sifu kaririai aha.” Tuti finanai kaririai. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Ampefe kahofafoi tifu fio tetifu bongnei kiai, amani ne wekamamieifoi tuti ai bongnei kiai webong tuti wekamamieifoi sifu kaririai aha. Allai firaise weo deti finanai mahikai fefe. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Dirufoi da wa, mayeai ahafoi yiwangnia aha, nana mani rahida botorufoi dinani.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Ainanaya Allai medu aha deyo, “Fi danggararu feai dariai na roranei we kiatate dirufoi weru rahidafoi, kontai we deinawi kariri ne diruneungfo, ne rahidafo tuti defuinafo, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />tuti fi danggararu nanai we sambewa nunei.” Tuti finanai kaririai. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Mayeai Allai niari fi danggararu fuba boru, amani wofoi we sambewarai na rahidafo, tuti embaifoi we sambewarai na dirufo. Tuti niari awahafo kontai. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Fi danggararu nanai Allai dohongnai nayai na rorafaisi we sambewarai to nunei, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />we sambewa dirufoi tuti rahidafoi, we kiatate mamantitifo weru sambewarafo. Allai firaise weo deti finanai mahikai fefe. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Ainanaya dirufoi da wa, ahafoi yiwangni aha, nana mani rahida bo boafoi dinani.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Mayeai Allai medu aha deyo, “Na mereha rorongfo dariai fidarangnei kiai, tuti na roranei romufoi siafo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Ampefe Allai niari ansurang bebafoi na rawanang kehabifoi, tuti fi darang urengnei kiai na mereha rorongfo, tuti romunei kiai. Allai firaise weo detio finanai kai mahikai fefe. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Ainanaya Allai mioang fi niari nanai kai, tuti medu deyo, “We ansurangrausi metawing separai bitoya we mesefa mereha rorongfo, tuti romune mea na nunei metawing separai bitoya kontai.”<figure style="fig" file="HK00072C.TIF" size="col" ref="1:22">Romu etawing separai</figure> <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Dirufoi da wa, mayeai ahafoi yiwangni aha, nana mani rahida bo ringfoi dinani.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Ainanaya Allai medu aha deyo, “Fi darang urengnei kiai dariai na nunei, amani andowafoi kiai na rei reisi, mano terirafoi, andowa mano ahumifoi tuti mano fiafa na arongfoi.” Tuti finanai kaririai. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Ampefe Allai niari maino fi darang urengnei kiai, tuti Firaise weo detioai we fi niari nanai mahikai fefe.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Ainanaya Allai medu aha deyo, “Tonari inontarainesa enetarai toyari Totoru, ambori ewemambiriu sau diangfosa kiai, romufosa kiai, tuti andowafosa kiai na nunei.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:7">1Kor. 11:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Ampefe Allai niari inontarainesa enetarai kariri mantauni. Niari mangfosa tuti wiwingfosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat. 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mrk. 10:6</ref>.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:1-2">Nun. 5:1-2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Ainanaya Allai medu we suru deyo, “Imoang muru ambori murawing separaia bitoya ambori mune ririanei sefa nunei. Tuti mewemambiriu we meru nunei, mewemambiriu we diangfosa na mereha rorongfo tuti romufosa na rorafoi tuti andowafoi kiai na reirei.”<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Mayeai Allai medu aha deyo, “Boti! Yohongno fi tifuo wekamamieifoi tuti we bongfoi kiai we fiang we mea. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Wape we andowafoi kiai tuti romufoi kiai, Yohongno ninoifo tuti fi tifuo we reraungfoi kiai we fiang wesa.” Tuti finanai kaririai. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Allai firaise paria, weo detioai we fi kiaio niariri nani mehikai. Ainanaya dirufoi da wa, tuti ahafoi yiwangni aha, nana mani rahida wonangfoi dinani.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Ampefe Allai niari rorafaisi tuti nunei, tuti fi kiaio niayai naifo, kai finanaia. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Ainanaya Allai fiotourai na rahida bo itufoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:4">Ibr. 4:4</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 4:10">10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Ainanaya Allai mioang rahida bo itufoi tuti diri rahida nani we rahida mirarebanai paria. Weo rahida bonani fiotourai weru fi niaririfoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kel. 20:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Allai niari rorafaisi tuti nunei tuti fi kiaio niayai naifoi mani sonina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Na rabuang bo Yahweh Allai niari rorafaisi tuti nuneifo mani, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />wiro fi tifufo kawariai na kahofanei kaharai. Weo Yahweh Allai wiro niari metangfoi bia to nunei kaharai, tuti wiro inontarai manea we erufi nai kaharai. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Wape merehafoi dautai na kahofafo we dohong wawasa nunei.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Na rabuang bonani Yahweh Allai kia kahofa feai, niari mang manei, tuti firarang ansengfoi to ubongkamireifoi, ampefe darang we inontaraia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:45">1Kor. 15:45</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inontaraifoi tuti Romi Edeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Mayeai Yahweh Allai niari romi bei na Edeni, na do wanang murangfoi, tuti dohongno inontarai niariri nani niayai nai. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Yahweh Allai niari ai denteng bitoya paria doari na romifoi. Tifu ne bongfoi mehikai paria we angni. Na romi rabuangtahifo, tifu ai roworu amani, aio dohong arang we fitawafa tuti aio wedaya waitawang kariri ne bengfo tuti ne karirafo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Why. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">22:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14">14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Waya rowei deda na Edeni we dohong wawasa romifoi. Waya nani dedara kewariai mani sobaurai weroboa amani, <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />bo reantenangfoi wonong fino Pisoni, waya nani dedara dedawari kahofa Hawilai. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Katai nani ne emasifoi denteng sewa tuti kesi bedola ne kaisea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesi bedola mani kaisea niunsai mampori tewahi na ai rerawa netarai kariri ai reifofa sifu na Arapi do wanang sai. Kesi nini enariri kontai we maning nunsai mampori tuti rawang.</char></note> na nanai, tuti kamiei krisoprasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kamiei krisoprasi mani kamiei weharga ete kamiei permata. Kamiei nini ne rabangfo kiamantatowarai. Kamiei nini ne harga toyari masi.</char></note> kontai na nanai. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Waya bo borufoi mani wonong fino Gihoni, waya nani dedara dedawari kahofa Kusi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Waya bo botorufoi wonong fino Tigrisi. Waya nini deda na Asyuri do wanang murangfoi. Mae waya bo boafoi mani wonong fino Efrati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Ainanaya Yahweh Allai kia mangfoia dohongni niayai na romi Edeni we yufi na romifoi tuti derarati. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Yahweh Allai medu we mangfoi deyo, “Ai doari na romi fenini, bongnei kiai mani bangni, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />wape aio we waitawang kariri ne bengfo tuti ne karirafo nani mani wiro bang bongfoi fanai. Weo rahida bo bangnifoi mani, mureha rai.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Mayeai Yahweh Allai medu aha deyo, “Inontarainei meiri keburu mani, beng kaha. Ampefe Inari ne maniwowirio mesi wei manei we fiatari.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Mayeai Yahweh Allai kia kahofafeai. Na kahofa nanai, Niari maino andowanesa tuti romunesa fafong akawuruwo. Andowa nanisa Kiasa we mangfoia, ambori Allai deitawang kariri todoni dohong ewonomifo. Ampefe tonanaifa reantenang pario andowanei kiai tuti romunesa kiai ewonomi finanaifa. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Inontaraifoi dohong andowanei kiai tuti romufosa ewonomifo, wape mantauni wiro sobu ne maniwowiri mesi manei we fiatari kaha.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Ainanaya Yahweh Allai niari mangfoi denawa seo, na kutu dena nanai, Allai fiating mangfoi neina neurangfo bei, tuti katai fiating neina weruifo mani tebung weduarai na taraifeai. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Na neina neurangfoi nani, Yahweh Allai niari wiwing manei nai tuti kiari weia. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Ainanaya mangfoi medu deyo, “Andinini, inontaraio mesi kariri yau, ne neina nei na nehu neina nei, ne tarainei na nehu tarainei. I mani afui we wiwing, weo Yahwei kiari na mangnei fefe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na kaiwo Iberani, ISH mani mang, tuti ISHA mani wiwing.</char></note>.” <verse eid="GEN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Nanai wedaya mangfoi ambori sawing inang tamang suru, tuti weboyari ria ne wiwingfoi. Ampefe uweboyari we ubaung une munurorong.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat. 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:7-8">Mrk. 10:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:16">1Kor. 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:31">Ef. 5:31</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Mangfoi tuti wiwingfoi unayai arora, wape wiro umamaya wawera suru kaha.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Inontaraifoi niari sasari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Na andowa fubao Yahweh Allai niariri kiaifoi mani, tawainei dino sewai sewa na tetofafo ne. Wiro andowa manei netarai kariri kaha. Tawaifoi medu we wiwingfoi deyo, “Taraie, Allai deyo, Ai fubao doari na romi fenini ne bongfoi wiro murani kahae?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:9">Why. 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:2">20:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Ainanaya wiwingfoi yoa we tawaifoi deyo, “Ai fubao doari na romi fenini, ne bongfoi mani aurani. <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />Wape ai bo doa na romi rabuangtahifoi mani, Allai medu deyo, wiro aurani ete auruti fanai, weo nana mani aumereha rai.”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Manamo tawaifoi yoa we wiwingfoi deyo, “Nanai tarai kaha, wiro mumarareha kaharai, <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Yahweh Allai medu tonanafo, weo deitawanai na rahida murang aibongfoi mani, muuremiwa tabau tuti munetarai kariri Allai, muwaitawang ne bengfo tuti ne karirafo.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Wiwingfoi detioai we aibongfoi mehikai tuti miaing paria we angni, tuti aibongfoi kia enerorongfoi we dohong awai wei. Ampefe deting aibongfoi tuti dangnia, tuti dohongni we ne mangfoi mano unayai ruhiaifoi tuti ne mangfoi dangni kontai. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Na tatofang kutu nanai, uremifo tabau tuti uwaitawanai we unayai arora. Ampefe uka ai urung reraungfoa uranung tuti urawarai we kawui ambori wedua une taraifo nayai.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Ramindena nani, utarami Yahweh Allai da nubuayai na romi rorongfo, ampefe inontaraifo suru uradiwa na aio doari na nanafo, ambori wiro Yahwei Allai deti suru fanai.<verse eid="GEN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Wape Yahweh Allai sahu mangfoi deyo, “Wau doni?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Mangfoi yoa Wei deyo, “Tarahu Wau ro na romi rorongfe ninafo, imatai fefe yediwa, weo inayai arora fefe.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Yahweh Allai medu wei deyo, “Mandoni dino deisaharai we wau we nayai arorane? Bangno aibong yeiweduari we bangni kahafoi ampane?” <verse eid="GEN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Mangfoi yoa we Yahweh Allai deyo, “Wiwingno bohongni ma we fiata yau nini, andino dohong aibongfoi we yau ampefe yangnia nina.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Mayeai Yahweh Allai medu we wiwingfoi deyo, “We fianie nari fi toninane?” Ainanaya wiwingfoi yoa we Yahweh Allai aha deyo, “Tawaifoi dino tetofa yau mani donio yang aibongfoi nina.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">2Kor. 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:14">1Tim. 2:14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Ainanaya Yahweh Allai medu we tawaifoi deyo, “Nari sarawai ampa, ampefe Yeikanggani wau, na andowa teriranei tuti ne ahuminei, meiri wauno wodai aiboi nini. Na ninai to fongna mani, fafa na aromune terai, kahofafoi we fiang we wau na barangne. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Wau tuti wiwingfoi ambori muenemirireu wawera muru, ne ririafoi tuti nemu ririanei ambori eweaiteta wawerasa pampang. Ne ririafoi ambori etaha kanggung numukamieiwai tuti nemu ririanei ambori ehiri wiwingnei ne ririafoi eawemididifuifo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:17">Why. 12:17</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Ainanaya Medu we wiwingfoi aha deyo, “Yau ambori inari wau wobu dadira paria na rahida boamafo tuti wau purahai paria na rahida munohituti nemu arikangwai fo. Tonanai ki, wape enemurorongwai dohongwe nemu mangwai aha, wape nemu mangwai wemambiriu sau wau rai.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Ainanaya Medu we mangfoi aha deyo, “Wau mani taramuo nemu wiwingwai tuti bangno aibong Yeiweduari we bangni kaha foi. Ampefe na nari sarawai ninai, wedaya Yeikanggani kahofane. Na munohi barangne rurai we rufi na mamboni paria na kahofane ambori wobu fiangki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:8">Ibr. 6:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Kahofane ambori tifu ninoi weababofo we wau, tuti fi tifu funomafo ambori we fiang we wau. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Na munohi barangne rurai we rufi na mamboni paria wumaya ambori kahofane tifu fiang we wau ki. Ne tonanafo wodairai paria barabera wau we kahofa aha. Weo na kahofa nani dino Inari wau naine. Wau mani kahofa di wau ampefe barabera wau we kahofa aha.” <verse eid="GEN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Mangfoi dohong wiwingfoi wonong fino Hawai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawai na kaiwo Iberani mani, dohong arang.</char></note> weo andino we ai we inontarai fubao saubaunung na nuneine.<verse eid="GEN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Yahweh Allai niari ansungfeai na andowa rerawafo we Adami tuti ne wiwingfoi tuti Allai sensung urunayai.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Ainanaya Yahweh Allai medu aha deyo, “Ninaia mani, mangnei netarai kariri Totoru ampa, tuti deitawang kariri ne bengfo tuti ne karirafo ampa. Ampefe dohongnao kia nari aibongno dohong arang we fitawafafoi ahama we dangnife.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:14">Why. 22:14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Ampefe Yahweh Allai datari weru romi Edeni, ambori yurai we yufi na kahofao Allai niari nai ma foi. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Tuti na romi Edeni do wanang murangfoi, Allai dohongno kerupifo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kerupi mani fio darang na waidani i kontai yu fi ria wewaifosa we etohong kariri Allai ne kaiwo ohong kaririafo. Kerupi nini kontai we deitawang wedua fianggeng mararebanai parifo. </char></note> we deitawang rahutu borongfoi, tuti sondu denggararu bei, dariwari aifoi we deitawang wedua aifoi. Ampefe na tonanafo, inontarai mandoni kontaio da kefang aifoi afui kaha.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaini tuti Habeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Mayeai Adami dena ria ne wiwingno Hawai, tuti Hawai doama, ainanaya minohituti ne kaisung manei. Ampefe medu deyo, “Na Yahwei ne wiwiaingne, isobu kaisung manei.” Ampefe dohongni wonong fino Kaini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaini na kaiwo Iberani mani, isobuai.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Mayeai mani minohituti kaisung manei aha, wonong fino Habeli. Habeli nini dehung kambing tuti domba, mae Kaini dohong romi. <figure style="fig" file="HK00003C.TIF" size="col" ref="4:2">Habeli dehung kambing tuti domba</figure><verse eid="GEN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Na rahida bei aha mani, Kaini dohong ne korbanifo kuteai na fi yufo we Yahwei. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Habeli kontai dohong korbani na domba ne arikang reantenang dentengfoi, ne maingfo we Yahwei na fi yufo nanai. Ampefe Yahwei detioai tuti eneo Habeli ne korbanifo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">Ibr. 11:4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />Wape Kaini tuti ne korbanifo Yahwei eneoa kaha. Ainanaya Kaini kesou paria tuti urengfo taterai beyari. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Ampefe Yahwei medu we Kaini deyo, “Kosou we fianie? We fianie uremutaterai nina? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Masino nari ne bengfo mani, uremuwa mararising, wape maya we nari ne bengfo kaha mani, sasarifoi demang kawurua we suai to enemurorongwai. Sasari nani yurai paria we wemambiriu sau wau, wape rurai we wemambirui sau sasarifoi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Mayeaia Kaini medu we ne tahatui Habeli deyo, “Roma tura to romifo.” Na kutu urawa sobu romifo nanai, na tantuma Kaini bioi ne tahatui Habeli tuti miungnia mirehara nina.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat. 23:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Luk. 11:51</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:12">1Yoh. 3:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Yahweh Allai medu we Kaini deyo, “Kaine! Nemu tahatui Habeli andi donie?” Kaini yoa deyo, “Iserawawerahi. Yauno iwaitawang wedua nehu tahatui fine ne?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Ainanaya Yahwei medu aha deyo, “We fianie nariri tonanai? Nemu tahatuifoi ne rikafoi bibe sahu we Yau na kahofa nuwowongfo, toyari rawafuifoi sahu we Yohong aiboifo tawera we wau aha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24">Ibr. 12:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Ampefe ninaia mani, Yeikanggani wau, kahofane wiro dohong fiang we wau kaha, weo kahofa nani songno nemu tahatui ne rikafoi ampa na rahida bo mungnifoi. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Masino rurai we bohong romiki, wape kahofa nanai wiro dohong nemu fitantanangwa wetarai kaha. Wau ambori ro towana tonina, na katai bei to katai bei aha na nunei.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Ainanaya Kaini medu we Yahweh Allai deyo, “Aiboi isobuai ninai maraba paria, nehu mambiriu feai we isoduata kaha. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Bento Bata yau weru kahofa nina fefe, inayai wairoi weru Wau. Yau wiro nehu katai feai na nunei ahang kaha, ira towana tonina. Tuti mandoni sobu yau mani, ambori miung yauki.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Wape Yahwei medu deyo, “Bereri! Masino manei miung wau mani, aiboi tawera wei aha mani, mano miung wau nani sobu aiboi maraba we itu kiparai.” Mayeai Yahwei dohongno fiainawiai bei na Kaini ne taraifoi, ambori mandoni kontai sobui mani, wiro miungni kaha. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Ainanaya Kaini da weru Yahweh Allai arongfo, da to kahofa Noti na Edeni do wanang murangfoi tuti niayai nanai.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaini tuti Seti une ririanei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kaini rirau, dena ria ne wiwingfoi tuti wiwingfoi doama mani, minohituti ne kaisung manei, wonong fino Henoki. Mayeai Kaini biaungno bendari bei tuti dohong bendari nani wonong fino Henoki, kariri ne kaisungfoi wonongfo. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Henoki dawingno Irati, Irati dawingno Mehuyaeli, Mehuyaeli dawingno Metusaeli, tuti Metusaeli dawingno Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki dau wiwing mandu amani, manei wonongno Adai tuti manei wonongno Silai. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Adai dawingno Yabali. Yabali nini ne ririafoi dino etahung fiahungne tuti eminohi na yawa tendane.<figure style="fig" file="HK00223C.TIF" size="col" ref="4:20">Yawa tenda</figure> <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Arikangno sua aha mani, wonong fino Yubali. Yubali nini ne ririafoi dino esawai emei kecapi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kecapinei mani musiki bo warabuka boa tuti ne waifo raifofa tuti dawaroifo mai. Musiki nini meiri na pindakahutui na warami kikehane.</char></note> tuti ebui sulingne.<figure style="fig" file="BK00176C.TIF" size="col" ref="4:21">Kecapi</figure> <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Silai kontai dawingno Tubal-Kaini. Tubal-Kaini nini ne ririafoi dino esawai enari fi na tembaga tuti besi fo ne. Tubal-Kaini ne tahatui wiwing manei, wonong fino Naamai.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Rahida bei mani, Lameki medu we ne wiwingfo suru deyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Adai tuti Silae, mutarami ma!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">Nehu wiwingne muruine, mufobibi mutarimiwa mutarami nehu kaiwone!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Imungno mang manei mireha, weo dohongno fario yau fefe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">Imungno bariboai nania mireha, weo bioi yaua ibabara fefe.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Masino mano miung Kaini sobu aiboi maraba tawera weifo we itu kiparai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:24">Mano miung Lameki mani, sobu aiboi tawera wei maraba paria aha mani piatorua suraya itu kiparai.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adami tuti binengno Hawai une kaisung manei aha, tuti Hawai dohongni wonong fino Seti,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seti na kaiwo Iberani mani, yiwangni aha.</char></note> weo enetituaitai deyo, “Allai dino dohong kaisung manei we yau we yiwangno Habeli, weo Kaini miungno Habelia fefe.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seti ne kaisung manei, dohongni wonong fino Enosi. Na rabuang bo Enosi minohi darang nini dino, arahio reantenang we inontarainesa esahu Yahwei wonongne.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Adami ne ririafoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Adami ne ririafoi mani sonina. Na rabuang bo Allai niari inontaraifoi mani, netarai kariri Mantauni. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Niari suru, mang manei tuti wiwing manei. Mioang suru tuti sahu suru we inontarai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27-28">Nun. 1:27-28</ref>. </char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat. 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mrk. 10:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Rabuang bo Adami ne fuina piaring we piareia surafo (130) mani, ne kaisung manei aha, kaisungfoi ureng kariri beyari, ainanaya dohongni wonong fino Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Adami sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Seti saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Adami darang fuina piaring we indeatoru (800) aha. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Ampefe Adami mireha na ne fuina piaring we indeata piareia sura (930) fo.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Rabuang bo Seti ne fuina piaring ring (105) mani, ne kaisung manei, dohongni wonong fino Enosi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Seti sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Enosi saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Seti darang fuina piaring we indeatoru itu (807) aha. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Ampefe Seti mireha na ne fuina piaring we indeata suraya boru (912) fo.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Na rabuang bo Enosi ne fuina piara sura (90) mani, ne kaisung manei, dohongni wonong fino Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Enosi sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Kenani saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Enosi ne fuina piaring we indeatoru suraya ring (815) aha. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Ampefe Enosi mireha na ne fuina piaring we indeata ring (905) fo.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Rabuang bo Kenani ne fuina piatorua sura (70) mani, ne kaisung manei wonong fino Mahalaeli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Kenani sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing menea aha. Tuti na kutu Mahalaeli saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Kenani ne fuina piaring we indeatoru piaru (840) aha. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Ampefe Kenani mireha na ne fuina piaring we indeata sura (910) fo.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Rabuang bo Mahalaeli ne fuina piatorua ring (65) mani, ne kaisung manei wonong fino Yareti. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Mahalaeli sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Yareti saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Mahalaeli darang fuina piaring we indeatoru piareia sura (830) aha. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Ampefe Mahalaeli mireha na ne fuina piaring we indeatoru piara suraya ring (895) fo.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Rabuang bo Yareti ne fuina piaring piatorua boru (162) mani, ne kaisung manei wonong fino Henoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Yareti sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Henoki saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Yareti darang fuina piaring we indeatoru (800) aha. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Ampefe Yareti mireha na ne fuina piaring we indeata piatorua boru (962) fo.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Rabuang bo Henoki ne fuina piatorua ring (65) mani, ne kaisung manei wonong fino Metusalai. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Henoki sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Na kutu Metusalai saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Henoki darang fuina piaring we betoru (300) aha tuti firao Allai. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Ampefe Henoki darang na nunei fuina piaring we betoru piatorua ring (365). <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Tuti Henoki nini na darangfo firao Allai tonanafo, wedaya mani Allai yuaisi darang weru nunei tuti inontarai ewatioi ahang kaha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Ibr. 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:14">Yud. 14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Rabuang bo Metusalai ne fuina piaring piara itufo (187) mani, ne kaisung manei wonong fino Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Metusalai sobu arikang mang manea tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Lameki saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Metusalai ne fuina piaring we itu piara boru (782) aha. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Ampefe Metusalai nini mireha na ne fuina piaring we indeata piatorua indeata (969) fo.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Rabuang bo Lameki ne fuina piaring piara boru (182) mani, sobu kaisung manei. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Medu deyo, “Kaisung nini ambori dohong wawori we tata na rabuang bo tarurai paria we tatohong romi we tatanang fitantanang na kahofao Yahwei deikangganiai kawuruampa.” Ampefe dohongni wonong fino Noki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Noki dotu toyari na kaiwo Iberani mani, dohong wawori. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Lameki sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Noki saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Lameki ne fuina piaring we ring piara suraya ring (595) aha. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Ampefe Lameki mireha na ne fuina piaring we itu piatorua suraya itu (777) fo.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Noki nini ne fuina piaring we ring (500) mani sobu kaisung mantoru amani, Semi, Yafeti tuti Hami.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Inontarai enari ne karirafo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Rabuang bo inontarai arahi bitoya na nunei nanai, etawing arikang wiwing fosa kontai. <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />Mayeai Allai ne kaisung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaiwo kariri Allai ne kaisung fosa mani, waitawang turura kaha. Manea na inontarai mano esobu aunau dedai kariri buku mirarebananei, enemitituai weai weo kaisung nanisa mani inontaraio ebaba tuti ewemambiriu enayai na waidani, eaino ebiari to nunei. Wape manea siai na mano esobu aunau dedaifo enemitituai kontai. Weo Kaisung ninisa mani na inontarai mano ewemambiriu tuti eweparenta na nunei ene kaisung saine.</char></note> fosa ewati inontarai ene kamitung fosa we euremi bohi paria, ampefe eha kamitung fosa we enewiwing kariri mandoni dino enemirorong sauwei ne. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Ampefe Yahwei medu deyo, “Ansengno Yohongni we inontarainesa we dohongsa etarangnei wiro niayai pampang na sa kaha, weo ea mani tarai arora disa tuti emarareha. Na ninai tofongna mani, manei wiro minohia sewa fuina piaring piarei (120) kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Na rabuang bonani tuti rabuang bo sua ahafoi, inontarai ebaba, etaidai tuti ewemambiriu enayai na nunei. Inontarai nanisa mani, eweriria na kamitung inontarai mano Allai ne kaisung fosa erausafo. Inontarai ebaba, etaidai tuti ewemambiriu nanisa mani ewe ewonomi paria nano fafongpa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:33">Bil. 13:33</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Na rabuang bo Yahwei detioai we inontarainesa enari ne karirafo fuba paria na nunei tuti enemitituai ne karirafo pampang,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:37">Mat. 24:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26">Luk. 17:26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:20">1Ptr. 3:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />donio Yahwei detua paria, we niari inontaraifosa tuti dohongsa enayai na nuneifo. Enerorongfoi pirahai paria we finanai, <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />ampefe Yahwei medu deyo, “Yau ambori imung inontaraio inarisa ninisa eworu weru nunei, kontai romufosa tuti andowa siai fosa. Weo Yetua paria we inarisarafo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Wape Noki mani kia Yahwei enerorongfoi paria, ampefe Noki sobu ne mahikaifo.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaiwo kariri Noki tuti fi niarifo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Kaiwo kariri Noki ne minohi toa wau mani tonina. Na rabuang bo inontarai fosa enari ne karirafoa tonanafo, Noki mani inontaraio mesi dine, tuti na inontarainei kiai na rabuang bonani mani i mesiri andino denteng na Allai ureng fo ne. Na minohi darangfo mani firao Allai. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Noki ne kaisung mantoru, itowonomi fino, Semi, Yafeti tuti Hami.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:5">2Ptr. 2:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Rabuang bonani inontarai enari ne karirafo na Allai arongfo, tuti emamuna wawerasa pampang na doni kontai. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Allai deti we nunei mani, ne karirafo aino detioai terane, weo inontarai nesa kiai ne karirafo aino enari terane.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Ampefe Allai medu we Noki deyo, “Ikutuai kawurua we inari inontarainesa tuti fidarangfoi kiai etarangfo werea mai nina. Weo nunei sefang na fi kerirao enaririfoi, ampefe inari nuneia wioru tuti fidarang niayai naifoi kiai. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Nari wa fiabai bei na ai Gofiri,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ai Gofirinei na kaiwo Iberani mani Goferi. Ai nini mani aio mitubaru toyari ai ayaru ete ai jati.</char></note> tamu kahutu rorongfoi tuti kefi na aspali na rorongfo tuti boriaifo ambori mereha suayai kaha. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Wa fiabai nani nariri tonina, ne deuroifo meteri piaring piareia suraya botoru (133). <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Nari ne nuwowongwai ketai weru deraungwai senti meteri piarua boa (44). Nari ne rahutu na eneungwa tuti nari wa fiabaiwai ne rorong botoru toyai, amani bo yaifoi, bo rabuangtahifoi tuti bo kofafoi. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Taramu ma! Yau ambori inari foa fiabai bei ma sufoi nunei we miung fi darangnei kiai na nunei. Ampefe fi darangnei kiai na nunei wioru. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Wape na wau, Yau ambori yohong kariri Nehu kaiwo arerane. Wau ambori wuayai to wa fiabaiwai afui, wau tuti nemu wiwingwai, nemu arikang mantoruwa tuti itone wiwingwa sitoru. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Tuti na fidarang urengfoi kiai, ka wiwing manei tuti mang manei, ambori wiro eworu kaha, mae etarang ria wau. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Na romu urengfoi kiai tuti andowafoi kiai, ne aweng boafoi tuti ne fiafa na arongfoi na nunei ambori era we wau ma, ampefe wiro eworu kaha. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Ka maino fiang bongfoi kiai borarati we fiang we mea tuti andowa fosa kiai.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Ainanaya Noki niari kariri fianai aino Allai demi weafo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:7">Ibr. 11:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Foa fiabai sufoi nunei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Ainanaya Yahwei medu we Noki deyo, “Wuayai to wa fiabai nani afui, wau tuti nemu munurorongwasa, weo na inontarai rabuang bonini sa, meiri wauno Iwati nari ne wetaraife ne. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Na andowa kiaio wiro ewerarika kaha wasa tuti mewekorbanisa wasa mani, ka wiwing itu tuti mang itu, wape na andowa ewerarika wasa mani, ka wiwing manei tuti mang manei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arawang bonini na kaiwo Iberani mani ne awaitangnai werorong siai tonina, “Yau imaya we ka andowa urengnei kiai. Tuti na andowa metangsa wasa mani, ka mang itu tuti wiwing itu, wape andowa mano metangsa kaha wasa mani, ka mang manei tuti wiwing manei.” Atina Imamati 11:1-47.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Romufosa kontai, amani mang itu tuti wiwing itu. Ambori wiro eworua ehai kaha, mae manea etarang we etawing separai na nunei aha. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Weo rahida itu aha mani, ambori Yohong metang para bia to nunei mingno rahida piaru (40) tuti diru piaru (40), mingna fiotoura kaha, ambori inontaraifosa tuti fidarang kiaio Inarisa enayai na nunei emararehara eworu.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Ainanaya Noki niari kariri fianai aino Yahwei demi wei tonanafo.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Rabuang bo foa fiabaifoi sufoi nuneifo mani, Noki ne fuina piaring we wonang (600). <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Noki suai to wa fiabaifoi rorongfo afui, i tuti ne wiwingfoi, ne arikang mantorufo tuti itone wiwingfo sitoru, ambori ekaharai weru foa fiabaio sufoi nufoi nani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:38-39">Mat. 24:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:27">Luk. 17:27</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Na andowa urengfoi kiai, ne ewerarika fosa tuti ne ewerarika kaha fosa, romufosa tuti andowa kiaio niayai na rei reisi, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />mang manei tuti wiwing manei fuba nani kiai esuayai ria Noki to wa fiabaifoi rorongfo afui. Noki niari kariri fianai aino Allai demi weifo nanai.<verse eid="GEN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Rahida itufo kai mani, foa fiabaifoi dautai sufoi nunei. <verse eid="GEN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Rabuang bonani mani, Noki ne fuina piaring we wonang (600), na embai bo borufoi tuti na rahida bo suraya itufoi. Na rahida bonani dino, mereha urengfoi kiai na kahofa rorongfo tiapasa sabi toyai, rahutu wedua mereha ureng na rorafaisi kontai tiapasa sabi to nunei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:6">2Ptr. 3:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Metang parafoi miungna yubatai, fiotourai na ea kaha, miung rahida piaru (40), diru rahida.<verse eid="GEN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Wape na rahida bonani kontai Noki suai kawurua to wa fiabaifoi rorongfo afui, i tuti ne wiwingfoi, ne arikangno Semi, Yafeti, Hami tuti itone wiwingfo sitoru, ea kiai esuayai to wa fiabaifoi. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Na ea kontai mani, romu urengfoi kiai, andowa teriraifoi, ahumifoi tuti ne fiafa na arongfoi. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Na fidarang nani kiai, era we mandurirutiai, mang manei tuti wiwing manei. Esuayai ria Noki to wa fiabaifoi rorongfo afui, <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />kariri fianai aino Allai demi weafo, ainanaya Yahwei kife rahutu wa fiabaifoia.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Rahida piaru (40) mani foa fiabaifoi sufoi nunei, tuti merehafoi dautai sufata wa fiabaifoi dewohi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Merehafoi dautai pampangna dedai, sufata wa fiabaifoia dewohi soiyairi na mereha nuwowongfo. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Tuti merehafoi dautai pampang awao dedai paria, donio sufoi tawang uai daidai pariafo na nunei. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Na uai daidai nuwowongfo merehafoi dautai aha meteri itu. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Ainanaya fidarangfoi kiai na nunei mirehara wioru, amani romufosa, andowafosa tuti inontaraifosa kiai. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Fi kiaio darang senseng na ubongfoi mano niayai na rei sarahiafo, mirarehara wioru kiai. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Ampefe Allai niari fi darangfoi kiaia wioru tonanai, inontaraifosa, andowa eawemi boa fosa, ne efafa na earomi fosa tuti romufosa kiai Allai miungsa. Mae titou Noki tuti mano enayai kontai riati na wa fiabaifoi ansaino etarang terane. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Tuti mereha foa fiabaifoi wiro siru ahera kahai paria rahida piaring piarua sura (150).<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Foa fiabaifoi siru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Wape Allai aro Noki tuti andowa mano enayai na wa fiabaifoi rorong fosa, ampefe Niari wanangfoi siayai na nunei, wedaya merehafoi arahi de siru. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Mereha urengfoi kiai na kahofa rorongfo tiapasa sabi toyaifoi, tuti rahutu wedua mereha ureng na rorafaisi tiapasa sabi to nunei, nani Allai kifeia kiai. Tuti metangno fiabai miungna yubatai nani fiotourai, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />ainanaya merehafoi siru kuteai. Ampefe na rahida piaring piarua sura (150) fo kai nanai, merehafoi siru aha. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Na embai bo itufoi na rahida suraya itufoi, wa fiabaifoi sayari na uai Ararati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Paria embai bo surafoi, na rahida reantenangfoi mani merehafoi siru aha, ampefe uai daidai nuwowongfo kawaraifa.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Rahida piaru (40) fo kai mani, Noki fiai suwirei bei na wa fiabaifoi, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />tuti sawingno romu rawei manei sifoa, wape romufoi wiro daraberahi to wa fiabaifoi kaha, mae sifo towana toninai paria merehafoi sirua kiai. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Mayeai Noki sawing nari romu muntung manei sifo aha, we deitawang kariri merehafoi siruane ete bererie. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Manamo romu muntungfoi wiro sobu katai feai we minohi naya kaha, weo merehafoi siru weru nunei kaharai, ampefe daraberahi to wa fiabaifoi aha ma, ainanaya Noki si warangfoa yu romufoi tuti kiari to wa fiabaifoi rorongfo afui. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Noki demang rahida itu aha mani, sawing nari romu muntungfoi sifo aha. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Rerai we diru mani, romu muntungfoi daraberahi to wa fiabaifoi we Noki aha ma, tuti kiritawang ai saituni reraung weworu bei na borongfo. Na tonanafo Noki deitawanai we merehafoi rerai we sirua kiai to.<verse eid="GEN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Mayeai Noki demang rahida itu aha mani, sawing nari romu muntungfoi aha, wape romufoi wiro daraberahi wei aha ma kaha. <verse eid="GEN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Na kutu Noki ne fuina piaring we wonang boyari (601) foi, na rahida bo reantenang na embai bo reantenangfoi mani, merehafoi sirua kiai weru nuneia. Mayeai Noki fiai wa fiabaifoi nuwowongfo weai tuti deti wari boriaifo, amani detio kahofa nuwowongfo rerai we sarahiai. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Na rahida bo piareia itu (27) foi, na embai bo borufoi nanai, nunei sirahiai sentenangna.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Ainanaya Allai medu we Noki deyo, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Bariai to boriei weru wa fiabaiwai, wau, nemu wiwingwai, nemu arikang mantoruwa tuti itone wiwingwa sitoru. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Andowa fubao enayai na wa fiabaiwai ria wau nanisa, tuti fidarangwai kiai, amani romuwasa tuti andowao enayai na rei reisa, era kiai to boriei ria wau, ambori etawing separai bitoya tuti esefa nunei.”<verse eid="GEN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Ainanaya Noki dariai to boriei weru wa fiabaifoi, i tuti ne wiwingfoi, ne arikang mantorufo tuti itone wiwingfo sitoru. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Romufosa kiai, andowa rei reisi kiai, tuti fi darangno enayai na wa fiabaifoi ria Noki fo, era kiai to boriei kariri euremifo.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Ainanaya Noki niari mesba bei we Yahwei. Na andowa tuti romu mano wiro ewerarika kahafo, kia mansiawarai kariri euremifo, miungsa we korbani nunumi na mesbafoi we Yahwei.<figure style="fig" file="HK00251C.TIF" size="col" ref="8:20">Mesba</figure> <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Na kutuo Yahwei niuna korbanifo nunsai mampori tonanafo, Medu na enerorong deyo, “Yau wiro yeikanggani nunei ahang kahai, masino inontarainesa, enemitituai ne karirafo pampang na kutu etarangfo. Tuti Yau wiro imung fidarangnei kiai wioru kaha, kariri neo arahi Inari ararafangnai nina. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Na nunei niayai pampang tonina mani, rahida we tanang fi tuti rahida we eting fi, rahida we danunanang tuti rahida we maninggapoi, rahida we munudang tuti rahida we metang, diru tuti rahidafo, fi nini kiai nayai pampang wiro fiotoura kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Allai ne kaiwo Arerai ria Noki tuti fi darangnei kiai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Ainanaya Allai mioangno Noki tuti ne arikang mantorufo mae medu we itoru deyo, “Muntorawing separai bitoya we muntosefa nunei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">Nun. 1:28</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Romu urengnei kiai, andowanesa kiai na rei reisi tuti diangnesa kiai na rawanang rausi, ea kiai ematai muntoru paria. Ambori munto wemambiriu sau ea. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Fi darang nani kiai ambori we fiang we mea. Netarai kariri fi tifuo reraung kehe Yohongni na fafongpa, fi nani kiai Yohongni we mea. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Wape fiangno wiro metang kaha mani, taraio werikafo, weo arangfoi niayai na rikafoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Im. 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Ul. 12:16</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Wape we mene rikawa mani, mandoni kontai, inontarai ete andowa, mano miung inontarai mani, Yau ambori Yohong aiboi mararehafo wei ki. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Weo Allai niari inontarainei kariri mantauni. Mandoni dino warang rikao inontarai manei mani, wenani kontai ambori inontarai siai manei wararika soi ki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Nun. 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kel. 20:13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Tuti we mea, metawing separai bitoya ambori mene ririawai sefa nunei sentenang wiro atoafong soi kaha.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">Nun. 1:28</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Mayeai Allai medu we Noki tuti ne kaisung mantorufo deyo, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Muntotarami ma, nehu kaiwo arerai Yohongnai we muntoru tuti muntone ririanei, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />tuti fidarang kiaio enayai ria mea nanisa, amani romuwasa, andowa enayai na rei reisa, amani mano dariai ria mea na wa fiabaiwai. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Nehu kaiwo arera we mea finina, na ninai tofongna mani, Yau wiro inari foa fiabai bei ahang kaha we Imung fidarangnei kiai na nunei.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Mayeai Allai medu deyo, “Fio we fiainawiai watai we numainu kariri Nehu kaiwo areraio Yohongnai we mea tuti fi darangnei kiai mani, <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Inari ewi bei netarai toyario afai na rorafaisi we fiainawiai kariri Nehu kaiwo arerai we nunei. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Masino Itabung rorafaisi na kafafe kehubang we wemetang, wape ewifoi kiawariai mani, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />Arohuo Nehu kaiwo arerai Yohongnai we mea ninai, amani we mea tuti fidarangnei kiai, weo wiro Yohong foa fiabai bei we miung nunei awao wioru kaha. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Masino Yeti ewifoi kiawariai na kafafefo mani, Arohuo Nehu kaiwo areraio watai we numainufo, na Yau tuti fidarangnei kiai na nunei.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Ampefe Allai medu we Noki deyo, “Tonanaifa fiainawiaio Yohongnai kariri Nehu kaiwo arerane we fidarangnei kiai na nunei finana.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noki tuti ne arikang mantorufo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Noki ne kaisungno itohawariai riati na wa fiabaifoi mani, Semi, Yafeti tuti Hami. Hami mani Kanani ne dai dine. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Noki ne kaisung mantorune itone ririanei dino sefarai na nufi sentenang ninai.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Noki mani, inontarai dohong romi dine, andino reantenang parifo niari romi angguri ne. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Rahida bei dunung anggurifoia meyeru nanai, dena arora na ne yawa tendafoi. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Ainanaya Hami, dai we Kanani fosa, detio tamang Noki we wiatai dena arora nanai, da toboriai deisaharai we netafuai suru. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Ampefe Semi tuti Yafeti uka ireu rowei, urohongni sawai na uwarami biawafo, ainanaya ura kurumifui afui, mae uwati berahai tuti utabung wedua utamamifoi ne mamayafo.<verse eid="GEN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Na kutu Noki ureng marandingfo, taraoai we fianai aino ne kaisung fuifoi niari wei tonanafo, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />medu deyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">“Yeikanggani Kanani!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">Kadono i ambori wewomingno tewawa paria we ne doroi weifosa.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Tuti Noki medu aha deyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">“Fayai feai we Yahwei, Allai mano Semi somi weifoi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Wape Kanani ambori wewoming we Semi.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Kadono Allai mioang Yafeti na dohong katai bitoya wei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Kadono ne ririafoi eminohi ria Semi ne ririafoi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">Wape Kanani ne ririafoi ewewoming we Yafeti ne ririafoi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Foa fiabaifoia kiaia mani, Noki minohi darang fuina piaring we betoru piarua sura (350) aha. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Ampefe Noki mireha na ne fuina piaring we indeata piarua sura (950).<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Semi, Yafeti tuti Hami itone ririafoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Noki ne kaisung mantoru mani, Semi, Yafeti tuti Hami itone ririafoi mani sonina. Na foa fiabaifoi sirua kiai mani, itone kaisung manea kontai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1Taw. 1:5-23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Yafeti ne ririafoi mani sonina. Yafeti dawingno Gomeri, Magoki, Madai, Yawani, Tubali, Meseki tuti Tirasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Tuti Gomeri dawingno Askenasi, Rifati, tuti Togarmai. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Mae Yawani dawingno Elisai, Tarsisi, Kitimi tuti Dodanimi. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Yawani ne riria nini saino ewe kaiwasa mano enayai na nafarengfo tuti wenufo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nafareng tuti we nu watai na katai wonong fino, Rawanang Rabuang.</char></note> Yafeti ne ririfoi kiai mano eminohi na ene katai kariri ene ririafoi, ene kaiwo tateraifa tuti ene kaiwasa tateraifa.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Hami ne ririafoi mani sonina. Hami dawingno Kusi, Misraimi, Puti tuti Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Kusi ne arikang fosa mani, Sebai, Hawilai, Sabtai, Raemai tuti Sabtekhai. Raemai ne ririafoi mani, Syebai tuti Dedani.<verse eid="GEN 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kusi ne arikang mang manei aha, wonong fino Nimroti, andino reantenang parifo mani weinontarai ne mambiriu we yu parenta na nunei. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />I mani inontaraio wewonong sera we andowa terirai we miungsa, tuti wemambiriu paria weo Yahweh fiatari fefe. Nanai aino inontaraine emadu we manei mani eteyo, “Kadono Yahwei niari wau we inontaraio wewonomu we mung andowa terirai kariri Nimroti.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Andino we mananu reantenang pari weparenta bendari Babeli, Erekhi tuti Akati, bendari nanai na kahofa Sineari. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Na Sineari, Nimroti da to Asyuri, na wanai biaung bendari Niniwe, Rehobot-Iri, Kalahi <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />tuti Reseni, bendari nini wiatai rahang bendari Niniwe tuti Kalahi. Bendari nanai kai mani bendario baba fine. <verse eid="GEN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misraimi ne ririafosa mani, inontarai Ludimi fosa, Anamimi fosa, Lehabimi fosa, Naftuhimi fosa, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Patrusimi fosa, Kasluhimi fosa tuti Kaftorimi fosa. Na inontarai nini saino eweriria we inontarai Filistini fosa ne.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanani ne kaisung mandu mani, Sidoni tuti Heti. Mayeai Sidoni tuti Heti une ririafoi mani, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />Yebusi fosa, Amori fosa, Girgasi fosa, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Hewi fosa, Arki fosa, Sini fosa, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Arwadi fosa, Semari fosa tuti inontarai Hamati fosa. Kanani ne riria ninisa eha tatesa wairoi. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Ene kataifo mani, na Sidoni to do wanang sai foi to Gerari kefang we Gasa. Tuti to do wanang murangfoi to Sodomi, Gomorai, Admai, tuti Seboimi, kefang we Lasa. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Ampefe Hami ne ririafoi dinani, eaino eminohi na ene katai kariri ene ririafoi, tuti ene kaiwo tateraifa.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Semi mani, Yafeti ne tahafuai dine. Semi nini mani inontarai Eberi fosa ene wereng dine. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Semi ne kaisung fosa mani, Elami, Asyuri, Arpakhsati, Ludi tuti Arami. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Arami ne kaisung fosa mani, Usi, Huli, Geteri tuti Masi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arpakhsati dawingno Selahi, tuti Selahi dawingno Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eberi ne kaisung mandu amani, manei wonong fino Peleki, weo rabuang bo saubaunungfo mani, inontarai na nunei ehatatesa, tuti mano fui foi mani wonong fino Yoktani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yoktani dawingno Almodadi, Selefi, Hasar-Maweti tuti Yerahi, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadorami, Usali, Diklai, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali, Abimaeli, Syebai, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofiri, Hawilai tuti Yobapi. Yoktani ne arikang sainanai kiai. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Inontarai ninisa enayai na Mesai paria sobu katai we uai na Sefari, do wanang murangfoi. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Ampefe Semi ne ririafoi dinani, eaino eminohi na ene katai kariri ene ririafoi, tuti ene kaiwo tateraifa.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Tonanaifa riria na Noki ne kaisung mantorufo. Tuti ehatatesa towana tonina na nunei, na kutu foa fiabaifoi sirufo. Inontarai nini saino ewe riria we kaiwasa sentenang na nufi nina.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Menara Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Rabuang bonani mani, inontarai sentenang na nunei ene kaiwo boyari tuti kaiwo emadurafo mai. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Mayeai eraiwariai paria sobu do wanang murangfoi, era wa esobu katai we enang bei na Sineari, ampefe enayai na nanaia. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Emadu wawerasa eteyo, “Merama taha kahofa ura feai tanari kamiei bata tuti tanunungna mutubaru.” Ampefe kamiei batafo we enari munu nayai tuti aspalifo we etaha kamiei batafo nayai. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Kontai emadu eteyo, “Merama tabaung bendari bei tuti tanari menara bei dedai ayai sobu rorafaisi, tuti merama tasera we tawonomi, ambori wiro tahatate tata towana tonina fanai.” <figure style="fig" file="CO00638C.TIF" size="col" ref="11:4">Menara Babeli ebauni</figure><verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Ainanaya Yahwei biari meu we deti bendari tuti menara inontaraifosa ebaunifoi, <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />tuti Yahwei medu deyo, “Oh, inontarai ninisa mani ene nu boyari tuti kaiwo boyari. Tuti arahi fio reantenang etamai tuti enari finina, ampefe na ninai to fongna mani fianai aino enemitituaitai we enarifo mani, enari kariria rai. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Neo mahikai mani Tobiari aweu tofobabera ene kaiwofoi, ambori ewe bonggoi, ampefe emadu wawerasa mani wiro eteitawang ene kaiwofoi ahang kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Na katai nani Yahwei niarisa ehatatesa to nunei sentenang, ampefe wiro ebaung bendarifoi ahang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Nanai wedaya mani bendari nani wonong fino Babeli, weo na katai nani Yahwei fiobabera kaiwo inontarai nunei sentenang, tuti na nanai Yahwei kiatatesa to nunei sentenang.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Semi ne ririafoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Semi ne ririafoi mani sonina. Foa fiabaifoi kiai, wefuina boru aha mani, Semi ne fuina piaring (100), i dawingno arikang mang manei wonong fino Arpakhsati.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1Taw. 1:24-27</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Semi sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Arpakhsati saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Semi ne fuina piaring we ring (500) aha. <verse eid="GEN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Na kutu Arpakhsati ne fuina piareia suraya ring (35) mani, dawingno Selahi. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Arpakhsati sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Selahi saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Arpakhsati darang ne fuina piaring we bea botoru (403) aha. <verse eid="GEN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Selahi ne fuina piareia sura (30) mani, dawingno arikang mang manei wonong fino Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Selahi sobu arikang mang tuti wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Eberi saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Selahi darang ne fuina piaring we bea botoru (403) aha. <verse eid="GEN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eberi ne fuina piareia suraya boa (34) mani, dawingno arikang mang manei wonong fino Peleki. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Eberi sobu arikang mang tuti arikang wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Peleki saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Eberi darang ne fuina piaring we bea piareia sura (430) aha. <verse eid="GEN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Na kutu Peleki ne fuina piareia sura (30) mani, dawingno arikang mang manei, wonong fino Rehui. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Peleki sobu arikang mang tuti arikang wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Rehui saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Peleki darang ne fuina piaring we beru indeata (209) aha. <verse eid="GEN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Na kutu Rehui ne fuina piareia suraya boru (32) mani, dawingno arikang mang manei wonong fino Seruki, <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Rehui sobu arikang mang tuti arikang wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Seruki saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Rehui darang ne fuina piaring we beru itu (207) aha. <verse eid="GEN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Na kutu Seruki ne fuina piareia sura (30) mani, dawingno arikang mang manei wonong fino Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Seruki sobu arikang mang tuti arikang wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Nahori saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Seruki darang ne fuina piaring we beru (200) aha. <verse eid="GEN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Na kutu Nahori ne fuina piareia indeata (29) mani, dawingno arikang mang manei wonong fino Terai. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Nahori sobu arikang mang tuti arikang wiwing manea aha. Tuti na kutu Terai saubaunung kawuruampo mani, Nahori darang ne fuina piaring suraya indeata (119) aha. <verse eid="GEN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Na kutu Terai ne fuina piatorua sura (70) mani, dawingno arikang mang mantoru amani, Abrami, Nahori tuti Harani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Terai ne ririafoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Terai ne ririafoi sonina. Terai dawingno Abrami, Nahori tuti Harani. Harani dawingno Loti. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Terai minohi darang mae Harani mireha fafongna. Harani mireha na ne katai saubaunung nai foi, amani Ur-Kasdimi. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abrami dauo Saraii tuti Nahori dauo Milkai. Milkai tuti Yiskai mani Harani ne arikang suruine. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Saraii kirawahi wiro wearikang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Terai kia ne arikangno Abrami tuti tufumangno Loti, Harani antungfoi tuti urawingno Saraii, Abrami binengfoi. Kiasa era weru Ur-Kasdimi, era to Kanani. Wape erawa sobu kahofa Harani mani enayai na nanaia. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tuti na Harani Terai mireha, tete ne fuina piaring we boru ring (205).<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Yahwei sahu Abrami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Na rahida bei Yahwei medu we Abrami deyo, “Ro weru nemu katainei, weru nemu teranesa tuti weru tamamu ne mununei, ro to kataio ambori Yeinawi we wau foi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:2-3">Kis. 7:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:8">Ibr. 11:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Yau ambori inari nemu ririanei bitoya tuti we kaiwasa fiabai. Yau ambori imoang wau tuti inari wau wewonomu tuti wau we moang. <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Yau ambori imoang inontaraio emoang wau fosa, tuti Yeikanggani inontarai mano eteikanggani wau fosa. Tuti na wau, ambori imoang kaiwasa na doni kontai na nunei.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal. 3:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Mayeai Abrami da weru Harani kariri fianai aino Yahwei medurai weifo, tuti Loti da riati kontai. Abrami ne fuina piatorua suraya ring (75) mani da weru Harani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abrami da to nu Kananifoi mani, kia ne wiwingno Saraii, anomangno Loti, tuti ne ra minohi tutirafo kai tuti ne womingno kiasa na Haranifo.<verse eid="GEN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Tuti erawa esobu Kananifo mani, Abrami tuti mano era riati fosa, erawari katai nani paria sobu ai Tarbantini na More, amani kefang we Sikemi. Rabuang bonani mani inontarai Kanani fosa enayai na katai nani. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Mayeai Yahwei deinawi netarai we Abrami tuti medu wei deyo, “Kataio ambori Yohongni we nemu ririanei dinini.” Ainanaya Abrami biaungno mesba bei na nanai we Yahwei mano deinawi netarai wei kawurua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kis. 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:16">Gal. 3:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Mayeai na nanai da pari to weuaifo na Beteli do wanang murangfoi. Biaung ne yawa tendafoi rahangnai na bendari Beteli tuti bendari Ai. Beteli na do wanang fuifoi tuti Ai na do wanang murangfoi. Ainanaya biaung mesba bei we Yahwei na nanai tuti somi we Yahwei. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Mayeai Abrami tuti mano era riati fosa, era nariai aha, erafo waroi aha to kahofa Negepi.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrami na nu Mesirifoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Rabuang bo kahari fiabaifoi miung katai nanifo, Abrami da to nu Mesirifoia niayai na nanai weinontarai aisei, paria sobu kaharifoi kiai. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Na kutu da wa sobu nu Mesiri foi nanai, medu we Saraii deyo, “Iwaitawanai we wau mani wiwingno uremu mahikai paria. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Masino inontarai Mesiri fosa ewati wau mani ambori eteyo, ‘Inontaraifoi ne wiwing diwani.’ Ampefe nana mani ambori emung yau, wape etawing wau barang. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Ampefe modu boyo wau mani nehu tahatui di wau, ambori enari sua yau tuti wiro emung yau kaha, weo wau fefe.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:2">Nun. 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Tuti nanai antu kaririai, Abrami suai to nu Mesirifoi afui nanai, inontarai Mesiri fosa ewati Saraii we urengfo mahikai paria. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Tuti na kutu mananu Mesirifoi ne inontarai erufi wei fosa ewati Saraii tonanafo efiai na mananu Firauni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Firauni mani wang we mananu Mesiri. Wiro wonong tera fine kaha.</char></note> arongfo, ampefe mananufoi demi inontarai eha Saraii to munu mananufoia. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Mananu Firauni dohong sua Abrami na mai paria, weo enerorongfoi dohong we Saraii fefe, tuti Abrami sobu fiahung, kambing, domba, sapi, keledai mang tuti keledai wiwing, unta, tuti sobu woming mang tuti wiwing manea. <figure style="fig" file="LB00039C.TIF" size="col" ref="12:16">Unta</figure><verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Wape Yahwei dohong fimaninang kerira bitoya paria we Firauni, tuti inontarai mano enayai na munu mananufoi, weo kiao Abrami binengno Saraii fefe. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Ainanaya Firauni sahu Abrami ma medu wei deyo, “Todonie nari yau toninai nina? We fianie wiro boisaharai we i mani nemu wiwing dine kahai nina? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />We fianie modu boyo nemu tahatui dine, wedaya ikari we nehu wiwing nina? Nemu wiwingfi dinini, kari mau tuti mura!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Ainanaya Firauni demi inontarai maneiru teai etadung Abrami, ne wiwingfoi tuti ne fianggengfoi kiai, we era to boriai weru Mesiri.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Abrami tuti Loti ukatate suru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Ampefe Abrami da weru Mesiri to kahofa Negepi aha, i tuti ne wiwingfoi, ne inontaraifosa tuti ne fianggengfoi kiai. Loti da riati kontai. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abrami ne ra bitoya paria, ne fiahung bitoya, peraki tuti emasi bitoya kontai. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Da na katai bei to katai bei aha, na kahofa Negepi paria kefang we Beteli aha. Katai fafong nanai biaung ne yawa tenda reantenangfoi nai, wiatai rahang Beteli tuti Ai. <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />I fafong nanai biaung mesbafoi kontai nai. Na katai nani dino fafong nanai Abrami somi we Yahwei ne.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Loti da ria Abrami. I kontai ne fiahung domba, sapi tuti ne inontarai mano enayai riati fosa. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Manamo kahofa nanai wiro fiabai demoyarai we uminohi ruhiai nai kaha, weo une fianggeng bitoya paria. Donio wiro umaya we unayai ruhia kaha. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Ampefe Abrami ne mantahung fiahungfosa tuti Loti ne fosa, emamuna wawerasa. Rabuang bonani mani inontarai Kanani fosa tuti inontarai Ferisi fosa, enayai kontai na katai nani.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Ampefe Abrami medu we Loti deyo, “Dohonao tune mantahungnesa emamuna wawerasa fe, weo turu mani rika fifau paria. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Boti katai ninai fuba we wau kahae? Ne mahikai mani tukatate turu. Masino ro to dowei mani, ira to domoya, ete ro to domoya mani, ira to dowei.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Ainanaya Loti fioai ureng deti wari kataifoi sentenang, tuti deti enangno Yardeni we ne mereha bitoya paria sobu Soari. Netarai toyari Yahwei ne romifoi, ete toyari kahofa na Mesiri, Na kutu Yahwei wiro meikanggani Sodomi tuti Gomorai kaharai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:10">Nun. 2:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Ampefe Loti diri enangno Yardeni sentenang wei, ainanaya deunaung weru Beteli to do wanang murangfoi. Na tonanafo Abrami tuti Loti ukatate surua. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abrami niayaia pepayai na kahofa Kanani foi, mae Loti niayai na bendario watai na enang Yordani foi, tuti biaung ne yawa tendafoi kefang we bendari Sodomi. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Wape inontarai Sodomi fosa enari karirafo paria tuti enari sasari we Yahwei.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Loti da weru Abrami kawurua nanafo, Yahwei medu we Abrami deyo, “Foai uremu boti wariaia, boti na katai boari nai nani, boti to do wanang murang tuti do wanang pui, to wanang ba tuti to wanang sai. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Katai fuba botioi nani ambori Yohongni sentenang we wau tuti nemu ririawai we fitawafa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kis. 7:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Tuti ambori Inari nemu ririawai bitoya toyari ninuaing. Ampefe masino manei wemambiriu we deto ninuaingfoi mani, wemambiriu kontai we deto afongso nemu ririafoi. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Ro wari kahofa nini, weo kahofa nini ambori Yohongni we wau ne.”<verse eid="GEN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Mayeaia mani, Abrami sota ne yawa tendafoi, da wa biaungni aha, na katai kefang we ai Tarbantinifo na Mamre, kefang we Hebroni. Ainanaya biaungno mesba bei we Yahwei na nanai.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Abrami kia Loti weru ne aitetafosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Na kutu Abrami niayai na Mamre mani, mananu mana eweboyari we emamuna amani, Amrafeli mananu Sineari foi, Ariokhi mananu Elasari foi, Kedorlaomeri mananu Elami foi tuti Tideali mananu Goyimi foi. <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />Mananu ewemana ninisa emamuna we mananu ewering amani, Berai mananu Sodomi foi, Birsyai mananu Gomora foi, Syinabi mananu Admai foi, Syemeberi mananu Seboimi foi, tuti mananu na nu Belai foi, nu nini ahui kontai we Soari. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Mananu ewe ring ninisa eweboyari, era to enangno Sidimi. Enang nini dino fui ninai ahui we Rawanang Mireha ne. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Wiro eweboyari we emamuna kaharai, weo mananu Kedorlaomeri weparenta sau ea wairoi fuina suraya boru (12). Wape na fuina bo suraya botoru (13) foi, wiro emaya we etohong kariri Kedorlaomeri ne parentafo kaha.<verse eid="GEN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Na fuina bo suraya boa (14) foi, Kedorlaomeri tuti mananu mantoru itoweboyari riatifo, era wa emamuna. Emamuna awao etahatawang inontarai Refaimi fosa na Asyterot-Karnaimi, inontarai Susimi fosa na Hami, inontarai Emimi fosa na Syawe-Kiryataimi <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />tuti inontarai Hori fosa na ene katai weuaifo, amani wonong fino Seiri. Etawi inontarai Hori fosa pari to El-Parani kefang we katai wiarora wekamamieifoi. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Mayeai Kedorlaomeri tuti ne mananu eweboyari riatifosa era wariai, era wa sobu En-Mispati amani nu Kadesi foi, tuti na nanai emamunara etahatawang inontarai Amaleki fosa, tuti inontarai Amorio enayai na Haseson-Tamari fosa.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Ainanaya mananu na nu Sodomi foi, Gomora foi, Admai foi, Seboimi foi tuti mananu na nu Belai foi, amani ahui we nu Soari, emainenang ene afai mamunafosa tuti erawa emamuna na enang Sidimi. <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />Emamuna we Kedorlaomeri mananu Elami foi, Tideali mananu Goyimi foi, Amrafeli mananu Sineari foi tuti Ariokhi mananu Elasari foi. Ampefe mananu mana emamuna we mananu ring.<verse eid="GEN 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Na enang Sidimi nani, na doni kontai obu kamirei aspalifo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kamirei ninai sefang na aspalio meninggapoi.</char></note>. Na kutu mananu Sodomi tuti mananu Gomora foi tuti une afai mamuna fosa ewawu ene tarai nanai, afai mamunafo manea etaukaha kamirei nanai. Tuti manea siai ewawu ene tarai to weuaifo. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Fi kiai na Sodomi tuti Gomora foi amani ene ra tuti fiangfo, Kederlaomeri tuti ne mananu mano eweboyari riati fosa etawarai kai, ainanaya erawa. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Kontai eha Loti, Abrami ne tahatuifoi ne kaisungfoi, tuti ne fianggeng fuba minohi tutirifoi ehari erawa. Weo Loti minohi na Sodomi fefe.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Mayeai inontarai wewu ne tarai manei da wa deisaharai we Abrami inontarai Iberani foi, kariri fi fuba kiawariai nani. Rabuang bonani Abrami niayai kefang we ai Tarbantinifo na Mamrei. Kahofa ninai inontarai Amori mano wonong Mamrei ne kahofa fine. Mamrei, Eskoli tuti Aneri itowe mambetahatui, itoru mani Abrami ne maniwowirio, itoweboyari riati. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Na kutu Abrami taraoai we ne kaisungfoi etafuri tonanafo, fianduhi ne inontaraio esawai we emamunafosa, amani mano etaubau enumi na ne munu rorongfo. Efaufo ewe piaring we betoru suraya indeatoru (318). Ainanaya etawi ene aitetafosa, amani mananu manafo paria sobu Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Dirua mani, Abrami deto ne inontarai fosa we rabuang beiru teai, ambori erawa emamuna we ene aitetafosa, tuti etahatawangsa. Inontarai mano ewawu enetaraifosa, Abrami tuti ne inontaraifosa etawisa pari to Hoba na Damsyiki do wanang ba foi. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Abrami tuti ne inontaraifosa, eha fianggengno ene aitetafosa etawarai nanai aha ma. Tuti eha Loti, Abrami ne kaisungfoi tuti ne fianggengfo eha nariai aha ma. Kontai eha wiwing tuti inontarai siaio etafusa fosa.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melkisedeki mioang Abrami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Na kutu Abrami daraberahi na mamuna rorongno sahatawang Kedorlaomeri tuti mananu eweboyari riatifosa tonanai ma fo, mananu Sodomi da wa demang wei na enang Syawei, amani enang esahui kontai we Enang Mananufoi.<verse eid="GEN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Mananu siai manei amani, Melkisedeki mananu Salemi foi, kia roti feai tuti angguri we Abrami. I mani Allai Mano Dedai Sewafoi ne imami dine kontai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:1-10">Ibr. 7:1-10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Ainanaya mioang Abrami deyo, “Kadono Allai Mano Dedai Sewanei, Mano Niari rorafaisi tuti nunei Mioang wau, <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />tuti fayai feai we Allai Mano Dedai Sewanei, Andino sawing nemu aitetanesa to waramurorongfe ne.” Ainanaya Abrami dohong sepersepuluh na fi kiafo kai we Melkisedekia.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Mayeai mananu Sodomi foi medu we Abrami deyo, “Bohongno nehu inontaraiwasa ma, wape fianggeng ka werusa ma fo, ka we waua.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Manamo Abrami medu we mananu Sodomi foi deyo, “Ifafora na Yahwei, amani Allai Mano Dedai Sewa foi, mano Niari rorafaisi tuti nunei, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />weo wiro ika sobu fi kuteai na nemu ra etawaraio ika nariai aha ma nina kaha. Masino banang rea kuteai ete wai sandali rea kuteai kontai ki, wiro imaya we ika kaha. Ambori wiro boyo, ‘Yau yohongna mani Abrami ne ra bitoya wanai.’ <figure style="fig" file="LB00161C.TIF" size="col" ref="14:23">Wai sandali</figure> <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />We yau mani todoni kontaio nana fanai! Manta tarahio fianai aino nehu inontarainesa etangna fo nanai aino we nehu ne. Wape nehu maniwowirio ameweboyari nesa amani, Aneri, Eskoli tuti Mamrei, ansaino bohong enengwa.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Allai ne Kaiwo Arerai dohongnai we Abrami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Mayeai Yahwei medu we Abrami na fiainawiai bei we detioi, deyo, “Abrame mutai fanai. Yau ambori iwe foti we wau, tuti ambori Yohong fiembaitai fuba we wau ki.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Wape Abrami yoa we Yahwei deyo, “O Yahweh Alla, we fianie Bohong fiembaitai fuba we yau? Yau ambori imereha rai, tuti nehu pari arikang. Nana mani nehu mangfata Elieseri inontarai Damsyiki foi andino ambori sobu nehu ra iminohi tutirafo ne.”<verse eid="GEN 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Abrami medu aha deyo, “Wau wiro bohong riria we yau kaha, donio nehu mangfatanei andino ambori sobu nehu ra iminohi tutira ne ki.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Wape Yahwei medu wei aha deyo, “Bereri, wiro nemu mangfatawai kaha, mae nemu arikang bawing teriwai andino ambori bohong nemu ra wai wei ki.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Ainanaya Yahwei Demi Abrami da to boriei na ne yawa tendafoi tuti Medu wei deyo, “Boti to rorafaisi, masino wemambiriu we boto awaha fuba niayai na rorafaisi mani, botoria.” Tuti Yahwei medu aha deyo, “Nemu ririanei ambori bitoya tonanai ki.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:18">Rm. 4:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:12">Ibr. 11:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Ainanaya Abrami yoaso Yahwei, ampefe na tonanafo Yahwei detori we inontarai mesi dine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rm. 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal. 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yak. 2:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Tuti Yahwei medu wei aha deyo, “Yau mani Yahwei di Yau, Yauno ika wau to boriei weru nu Ur-Kasdimi we Yohong nu bonini we nemuni.” <verse eid="GEN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Ainanaya Abrami medu deyo, “O Yahweh Alla, todoni ambori iwaitawanai we nu bonini we nehuni ne?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Ampefe Yahwei medu wei aha deyo, “Ka sapi wiwingno ne fuina botoru manei, kambing wiwingno ne fuina botoru manei, domba mangno ne fuina botoru manei, romu afurang manei tuti romu muntung antung manei, andowa wasa kasa we Yau ma.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Ainanaya Abrami kia andowa nanisa we Yahweia. Sapi, kambing tuti domba biau sitoru we berurutiai, sanaia watai riruhiai, wape romufo suru mani wiro biau suru kaha. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Romu rawei fosa esifo ma eminohi we etang andowa tariraifo, manamo Abrami datasa.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Na kutu wofoi rerai we sawai nanai, Abrami denawa seo. Na tantuma mamantiti kapuruyai dohong matai foi soruia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:13">Ayb. 4:13</ref>,<ref loc="JOB 4:14">14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Yahwei medu we Abrami deyo, “Boitawanaifa weo nemu ririanei ambori ewe inontarai aisei na inontarai siai ene nu bei ki, nuo wiro eneni kaha. Ea ambori ewewoming tuti inontarai fosa na kataifoi enari kangganisa paria fuina piaring we bea (400).<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-14">Kel. 1:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:6">Kis. 7:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Wape kaiwasa mano enari nemu ririafoi ewewomingfo mani, ambori Yohong aiboifo wesa ki. Tuti mayeaia mani, nemu ririafoi ambori era to boriei weru nu nani tuti eha fianggeng bitoya paria.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40-41">Kel. 12:40-41</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:7">Kis. 7:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Wape wau na rahida bo munohia weinongkutungfo, ro to raimeri ria nemu werengfosa na mai. Tuti ambori esarai wau ki. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Wape nemu riria bo boafoi ambori etaraberasa to ninai aha ma ki. Weo na kutu ninai inontarai Amori nesa wiro enari neo karirafo fuba kaharai. Ampefe wiro rahida neungfo mai we Yohong aiboi wesa kaharai, we era to boriai weru katai nini kaharai.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Na kutu wofoi sawaia tuti mamantitia, na tantuma wawu weriraung bei tuti antironi denggararu bei sea rahang andowa tariraifo. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Na rahida bonani dino Yahwei Dohong kaiwo arerai we Abrami, medu wei deyo, “We nemu ririanei dino Yohong katai nini wesa ne, amani na waya Mesiri foi paria sobu waya fiabaio Efrati.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kis. 7:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Kahofa ninai mani inontaraio Keni fosa, Kenasi fosa, Kadmoni fosa, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Heti fosa, Ferisi fosa, Refaimi fosa, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Amori fosa, Kanani fosa, Girgasi fosa tuti Yebusi fosa ene katai fine.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Hagari tuti Ismaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Na rabuang bonani Abrami niayai na kahofa Kanani foi fuina sura kawuruampa, wape ne wiwingno Saraii kirawahi. I ne woming wiwing manei wonong fino Hagari, inontarai Mesiri dine. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Ampefe Saraii medu we Abrami deyo, “Boitawanaifa weo Yahwei dohong arikang we yau kaha. Ampefe yohong nehu womingfoi bena riati, ambori minohituti arikang manei ambori ikari we yau.” Tuti Abrami niari kariri kaiwo Saraii medurafo. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Ampefe Saraii, Abrami ne wiwingfoi dohongno ne womingno Hagari wiwing Mesiri foi we Abrami ne wiwing. Na kutu nana mani Abrami niayai kawurua na Kanani fuina sura.<verse eid="GEN 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Mayeai Abrami dena ria Hagari, ampefe Hagari doama. Na kutu Hagari deitawanai we doamafo nanai, enerorong dedai tuti tarao Saraii ahang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Ampefe Saraii medu we Abrami deyo, “Fi Hagari niari we yau nina mani, nemu sarawa fine. Yauno yohongno nehu womingnei we waune, wape arahio deitawanai we doamafo nanai, wiro tarao yau ahang kaha. Kadono Yahwei Andino kiutu tune kaiwone.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Mayeai Abrami medu we Saraii deyo, “Taramuma, i mani nemu woming dine, wauno wemambiriu sauwine. Ampefe fianai aino enemutituatai mahikai mani, nari weia.” Ainanaya Saraii niari dadira bitoya paria we Hagari, donio wewu netarai weru Saraii.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Mayeai Yahwei ne wewai manei da wei na waya ureng bei kefang we katai wiarora wekamamieifoi, amani kefang we rang to Syuri. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Ainanaya medu we Hagari deyo, “Hagarie, Saraii ne womingne waune, ro na doni ma tuti bo ro to doni finina?” Hagari yoa we wewaifoi deyo, “Iwawu weru Saraii mano irufi weifoi.” <verse eid="GEN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Yahwei ne wewaifoi medu wei deyo, “Barabera wau we mano we woming wei foia, nari kariri fianaino demi wau we narifo.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Kontai Yahwei ne wewaifoi medu aha deyo, “Yau ambori inari nemu ririawai bitoya paria, ampefe ne bitoyafoi wiro ato afongsoi kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Yahwei ne wewaifoi medu wei aha deyo, “Kutu ninai wau boama ambori munohituti arikang mang manei. Bohongni wonong fino Ismaeli, weo Yahwei tarao nemu dadirafe ampa. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Nemu arikangwai ambori ne koangfoi netarai toyari keledaio terirai, i ambori dapa mandoni kontai ki, tuti ambori inontarai etapai kontai tonana. I kontai ambori dapa ne doroifosa.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Mayeai Hagari sahu Yahwei mano medu weifoi na wangno, “Wau mani El-Roi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">El-Roi na kaiwo Iberani mani Allai mano deti yau.</char></note>.” Weo enetituai deyo, “Tarai, we antanafa iwati Yahwei urengfo nayai na yau.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Nanai wedaya mani kamirei mereha nani inontarai esahui we kamirei merehao Lahai-Roi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lahai-Roi na kaiwo Iberani mani Mano darang we fitawafa foi deti yau.</char></note>. Kamirei mereha nini wiatai rahang Kadesi tuti Bereti.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Ainanaya Hagari minohituti arikang mang manei we Abrami, tuti Abrami dohongni wonong fino Ismaeli.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:22">Gal. 4:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Abrami ne fuina piara wonang (86) mani, Hagari minohituti Ismaeli.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Sunatifoi wefiainawiai kariri Allai ne Kaiwo Arerai we Abrami fo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Rabuang bo Abrami ne fuina piara suraya indeata (99) nanai, Yahwei Deinawi netaraifoi we Abrami tuti Medu wei deyo, “Yau mani Allai Mano Iwemambiriu Sewafoi di Yau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na kaiwo Iberani mani, El-Shaddai.</char></note>. Taramuo Yau tuti nari kariri Nehu awiane pampang. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Yau ambori Yohong nehu kaiwo arerafo na Yau tuti wau, tuti Inari nemu ririafoi bitoya paria.”<verse eid="GEN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Ainanaya Abrami disangkapa awebuka somi aweu urengfo disangso kahofawau, tuti Allai medu wei deyo, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Nehu kaiwo arerai Yohongnai we wau finina. Wau ambori we wereng we kaiwasa bitoyafoi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Ampefe ninaia mani wiro wonomu Abrami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abrami nana mani, Dai wewonong.</char></note> ahang kaha, mae wonomu fino Abrahami<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abrahami mani, Dai we kaiwasa bitoyafoi.</char></note>. Weo Iruai wau we dai we kaiwasa bitoyafoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Rm. 4:17</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Yau ambori Inari wau bawing separai, nemu ririafoi bitoya paria, tuti ewe kaiwasa bitoya, tuti na nemu ririanei ambori manea ewe mananu ki. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Yau ambori Yohong kaiwo arerafo na Yau tuti wau, tuti nemu riria bia we riria we fitawafa, ambori Yau iwe Allai we wau tuti we nemu ririafoi sentenang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:55">Luk. 1:55</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Nu munohi nai we inontarai aisei nini, amani nu Kanani foi ambori Yohongni sentenang we wau tuti nemu ririafoi we nemuni we fitawafa, tuti Yau ambori iwe Allai wesa.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kis. 7:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Allai medu we Abrahami aha deyo, “We wau mani, rutawang Nehu kaiwo areranea mutu, wau tuti nemu riria bia we riria. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Nehu kaiwo areraio rutawangnaia mutu mani, na wau tuti nemu ririanei mani tonina, inontarai mang mano etaubau enumi na nemu ririawai mani todoni kontaio ewe sunati.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Kis. 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:11">Rm. 4:11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Todoni kontaio wau we sunati, tuti fi nanai we fiainawiai kariri kaiwo arerai na Yau tuti wau. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Inontarai mangwasa kiai mano ene rahida indeatoru to yai, todoni kontaio ewesunati, amani mano nemu ririawai tuti mano wiro nemu riria kaha, wape etaubau enumi na nemu munu rorongwa ete worisa na doi ria inontarai asei fosa. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Ampefe mano etaubau enumi na nemu munu rorongwa tuti mano worisa na doi fosa todoni kontaio wesunati. Sunati nani we fiainawiai na mene taraiwai, we deinawi Nehu kaiwo areraio Yohongnai we meane watai we numainu. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Mano wiro niari kariri sunatifoi kaha mani, todoni kontaio metatari weru ne kaiwasa terafosa, weo niari kariri Nehu kaiwo arerane kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Mayeai Allai medu we Abrahami aha deyo, “Nemu wiwingno Saraii mani, wiro wahui na Saraii ahang kaha, wape na ninai tofongna mani wahui na Sarai, i wonong finana. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Yau ambori Imoangni ki tuti i ambori minohituti kaisung manei we wau ki, tuti ambori Imoangni kontai. Ampefe i ambori we ai we kaiwasanei kiai. Tuti na ne ririawai, ambori manea ewemananu ki.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Ainanaya Abrahami disangkapa awebuka somi aweu ureng disangso kahofa wau, tuti miri bororawa, medu na enerorong, “Taraie, manei ne fuina piaring (100) mani ne arikang ne? Tuti taraie Sarai na ne fuina piara sura (90) kawurua ninai minohituti arikang raie?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Ampefe Abrahami medu we Allai deyo, “Tonana mani, Ismaeli dino Roa wei we sobu nebengfo ria Wau.”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Wape Allai medu wei deyo, “Bereri! Mae nemu wiwingno Sarai ambori minohituti kaisung manei we wau, tuti bohongni wonong fino Isaki. Na i ambori Yohong Nehu kaiwo arerafo riati tuti kaiwo arerai nanai watai we numainu we ne ririafosa. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Wape we Ismaeli mani, butangnaifa fefe Iroa we nemu kaiwowa. I ambori Imoangni tuti Yohong ne riria bitoya paria tuti i ambori dawingno mananu suraya mandu (12). Yau ambori Inari ne ririafoi ewe kaiwasao bitoya ki. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Wape wiro Yohong kaiwo arera riati kaha. Nehu kaiwo arerane mani Yohongnai ria Isaki, nemu kaisungno Sarai minohitutiri we waufoi, na fuina bo da ahamafoi, toyari na kutu ninaifa.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Allai medu ria Abrahamia kai tonanafo, Da weruia.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Mayeai Abrahami sahu ne kaisungno Ismaeli tuti inontarai mangfosa mano etaubau enumi na ne munurorongfoi, tuti mano wiorisa na doi fosa kiai, na rahida nani kontaio wesunatisa kiai, kariri fianai aino Allai medurai weifo. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Na rabuang bo Abrahami wesunati nani mani tete ne fuina piara sura indeata (99) finana. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Tuti Ismaeli kontai wesunati nana mani ne fuina suraya botoru (13). <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Ampefe Abrahami tuti ne kaisung Ismaeli uwesunati ruhiai na rahida boyari, <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />kontai ne inontarai mang mano etaubau enumi na ne munurorongfoi, tuti mano wiorisa na doi fosa, ewesunati kiai ruhiai riati.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Allai medu ne arerafo aha we Dohong kaisung manei we Abrahami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Na rahida bei, Yahwei Deinawi ne taraifoi we Abrahami kefang we ai tarbantini na Mamrei. Rahida nani maninggapoi paria, ampefe Abrahami minohi na ne yawa tendafoi rahutu borongfo. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Na kutu fioai ureng nanai, na tantuma deti inontarai mantoru itoroari na ne yawa tenda refongfo. Deti itoru tonana fo, sikera da we sitorua. Ainanaya disangkapa awebuka somi aweu ureng disangso kahofa wau,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Ibr. 13:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />medu we itoru deyo, “Dai muntorune, masino muntomaya mani, wiro muntora fanai mae muntominohi ukai arafanai na ninai ria yau tuti ifata muntoru ki. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Ika mereha feai ma iruai muntoawemirengwa tuti muntominohi ukai na ai arowawahi ninai. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Mae imainenang fiang feai we muntorang, ambori muntone taraiwai wemambiriu aha, akawuru wori muntoreo muntora mani, ambori muntora ki. Weo dai muntora kawuru to nehu katai inayai nai nini ma fefe.” Ainanaya itomadu wei itoreyo, “Yo, tonana mani nari kariri fianai aino modurai nanaia.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Ainanaya Abrahami sikera da to ne yawa tendafoi afui, medu we Sarai deyo, “Wukahera! Ka tepung beng sewa fo saki bei tuti wukahera nari roti we bulati feai!” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Ainanaya Abrahami sikera da we ne fiahung fosara, kia sapi antungno netarai biriayai, tuti angni mani miaing manei we ne mangfatafoia we kiutuwi ambori yangni ahera. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Mayeai Abrahami kia ui fiahung sisasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ui enariri sisasa eparaise we etangni. </char></note> feai, ui batang feai tuti sapi taraio masa feai, kiara dohongnai watai na itoaromifo we itorang. Na kutu itorampifo, Abrahami doa rurang itoru na ai arowawahi fo.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Ainanaya itomadu itoreyo, “Nemu wiwing Sarai andi doni?” Yoa we sitoru deyo, “Andi wani, niayai na yawa tenda rorongfe fo.” <verse eid="GEN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Manei na sitoru medu we Abrahami deyo, “Taramuma, Yau ambori yarabera yau we wau ma, na fuina bo da ahamafoi. Na rahida bonani nemu wiwingno Sarai ambori sobu kaisung manei ki.” Na kutu nanai Sarai taradidau kaiwo itomadurafo, weo doari na yawa tenda rorongfo, na itokurumifo fefe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:9">Rm. 9:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Abrahami tuti Sarai uweinongkutungna tuti Sarai wiro deti fiwiwing ahang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Ampefe Sarai mirari tuti medu na enerorong deyo, “Todoni wori ausobu arikang manei we dohong faraise auru? Weo yau tuti nehu mangnei auweinongkutung ampa.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:6">1Ptr. 3:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Ainanaya Yahwei medu we Abrahami deyo, “We fiani Sarai mirari tuti medu deyo, ‘Taraie nehu arikang raie? Iwewiwingkutung na mae.’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Fianai aino dadira we Yahwei niari ne? Kariri fio antanafa imadurai kawurua nanai, amani fuina bo da ahamafoi, ambori Yarabera yau we wau ahama ki. Na rahida bonani Sarai ambori ne kaisung manei ki.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:37">Luk. 1:37</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Wape Sarai fefora deyo, “Wiro imiri kaha.” Weo mitai fefe. Wape Yahwei medu deyo, “Bereri, antanafa muri!”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrahami dutang Yahwei we dohong aiboio bendari Sodomi fanai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Ainanaya inontarai mantorufo itora wa tuti Abrahami datuti sitorua. Itora wa sobu katai bei, na katai nani itowati we bendari Sodomia. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Yahwei medu na enerorong deyo, “Fianai aino Yeyo Inari ninai, Yediwarai weru Abrahamia ne? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Weo Abrahami nini dino ne ririafoi ambori we kaiwasa fiabai tuti ewemambiriu, tuti na i ambori kaiwasa na nunei sentenang esobu moangfo. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Andino Yau yiriri we deunau ne arikangfosa tuti ne ririafosa kiai. Ambori enari kariri fianai aino Yeinawiai wesafo, na enari ne bengfo tuti etoa rahangnai. Donio Nehu kaiwo arerai Yohongnai we Abrahamifo ambori Yohong kaririai.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Mayeai Yahwei medu we Abrahami deyo, “Itarahuo kaiwo atua bitoya paria kariri inontarai Sodomi tuti Gomorai we ene karira enari fo, tuti tarai enari sasari bitoya paria. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Ampefe Ibiari aweu Iwati kariri fianai aino inontaraine emadurai pampang kariri inontarai na bendarifo nanai ambori Yeitawanaifa, wetarai tonana ete bereri e?”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Ainanaya inontarai mandu weifo suru ura to Sodomia, mae Abrahamifo doari ria Yahwei. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Abrahami doa kefangni tuti medu wei deyo, “Ampefe Boyo mungno inontaraio enari ne bengfosa ria inontarai mano enari karira fosara ne? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Masino Wobu inontarai ewe piarua sura (50) na bendari nani enari ne bengfo, nana mani Wau mei bendari nania wiorua ne? Tuti wiro Tawing bendari nani kaha e, weo inontarai ewe piarua sura (50) enari ne bengfo enayai na bendari nani? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Kadono Nari tonana fanai, wiro Mung inontarai mano enari ne bengfosa ria inontarai mano enari karira fosa fanai. Weo manta Wauno kutu kaiwo na Boarahanai we inontarainei kiai na nu fine.”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Yahwei yoa deyo, “Masino Isobu ewe piarua sura (50) enari ne bengfo na bendari Sodomi tonana mani, Yau wiro Imei bendari nania wioru kaha, weo inontarai ewe piarua sura (50) nanisa.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Abrahami medu aha deyo, “Boyai yau, weo iwemambiriu we imadu ria Sengne Wau, we yau mani manta kangganang di yau. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Masino Wobu inontarai ewe piarua ring (45) enari ne bengfo, na tonanafo Mei bendarifoia wiorua ne?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Yahwei yoa wei deyo, “Bereri, Yau wiro Imei bendari nania wioru kaha, masino Isobu inontarai ewe piarua ring (45) enari ne bengfo enayai na bendari nani.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Abrahami medu aha deyo, “Tofino masino Wobu inontarai ewe piaru (40) terai na wanaifa, nana mani todonie?” Yahwei yoa wei deyo, “Yau wiro Inari tonana kaha, weo inontarai ewe piaru (40) enayai na bendari nani.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Mayeai Abrahami medu aha deyo, “Seng, wiro Kosou fanai we imadu aha ninaifa ne. Masino Wobu inontarai ewe piareia sura (30) terai, nana mani tofino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Yahwei medu wei deyo, “Masino Isobu inontarai ewe piareia sura (30) teraifa mani, wiro Imei bendari nania wioru kahaifa.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Abrahami medu aha deyo, “Boyai nehu sarawaio iwemambiriu we yutangnai pampang aha ninai. Seng, masino Wobu inontarai ewe piarei (20) teraifa mani tofino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Seng yoa wei deyo, “Yau wiro Imei bendarifoia wioru kahaifa, masino Isobu inontarai ewe piarei (20) enayai na bendari nani.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Ainanaya Abrahami medu aha deyo, “Seng, wiro Kosou yau fanai, yutang berahai webeyari ninai terai aha. Masino Wobu inontarai ewesura (10) terai na bendarifoi, nana mani tofino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Seng yoa wei deyo, “Masino na bendarifoi Isobu inontarai ewe sura (10) terai mani, wiro Imei bendarifoia wioru kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Yahwei medua kai tonanai ria Abrahami nanai Da wa, tuti Abrahami kontai daraberahi to ne yawa tendafoi aha.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Yahwei niunung bendari Sodomi tuti Gomorai, mae Kia Loti kiaharai weru aiboi nani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Na kutu wewaifo suru ura weru Abrahami kawurua nanafo, ura paria sobu bendari Sodomi mani reraiwe dirua. Na kutu nana mani, Loti minohi na rahutu borong bendarifo, tuti deti suru nanai. Doabariri da weu surua, tuti disangkapa awebuka somi aweu ureng disangso kahofa wau, <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />mae medu deyo, “Dai muruine diru ampa. Ampefe mumaya mani mura to nehu munufoia. Muruai muawemiwa tuti murena kio aha kamiai wori mura pari aha ki.” Uroa we Loti ureyo, “Bento, aurena na katai kehabi boriei wanai ki.” <verse eid="GEN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Wape Loti denggewa suru paria, ampefe ura riati to ne munufoia. Mayeai meinenang fiang we suru, tuti niunung rotio weragi kaha feai dohongnai we suru, ainanaya wewaifo suru urangna.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Wape wewaifo suru urena kaharai, mang na bendari Sodomi fosa, na mano ewebariboai fosa paria sobu mano ewepaituang fosa, era kiaia etoawari Loti ne munufoi. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Ebibe esahu we Loti eteyo, “Inontarai mandu ura ma, urena na nemu mununei diru bonini, ansurui doni? Bohong suru we amea mandiei ambori amenai ria suru.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:22-24">Hak. 19:22-24</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Ainanaya Loti dariai ariei detisa, wape kife rahutufoi aha, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />tuti medu wesa deyo, “Doroi ne meai ne, wiro menari ne karira tonina ne fanai. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Metaramima, nehu kamitung mandune, wiro urena ria mang manei kaharai. Ansuruino kadono yohong suru we mea mau we menari suru todoni kariri mene metawia wa. Wape wiro menari ne karira feai we inontarai ura ma uminohi ria yau ne suru fanai. Weo todoni kontaio yauno yemang wedua suru.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Manamo ebibe we Loti eteyo, “Ro weruai!” Emadu we manei to manei aha eteyo, “Inontarai nini mani inontarai aisei da ma minohi na tane katainei, andino deyo kiutu kaiwo we tata re? Ro weruai ahera, mae bereri mani, ambori amenari kanggani wau maraba sewa inontarai manduo uminohi ria wau nini suru ki.” Ainanaya etuangsaya Loti to dowei tuti etawangpasa rahutufoi we inontaraifo suru afui. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Manamo wewaifo suru uwarami ariei urabi Loti to rorong afui tuti ukafe rahutufoia. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Mayeai unari inontarai mano era ma etoari na boriei na Loti ne munufoi, na mano ewebariboai fosa paria sobu mano ewepaituang fosa euremifo kabe. Donio erurai esera we rahutufoi wape wiro esobu rahutufoi ahang kaha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:18">2Raj. 6:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Ainanaya wewaifo suru umadu we Loti ureyo, “Nemu tera manei na bendari nini konta ne? Uramu ete nemu kaisung ete nemu kamitung ete mano mene rika fifau foi na bendari nini mani, kasa mera to boriei weruai. <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />Weo bendari nini ambori aumeiria wioru rai, weo kawurua Yahwei tarao kaiwo atua bitoya kariri ne karira inontarai na bendari nini enarifo ampa. Nanai wedaya Yahwei demi auru ma we aumeiria wioru.” <verse eid="GEN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Ainanaya Loti da wa medu we kaisung manduo sahu suru we urangfo, ambori urau ne kamitungfo suru, medu deyo, “Musahera mura weru katai nini, weo Yahwei ambori mei bendari ninia wioru rai.” Wape uwaitaraihio Loti mei we suru terai.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Siwewaraia mani, wewaifo suru uranggewa Loti we sikera da weru bendarifoi. Wewaifo suru umadu ureyo, “Wukahera, ka nemu wiwingwai tuti nemu kamitungwa suru, mera weru katai nini. Ambori wiro memarareha fanai, na kutu bendari nini aumeiria wioru.”<verse eid="GEN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Na kutu Loti dohong fantamai nanai, wewaifo suru uwaramia uru na Loti warangfo, ne wiwingfoi tuti ne kamitungfo suru. Uka ea to boriei weru bendarifoia tuti utawing eara. Weo Yahwei enewawu Loti fefe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:7">2Ptr. 2:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Na kutu enayai na boriaifo nanai, wewaifo manei medu we Loti deyo, “Memito weru katai nini ambori mekaharai weru mararehafoi! Wiro mewati to mekurumufui fanai, tuti wiro meminohi ukai na doni kontai na enang Yordani fanai. Memito to weuaifo ambori wiro memarareha fanai!”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Manamo Loti medu we suru deyo, “Oh dai! Wiro muremi amea amemito to weuaifo fanai. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Tarai dai enemuwawu amea fefe fata amea kawuru ampa. Wape weuaifo waroi paria, ampefe masino amemitoa sobu kataifoi kaharai mae amemararehara, weo aiboi miung bendarifoi dawi amea fefe. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Botia! Na toaromine bendari katui bei na wanai, wiro waroi turura kaha. Todoni mani bomi amea amemito to wanaia, ambori amekaharai weru mararehafoi.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Wewaifo manei medu wei deyo, “Yo! Iroa we kaiwo modurawa, bendari ketui nini wiro imeiria wioru kaha. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Memito ahera! Weo wiro inari fiea kahai, paria memito sobu katai wani akawuru wo.” Loti sahu bendari nani we ketui, ampefe bendari nani esahui we Soari.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Na kutu Loti mitoa sobu Soari mani, wofoi dautaia.<verse eid="GEN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Na tantuma Yahwei suo metang belerang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Metang belerang mani, kamiei bemining denggararu tuti menggaponi paria, tuti niunsai piro paria, tuti niari inontarai esanseng naria kaha.</char></note> tuti adia, dohongnai na rorafaisi to bendari Sodomi tuti Gomorai. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Yahwei niunung bendarifo suru na adia, kontai enang Yordani tuti fi tifu nai foi kiai kontaio inontaraifosa kiai awao eworu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:23-24">11:23-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk. 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:29">17:29</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:6">2Ptr. 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Yud. 7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Wape Loti ne wiwing dariatifoi daraberahi deti to kurufui we bendarifoia nanai, mayeai wediri kamieio meuaia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:32">Luk. 17:32</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Kameai kutung Abrahami sikahera da to katai ramindenafa doa medu ria Yahwei nayafo. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Na wanai deti to bendari Sodomi tuti Gomorai tuti to enangno Yordani sentenang, deti riraungfoi we mintantunung na kahofa nuwowongfo ayai, netarai toyari riraung sinu na wawu fiabai. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Tonanaifa, na kutu Allai mei bendarifo na enang Yordani, katai Loti minohi nai foia wioru. Allai aro Abrahami ampefe Fiata Loti wewu netaraifoi weru kataifoi.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Loti tuti ne kamitungfo suru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Mayeai Loti tuti ne kamitung mandufo suru itora weru Soari to weuaifo we itonayai na wanai, weo mitai we niayai na Soari fefe. Na wanai itominohi na winsaburung bei. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Na rahida beia mani, kamitung mano fubafoi medu we ne tahatuifoi deyo, “Dai weinongkutung ampa, tuti wiro mang manea na katai nini we ambori turau mandu we tune mang, toyari fianai aino inontarai na nunei sentenang enarifo ne. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Ro ma turohong dai dunung angguria meyeru, tuti turena riati ambori tusobu arikang we tune dai ne ririanei.”<verse eid="GEN 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Diru nani kontai urohong une dai dunung anggurifoa meyerua, mayeai kamitung mano fubafoi da afui dena ria tamanai. Wape tamang meyeru paria, ampefe serawawera fianai aino ne kamitungfoi niari weifo. <verse eid="GEN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Kamiaia mani, kamitung mano fubafoi medu we ne tahatuifoi deyo, “Diruafa yena ria dai ampa, ampefe diru bonini kontaio turohongni dunung nariai aha, tuti wuai afui bena riati, ambori na tonanafo turohong riria we dai.”<verse eid="GEN 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Ampefe diru nani kontai urohong anggurifo utamami Loti dunungna meyerua. Ainanaya kamitung mano fuifoi da afui dena ria tamanai nariai aha, tuti tamang meyeru paria ampefe wiro deitawang fianai aino ne kamitung mano fuifoi niari tonanai weifo kahai.<verse eid="GEN 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Ainanaya kamitung mandufo suru uwearikangna we urena ria utamami Loti fefe. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Mayeai mano fubafoi minohituti ne kaisung manei, dohongni wonong fino Moapi, andino we wereng we riria inontarai Moapi fosa ne. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Mano katuifoi kontai minohituti ne kaisung manei tuti dohongni wonong fino Ben-Ami, andino we wereng we riria inontarai Amoni fosa ne.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Abrahami tuti Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Ainanaya Abrahami da weru Mamre to Kahofa Negepi, tuti niayai rahang Kadesi tuti Syuri. Mayeai niayai na Gerari we inontarai aisei. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Na katai nani Abrahami sahu Sarai ne wiwingfoi we ne tahatui dine. Ampefe Abimeleki mananu Gerari foi demi ne inontarai fosa eha Sarai weia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Nun. 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Wape dirua mani Allai Da wa medu we Abimeleki na amiei bei deyo, “Mureha rai we wiwing kari ma nani, weo i mani rirau ampa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Wape Abimeleki wiro dena ria Sarai kaharai, ampefe medu we Sengnei deyo, “Sengne waune, wiro ametohong sarawa kahai mae! Boyo mung yau tuti nehu rainei e? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Abrahami mantauni dino medurai deyo, wiwing nini mani ne tahatui dine tuti wiwingfoi mantauni kontai yoa deyo, i mani Abrahami rorongwing dine. Ampefe fianai aino inari nina mani na enehurorong mesi, wiro yohong sarawa kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Ainanaya Allai medu we Abimeleki nariai aha deyo, “Iwaitawanai we fianai aino nari nina mani na enemurorong mesi, wape Yeyo isua wau ambori wiro nari sasari we Yau fanai. Nanai wedaya wiro Itua wau we ambori bena ria wiwingfoi fanai. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ampefe nina mani, bohong Sarai tiwera we ne mangwai aha. Weo i mani nabi dine, i ambori wenadi we wau ambori wiro mureha kaha. Wape wiro bohongni tiwerawa kaha mani, boitawangnaifa, wau tuti nemu raiwai sentenang memarareha rai.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Kamiai kutungna mani, Abimeleki sahu ne inontarai eru fi wei fosa ma. Deisaharai wesa kariri fianai aino dirufa Allai medurai wei na amiei rorongfoi, ampefe inontaraifosa ematai paria. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Mayeai Abimeleki sahu Abrahamia medu wei deyo, “Fianai aino nari we amea toninai nina? Tuti fi sarawai fianai aino inari we waune, donio nari yau tuti nehu rainei sentenang enari sasari fiabai nini? Fi nari toninane wiro mai we yau kaha!” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Mayeai Abimeleki medu we Abrahami aha deyo, “Enemutituai fianie, donio nari yau toninaifa?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ainanaya Abrahami medu we Abimeleki deyo, “Enehutituai yeyo inontarai na katai nini mani, wiro esomi we Allai tuti eroasoi kaha, ampefe manei deti nehu wiwingnei tuti enerorong dohong wei mani ambori miung yau ki. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Tarai kontai we i mani rorohuwing dine, aune dai mansiari wape wiro aune ai mansiari kaha. Tuti ikari we nehu wiwing. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Na kutu Allai sahu yau ira to boriei weru nehu dai ne munurorongfo to katai aiseifoi, imadu we nehu wiwingnei yeyo, ‘Boinawi nemu enemuwawu yau wa, turawa sobu katai bei, manei dutang bera wau we yau mani, boyo nemu tafuai di yau.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Mayeai Abimeleki dohong Abrahami ne wiwingno Sarai wei aha, kontai dohong fiahung kambing, domba, sapi tuti woming mang tuti wiwing manea kontai we Abrahami. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Tuti Abimeleki medu we Abrahami deyo, “Nehu katai dinini sentenang, mantaung wau biri katai bo doni dino boyo munohi nai ne.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Ainanaya medu we Sarai deyo, “Sarae taramuma, kawurua yohongnai we nemu tafuai Abrahami doi peraki piaring we sura we fiainawiai we mandoni kontai weo tarai wau mani wiro bohong sarawa kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Mayeai Abrahami wenadi we Allai, tuti Allai Niari Abimeleki tuti ne wiwingfoi tuti ne woming wiwingfosa ebeng aha, ampefe esobu arikang aha. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Weo Abrahami ne wiwingno Sarai wedaya mani, donio na Abimeleki ne munu mananufoi, Yahwei kife wiwingfosa kiai enemimanabufo, ampefe enearikang kaha.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Isaki saubaunung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Mayeai Yahwei mioang Sarai tuti Niari kariri ne kaiwo areraio medurai ampo. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Ampefe na rahida Allai kiutuafo, Sarai doama minohituti ne kaisung manei. Fi ninai kawariai na kutu Abrahami weinongkutungfo, kariri Allai ne kaiwo arerai medurai weia ampo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:11">Ibr. 11:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Abrahami dohong kaisung mano Sarai minohitutiri foi wonong fino Isaki.<verse eid="GEN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Ainanaya Abrahami wesunati Isaki na ne rahida indeatorufo, kariri fianai aino Allai demi weafo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">Nun. 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:8">Kis. 7:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Tuti Abrahami ne fuina piaring (100) mani ne kaisung Isaki saubaunung.<verse eid="GEN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Sarai medu deyo, “Allai niari yau imiri tuti ifaraise ampa, ampefe mandoni kontai taraoa mani, miri tuti firaise ria yau.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Medu aha deyo, “Mandoni dino medu we Abrahami deyo, ‘Sarai dohong uio arikang ne?’ Wape ninaia mani deti iminohituti kaisung manei we Abrahami, na kutu weinongkutungne.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrahami data Hagari tuti ne kaisungno Ismaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Mayeai Isaki fiabai toyai. Na kutu fiotou dunung inang ne uifo, Abrahami niari muniara fiabai bei we dohong suari nai.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Na rahida bei mani Sarai detioai, weo Ismaeli, Hagari wiwing Mesiri foi ne kaisung mano minohitutiri we Abrahami foi deinahi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urainahi ruhiai wape Ismaeli deikahera Isaki.</char></note> ria mantauni ne kaisungno Isaki. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Ampefe Sarai medu we Abrahami deyo, “Bata womingnei tuti ne kaisungfoi weruai! Ambori wiro sobu nemu fianggengnei ria nehu kaisungno Isaki fanai.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29-30">Gal. 4:29-30</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Abrahami wiro firaise we kaiwofo kaha paria, weo Ismaeli kontai ne kaisung dine. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Wape Allai medu we Abrahami deyo, “Wiro aromukuayai we nemu kaisungfoi tuti nemu womingfoi fanai. Mae bohong kariri fianai aino Sarai medura wa, weo nemu ririanei mani na nemu kaisung Isaki terai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Rm. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:18">Ibr. 11:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Wape nemu womingfoi ne kaisungfoi kontai ambori Inariri we kaiwasa fiabai, weo i kontai nemu kaisung dine fefe.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Kamiai kutungna mani, Abrahami kia roti feai tuti mereha feai na kirbati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kirbati mani, andowa rerawao sirahiai, enari we esoni mereha nai.</char></note> bei dohongnai watai na Hagari warabeawafo, tuti dohongnai ne kaisungfoi, mayeai demi da wa. Ampefe Hagari da wa, wiro deitawang da weafo kaha na katai wiarora wekamamiei na Bersyeba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Na kutu mereha uka na kirbatifoi kai nanai, Hagari dohong Ismaeli wiatai na ai raifofa rorongfo, <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />da wa minohi waroi werui kuteai, tarahio meteri piaring (100) tea rai. Tuti medu na enerorong deyo, “Wiro nehu mambiriu feai we iwati nehu kaisungnei mirehane kaha.” Hagari minohi na nanai tuti saiao deidu.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Mayeai Allai tarao kaisungfoi we saifo. Ampefe Allai ne wewaifo manei medu we Hagari na rorafaisi meu deyo, “Hagare, fiani dino wai wei ne? Mutai fanai, weo Allai tarao nemu kaisungfoi rawafui sai nanai, na katai wiatai nai foi ampa. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Boabari wau ro we kaisungfoia tuti woworiri we nemboru, weo na kaisung nani ambori Inariri ne ririafoi we kaiwasa fiabai ki.”<verse eid="GEN 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Ainanaya Allai fiobai Hagari urengfoa deti na mai, ampefe deti kamirei mereha bei. Da wa soni merehafo na kirbatifoia, mayeai dohongnaia arikangfoi dunungna.<verse eid="GEN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Tuti Allai weriria arikangfoi, donio fiabai toyai. I niayai na katai wiarora wekamamiei na Parani, tuti sewai paria na dana riria fo. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Ampefe niayai na nanai tuti inang kia wiwing Mesiri manei wei ma dauti.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrahami tuti Abimeleki urohong kaiwo arerai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Na rahida bei Abimeleki tuti Pikholi mano wenunggamiei we ne afai mamunafosa foi, ura we Abrahamia. Abimeleki medu we Abrahami deyo, “Yetioai kawuru ampa, we wau Allai fiata wau pampang na fianai aino nari ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:26">Nun. 26:26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Ampefe fofora we yau na Allai arongreane, we wiro totofa yau ete nehu arikangnesa ete nehu ririanei sentenang kaha. Kariri yau inari ne bengfo we wau kawuru ampo, wau kontai nari tonanai we yau tuti nuo munohi nai iweinontarai aisei nini.” <verse eid="GEN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ainanaya Abrahami medu deyo, “Yo, yau ifafora!”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Wape kawurua fefora nanai, Abrahami detua we Abimeleki we kamirei mereha bei, weo Abimeleki ne mangfatafosa etawari wesa fefe. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleki yoa we Abrahami deyo, “Wiro iwaitawang mandoni dino niari fi tonanafo ne, kontaio wiro boisaha finanai we yau kaha, tuti paria sobu rahida bonini wiro tarahuo finana kaharai.”<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Ainanaya Abrahami kia domba tuti sapi manea tuti dohongsa we Abimeleki, mayeai utabuhi kaiwo arera foa. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Wape Abrahami diri domba antung wiwing itu, siai weru domba weifosa. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Ainanaya Abimeleki medu we Abrahami deyo, “Domba antung ituo birisa siai ninai we fiani e?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abrahami yoa deyo, “Ka domba antung wiwing itu ninisa na warahune, ambori we fiainawiai we inontarainesa weo kamirei mereha nini mani yauno isarai ne.”<verse eid="GEN 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Nanai wedaya inontarai esahu katai nani we Bersyeba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bersyeba na kaiwo Iberani mani, kamirei mereha itu, ete kamirei mereha fafora.</char></note>, weo na katai nani inontaraifo suru umadu kaiwo fafora fo. <verse eid="GEN 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Na urohong kaiwo arera kawurua na Bersyeba fo, Abimeleki tuti Pikholi mano wenunggamiei we afai mamuna fosa foi, urarabera suru to inontarai Filistini fosa ene kataifoia. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ainanaya Abrahami niayai na Bersyeba tuti sanangno ai tamariska bei na katai nani, tuti na wanai i somi we Yahwei, Allai mano darang we fitawafa. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Tuti Abrahami niayai wairoi weinontarai aisei na inontarai Filistini fosa ene nu foi.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Allai titua kariri Abrahami ne yoasoafo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Fuina beiru teai aha mani, Allai titua kariri Abrahami ne yoasoafo. Medu we Abrahami deyo, “Abrahame” Ainanaya yoa deyo, “Ya, Seng”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17-19">Ibr. 11:17-19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Allai medu wei aha deyo, “Ka nemu kaisung mansiari Isaki mano enemuwawuti wai, ro to kahofa Moria, tuti bohongni we korbanio nunumi we Yau na uai bo ambori Yeinawi we waufoi.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:1">2Taw. 3:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Ampefe Abrahami doari kameai kutung, meinenang ne keledaifoi, tuti sahu ne mangfata mandu tuti ne kaisungno Isaki. Bebau aimasa feai meinenangmai we korbani nunumifoi, ainanaya era to katai bo Allai deikariri wei foi. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Era wa rahida bo botoru foia mani, Abrahami yuai ureng deti afong mani, deti katai era weifoi na wairoi. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Mayeai Abrahami medu we ne mangfatafo suru deyo, “Munayai na ninai tuti keledainei, mae yau tuti nehu kaisungnei auruino aura to wanaia we auwenadi nayai, awao kai mani aurarabera auru we muru aha ma.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ainanaya Abrahami kia aimasao we niunung korbani nayafo, yuaisai ayai ne arikang Isaki soduatai, mae andino kia adiafo tuti noifoi. Tonanaifa ura ruhiai to kataifoi. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Urawa rang rabuang Isaki dutang tamang Abrahami deyo, “Daie!” Tamang yoa wei deyo, “Kaisung ne wau tofino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaki medu aha deyo, “Adia fininai tuti aimasa finanai, mae domba antung ohongni we korbani nunumifoi andidonie?” <verse eid="GEN 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abrahami yoa deyo, “Nehu kaisung ne wau, Allai dino ambori meinenang domba antung manei we korbani we Mantauni terai ki.” Ainanaya ura ruhiai paria.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Na kutu ura paria usobu katai Allai deikariri we Abrahami foi, Abrahami biaung mesba bei na nanai, sang aimasafo watai na mesbafoi. Mayeai wiora Isaki warangfo tuti awengfo, dohong Isaki wiatai na aimasa nuwowongfo na mesbafoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:21">Yak. 2:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Mayeai Abrahami fiating noifoi, yuaisi we disang ne arikangfoi we miungni we korbani.<figure style="fig" file="LB00291C.TIF" size="span" ref="22:10">Abrahami de miung Isaki</figure> <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Wape na kutu Abrahami de disang ne arikangfoi, na tantuma Yahwei ne wewai manei medu na rorafaisi meu deyo, “Abrahame! Abrahami wo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Abrahami yoa wei deyo, “Ya Seng, yau nina.” <verse eid="GEN 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Yahwei medu na wewaifoi deyo, “Wiro mung arikangwai fanai ete nariri towea fanai. Weo ninaia mani Yeitawangnai ampa weo tarai womi we Yau tuti roasoaifa, tuti wiro enemurorong soriru we bohong nemu arikang mansiari wai we Yau kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Mayeai Abrahami fiobera ureng deti kurufuia mani, na tantuma deti domba mang manei nungkaradoifo sobu na ai raifofa arirawangfo. Ampefe kia dombafoi ma miungni dohongni we korbani nunumi we Allai, we yiwang ne arikangfoi.<figure style="fig" file="BK00008C.TIF" size="col" ref="22:13">Domba nungkaradoi sobu na ai arirawang</figure> <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Ampefe Abrahami dohong katai nani wonong fino, “Yahweh Yireh, nana mani Yahwei meinenang fianai aino tatohong weafo.” Donio paria sobu ninai inontarai emadu eteyo, “Na uaifo Yahwei ambori meinenang fianai aino tatohong weafo.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />We beru Yahwei ne wewaifoi medu na rorafaisi we Abrahami meu, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />deyo, “Ifafora na mantaung Yau Wonohune terai. Weo wau nari kaririai ampa, tuti wiro enemurorong soriru we bohong nemu arikang mansiari wai we Yau kaha,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:13-14">Ibr. 6:13-14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />ampefe Imoang wau fuba paria tuti Inari nemu ririawai bitoya toyari awaha na rorafaisi tuti toyari ninuaing na nafareng, tuti nemu ririanei ambori etahatawang ene aitetafosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:12">Ibr. 11:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Na nemu riria nani dino kaiwasa na nunei sentenang esobu moangfo, weo wau nari kariri Nehu kaiwone.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:25">Kis. 3:25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Mayeai Abrahami tuti ne arikangfoi urarabera suru we ne mangfata mandufo suru aha, tuti etarabera ea ruhiai to Bersyebara, tuti Abrahami niayai pampang na nanaia.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nahori ne ririafoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Mayeai Abrahami tarao kaiwo we ne tafuaio Nahori ne wiwingno Milkai sobu kaisung indeatoru. <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Kaisung reantenangfoi wonong fino Usi, ne tahatuifoi wonong fino Busi. Sua aha mani Kemueli, andino Arami ne dai dine. <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kontai Keseti, Hasoi, Pildasi, Yidlafi tuti Betueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betueli nini dino dawingno Ribkai ne. Ampefe arikang indeatoru ninisaino Milkai dawingsa we Nahori, Abrahami ne tafuai. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Nahori kontai ne wiwing siai manei wonong fino Reumai. Tuti Reumai nini ne arikang mana amani, Tebahi, Gahami, Tahasi tuti Maakhai.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Abrahami wiori kahofa feai we sirai Sarai nayai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Abrahami ne wiwingno Sarai minohi darang fuina piaring piareia itu (127). <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Mayeai Sarai mireha na Kiryat-Arbai, neo fuininai esahuai we Hebroni, na kahofa Kanani. Ampefe Abrahami da ma minohi saia deidu we ne wiwingfoi.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Na kutu Abrahami saia kai nanai, ne wiwingfoi wiatai mae daweruia, da wa medu we inontarai Heti mano ene kahofa fosa. <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />Medu wesa deyo, “Yau mani inontarai aiseio ira ma inayai rahang mea na ninai. Masino meroa we yau mani, metohong kahofa kuteai we iwori ambori isarai nehu wiwingfoi nayai.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Kis. 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:9">Ibr. 11:9</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 11:13">13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Inontarai Heti fosa eroa we Abrahami eteyo, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Toninaifa terai, dai wau mani inontarai fuabaio ametato wau na nayai rahang amea nina. Ampefe wurai nemu wiwingwai na amene fafo bengne, wiro manei na amea deiaya wau we wurai nemu wiwingwai na fafone kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Mayeai Abrahami somi we dohong mahikai we inontarai Heti fosa weo emadu tonanafo, <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />tuti medu deyo, “Masino meroa weai we ika nehu wiwingfoi ma isarai na nina mani, mefata yau na metutang Efroni, Sohari ne kaisungfoi. <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />Masino miaya mani dewayang ne wingsaburung Makpelai wiatai na ne romi reafo wanai we yau. Tuti ne mahikai mani dewayangnai na ne harga mai, tuti ibaitai ambori mewati terai na meuremine, ambori wingsaburung nanai we katai nehu fafo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Na kutu nanafo mani, Efroni kontai minohi rahang inontarai Heti fosa na katai efanduhisa nai foi, na rahutu bendari borongfo. Mayeai na inontarai Heti euremireafo, Efroni, inontarai Heti foi medu we Abrahami deyo, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Daie, taramuma. Na nehu inontaraio amene nu boyari nesa euremireane, imadurai mau we yeyo, yohong romifoi tuti wingsaburungfoi kontai we wau we wurai nemu wiwingwai nai.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Ainanaya Abrahami somi we inontarai Heti fosa na earomireafo, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />mae medu we Efroni na inontaraifosa euremifo deyo, “Masino roa tonana mani, taramu imadu mau ne, romifoi ibaiti sentenang. Ka nemu doi ibaitai naya ne mau, ambori ika nehu wiwingfoi ma isarai nayai.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efroni yoa we Abrahami deyo, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Daie taramuma. Kahofa kutu ne harga doi peraki piaring we bea (400) nanai wefieai we turu kaha, ampefe ka nemu wiwingwai ma wurai nayai.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abrahami yoa we fianai aino Efroni medurafo, ainanaya deto doi peraki piaring we bea (400) fo, ambori titua doifo kariri mantawayangfi fosa etitua toa fo. Mayeai dohongnai we Efronia tuti inontarai Heti fosa ewatioai na euremifo kontai.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Ampefe Efroni ne romio wiatai na Makpelai na Mamrei do wanang murangfoi, Abrahami wioriri wei we nenia, romifoi, wingsaburungfoi tuti ai kiaio doari na romifoi kontai ne doari na kahofa deraungfo kai. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Kahofa tuti fi tifu kiaio doari na nanafo dohongnai we Abrahamia, tuti inontarai Heti mano efanduhisa na rahutu borong bendarifoi eroa weai, weo kahofa nanai Abrahami ne fi fine. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Ainanaya Abrahami kia ne wiwingno Sarai ma sirai na wingsaburung Makpelai, na bendari Mamre do wanang murangfoi, amani Hebroni na kahofa Kanani foi. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Tonanaifa kahofa tuti wingsaburung na Makhpelaio Abrahami wiori ria inontarai Heti fosa we nefi fine, we dohongnai we kahofa fafo.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Abrahami ne mangfatafoi kia Ribkai we Isaki ne wiwing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Na rabuang bo nani, Abrahami weinongkutung paria tuti Yahwei mioangni na fiani kontai. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Rahida bei mani, Abrahami medu we ne mangfata mano yufi wairoi sewafoi, amani mano deitawang wedua ne rafoi, medu wei deyo, “Bohong waramuwa ma watai sau awehu wowongne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fi nina mani ene koangno papayai paria na fafongpa we efafora nayai.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Fofora na Yahweh, Allai mano wemambiriu na rorafaisi tuti nunei, dohongnao ka wiwing Kanani nesa manei we nehu kaisung Isaki we ne wiwingfe. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Wape todoni kontaio ro to nehu katai itaubaunuhu naifoi, we nehu terafosa, na wanai wobu wiwing manei we nehu kaisung Isaki.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Ainanaya mangfatafoi medu we Abrahami deyo, “Masino wiwingfoi wiro miaya we da ria yau to katai nini ma kaha mani, tofino? Ika nemu kaisungnei to nemu katai taubaunumu nai foia ne?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Wape Abrahami yoa wei deyo, “Nanafanai! Wiro ka nehu kaisungnei to katai wanaia fanai. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Yahweh, Allai mano wemambiriu na rorafaisi, Andino sahu yau ira to boriei weru dai ne munufoi, kontai weru nehu terafosa ene kataifoi. Tuti Medu we yau na Fefora we ambori Dohong katai nini we nehu ririanesa ki. I kontai ambori Demi ne wewaifoi da foni wau we fiata wau, donio wobu wiwing manei na wanai we nehu kaisungnei. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Wape masino wiwingfoi wiro miaya we da ria wau ma kaha mani, fofora we yau nina wiro we aiboi we wau kaha. Ampefe todoni kontaio wiro ka nehu kaisungnei to wanaia fanai.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Ainanaya mangfatafoi dohong warangfoa wasau Abrahami awewowongfo, tuti fefora we niari kariri fianai aino Abrahami medurai weifo.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Ainanaya mangfatafoi kia unta sura na ne dai Abrahami tuti kia maino fianggeng ne harga dedaio Abrahami minohi tutirafo weai, tuti da to Arami-Mesopotamia, to bendario Abrahami ne tahafuai Nahori raminde darang mani minohi naifoi. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Da wa sobu bendari deraung boriaifo, dohong ne untafosa eminohi na katai kefang we kamirei merehafoi. Ramindenawa, teterai we wiwing fosa era to boriei we etutu merehafo.<verse eid="GEN 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Ainanaya mangfatafoi wenadi deyo, “Yahweh, Allai mano nehu dai Abrahami somi we Wau. Fata yau ambori fianai aino ira weane mani isobuai na rahida bonini kontai, tuti Boinawi Nemu enemuwawuwa we nehu dai Abrahami. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Yau yoari rurang we kamirei merehanei ne, tuti kadawing na bendari ninisa katu mani era mandiei we etutu mereha. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Kadono fio ira weai ninai Boinawiai we yau tonina, kadawing mandoni dino katu mani imadu wei yeyo, ‘Tu nemu babeuwai meu, bohong mereha feai ma yunung.’ Masino yoa deyo, ‘Bunungna, tuti nemu untafosa yohongsa etunung kontai, kadawing nani dino Biriri we Nemu mangfata Isaki.’ Masino fininai kawariai tonana mani, yeitawangnai weo Wau kawurua Boinawi Enemuwawuwa we nehu dai Abrahami.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Mangfatafoi wiro wenadia kai kaharai mae, na tantuma deti kadawingno wonong fino Ribkai sodua ne babeufoi na warabeawafo da to kamirei mereha foia. Ribkai nini mani, Betueli ne kamitung dine. Betueli mani, Nahori tuti Milkai une kaisung dine, mae Nahori mani Abrahami ne tafuai tera dine. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Ribkai mani ureng bohi paria tuti wiro dena ria mang manei kaharai. Bia to kamirei merehafoia dutu mereha na ne babeufoi, tuti dautai aha.<verse eid="GEN 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Mayeai Abrahami ne mangfatafoi mito weia tuti medu wei deyo, “Kamitung ne wau, bohong mereha kuteai na nemu babeuwai we yunungwo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Ampefe Ribkai su ne babeufoi to warangfo, tuti medu we mangfatafoi deyo, “Daie, bunungto.” <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Ribkai dohong mangfatafoi dunungna kaifo, medu we mangfatafoi deyo, “Yutu merehafeai we nemu untanesa etunung kontai, ambori earomitataha ahang kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Ainanaya na ahera sari mereha na babeufoi to fi unta etunung naifoi, tuti mito to kamirei merehafoi aha we dutu mereha feai, ambori untafosa etunungna ehai. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Wape mangfatafoi doa mamunggasai, wiro medu fieai ahang kahai, mae seiraria kariri Ribkai ne niarifo, we deitawang kariri fio da weafo Yahwei fiatari we sobuai na mai ete bererie.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Na kutu untafosa etunungna efotourafo, mangfatafoi kia fimarandinai emasi satarai na Ribkai ubongfoi, tuti sata araha emasi boru na warangfo, fi ninai maraba tuti ne harga dadai. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Mayeai mangfatafoi medu wei deyo, “Boisaharai we yau, mandoni ne arikang diwau? Tuti na tamamu ne munufoi katai feai we ametena naya ne?” <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Ainanaya Ribkai yoa wei deyo, “Nehu dai wonong fino Betueli, Nahori tuti Milkai une arikang dine. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Tuti na antone munufoi mani, katai feai we metena nayai, tuti na wanai ninoi sarahiai bitoya we nemu untanesa etang tuti etena nayai.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Ainanaya mangfatafoi disangkapa awebuka tuti somi aweu ureng disangso kahofa wau we Yahwei, <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />mae medu deyo, “Ifayai Yahwei, Allai mano nehu dai Abrahami somi wei, mano Enewawu tuti dohong kariri Ne kaiwo arerane we nehu dai Abrahamifo. Tuti Yahwei, mano wiwiaing yau kawurua na nehu rang rorongne to nehu dai Abrahami ne teranesa ma ninai!”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Mayeai kamitungfoi mito to inang ne munufoia tuti deisaha kariri fi kawariai nanai kai. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Ribkai roromang manei wonong fino Labani. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Na kutu Labani deti fimarandinai na Ribkai ubongfoi tuti araha na warangfo, tuti tarao kaiwo Ribkai medurai kariri kaiwo mangfatafoi medurai weifo, na ahera mitoa sobu kamirei merehafoi. Ampefe Labani sobu Abrahami ne mangfatafoi doari ria ne untafosa na wanai. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Ainanaya Labani medu we mangfatafoi deyo, “Dai mano Yahwei mioang wau, we fianie boari na borieine? Merama tara to antone munufoia. Imainenang katai na nehu munufoi we wau ampa, tuti katai kontai we nemu untanesa.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Ainanaya Abrahami ne mangfatafoi tuti ne inontaraifosa, era ria Labani to ne munufoi afui. Labani demi ne mangfatafosa etu fianggengfo weru untafosa, tuti etohong untafosa etampi tuti ebuai ninoi sarahiafo we katai untafosa etena nayai. Mayeai eha mereha feai we Abrahami ne mangfatafoi tuti ne inontaraifosa, eruai eawemifo nayai. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Na kutu emainenang fiangfo we etampifo, Abrahami ne mangfatafoi medu deyo, “Wiro yampi kaharai, mae yeyo yeikariri kaiwo ika ira ma ne akawuruwo.” Ampefe Labani medu wei deyo, “Yo, tonana mani boisaharai ma.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Abrahami ne mangfatafoi medu deyo, “Yau mani Abrahami ne mangfata di yau. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Yahwei mioang nehu dai Abrahami paria, donio ne ra bitoya paria. Yahwei mioangni Dohong kambing, domba, sapi, keledai, unta tuti fianggengno emasi, peraki tuti woming mang tuti wiwing efau kontai. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Dai Abrahami nini ne wiwingno Sarai paria wewiwingkutung, arahio minohituti ne kaisung manei. Tuti kaisung nini dino Abrahami dohong ne ra minohitutirifoi we neni. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Nehu dai dino demi yau ifafora we ambori inari kariri kaiwo medurafo. Medu we yau deyo, ‘Wiro ka wiwing Kanani nini manei we nehu kaisungno Isaki fanai. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Wape todoni kontaio ro to nehu dai ne munufoia tuti we nehu terafosara we ka wiwing manei we nehu kaisungnei.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Iroa wei aha yeyo, ‘Masino wiwingfoi wiro miaya we da ria yau kaha mani todoni?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Wape medu we yau deyo, ‘Yahwei mano na arongfo iminohi yarangne, na yohong kariri Ne awiafo ambori Demi Ne wewaifo manei da ria wau we fiata wau. Donio fi ro weai ninai wobuai na mai, amani ka wiwing manei we nehu kaisungnei na nehu dai ne munurorongfo tuti na nehu terafosa. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Masino nehu terafosa wiro eroa we etohong ene kamitung manei we kari we nehu kaisungnei ma kaha mani, kosau weru nemu foforao tobuhirai ria yau ninai.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />Na kutu irawa sobu kamirei merehafoi mani, iwenadi na enehurorong yeyo, ‘Yahweh, Allai mano nehu dai Abrahami somi we Wau, kadono Fai rang we yau ambori fio ira weai ninai isobuai na mai. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Na ninai yoari kefang kamirei merehanei nina, masino kadawing manei da ma dutu mereha tuti imadu wei yeyo, “Bohong mereha feai na nemu babeuwai ma yunungwo,” <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />masino kadawingfoi yoa deyo, “Yo, bunungna, tuti we nemu untafosa yohongsa etunung kontai,” nana mani kadawing nani dino Yahwei deinawi we nehu dai ne kaisungfoi we ne wiwingne.’<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Wiro iwenadi na enehurorong awao kai kaharai mae, na tantuma yeti Ribkai sodua babeufoi na warabeawafo, bia to kamirei merehafoia dutu mereha. Mayeai imadu wei yeyo, ‘Bohong mereha feai ma yunungwo.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Na ahera su babeufoi na warabiawafoi aweu tuti medu deyo, ‘Bunungna, tuti nemu untafosa yohongsa etunung kontai.’ Ainanaya yunung merehafo tuti nehu untafosa dohongsa etunung kontai.<verse eid="GEN 24:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Mayeai yutangni yeyo, ‘Mandoni ne kamitung di wau?’ Yoa we yau deyo, ‘Nehu dai dino Betueli, Nahori tuti Milkai une kaisung dine.’ Ainanaya itata fimarandinai emasi na ubongfoi tuti araha emasi boru na warangfo.<verse eid="GEN 24:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Ainanaya yisangkapa awehubuka ituang aweu urehu disangso kahofa wau isomi we Yahwei. Ifayai Yahwei, Allai mano nehu dai Abrahami somi wei, weo Andino wiwiaing yau na rangbo mesinei, donio isobu kamitung manei na nehu dai ne teranesa we ne kaisungfoi we ne wiwing nina. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Kawurua metaramio imadufe ampa, ampefe masino meteinawi menemiwawuwa we nehu dai Abrahami mani, meteisaharaifa we yau, wape bereri mani meteisaharaifa kontai we yau, ambori iwaitawanaifa tuti iserawe rang siai.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Ainanaya Labani tuti Betueli uroa wei ureyo, “Fio boiriri nini kiai na Yahwei ma, ampefe wiro aumadu fieai ahang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Boti, Ribkai dino doari na aromufe nana, kari tuti mura wa, ambori we wiwing we nemu dai Abrahami ne kaisungfoi, kariri fianai aino Yahwei medurafo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Na kutu Abrahami ne mangfatafoi tarao kaiwo umadurafo, disangkapa awebuka suang aweu ureng disangso kahofa wau somi we Yahwei. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Mayeai mangfatafoi saio fimarandinai emasi, peraki tuti ansungno ne harga dedai, dohongnai we Ribkai. Tuti dohong fio ne harga dedaifo weai kontai we roromangfoi tuti we inanaifa. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Ainanaya Abrahami ne mangfatafoi tuti ne inontaraifosa etampi tuti etunung ruhiai tuti etena na nanaia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Etenawa kamiaia mani, mangfatafoi medu deyo, “Muntoroa we yau we yarabera yau to nehu dai Abrahami aha.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Manamo Ribkai roromangfoi tuti inanai umadu wei ureyo, “Todoni mani, Ribkai niayai ria amea na ninai ari bei ete rahida sura akawuru wo, arahio da ria wau ki.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Manamo Abrahami ne mangfatafoi medu we suru deyo, “Wiro muwedua yau fanai, weo Yahwei niari yau isobu fio ira weane kawuru ampa. Ampefe muroa we yau yarabera yau we nehu dai Abrahami aha.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Ainanaya emadu wei eteyo, “Tonana mani, tasahu kadawingfoi mantauni ma tatutangni.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Ainanaya esahu Ribkai ma etutangni eteyo, “Maya we ro ria inontarainei e?” Yoa deyo, “Yo, imaya we ira riati.” <verse eid="GEN 24:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Ampefe eroa we Ribkai tuti ne mangfata mano deitawangni na ketuifo, ura ria Abrahami ne mangfatafoi tuti ne inontaraifosara. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Tuti emoang Ribkai eteyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">“Amerorombing ne wau, kadono wau we ai we arikang fubao wiro atoafong soi kaha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 24:60">Kadono nemu ririanei etahatawang ene aitetafosa tuti enayai na ene bendarifo!”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Ainanaya Ribkai tuti ne mangfata wiwingfosa emainenang ene fiangengfo, tuti etautai na untafo era ria Abrahami ne mangfatafoi tuti ne inontaraifosa. Tonanaifa mangfatafoi kia Ribkai, etaraberasa we Abrahami aha.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Na kutu nanai Isaki kawurua da na kamirei mereha Lahai-Roi ma tuti niayai na Kahofa Negepi na ne yawa tendafoi. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Na ramindena bei mani, Isaki dariai na ne yawa tendafoi ariei da wawerahai na katai wiarora weninoifo. Mayeai fioai ureng detia mani, deti untafosa era ma. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Ribkai kontai fioai ureng deti, na kutu detia Isaki nanafo, biari weru ne untafoi, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />tuti dutang Abrahami ne mangfatafoi deyo, “Mang mandoni dino da ma nina?” Mangfatafoi yoa wei deyo, “Nehu dai, Isaki dine.” Ainanaya Ribkai tebung wedua urengfo na ireu sawai na rahanangfo.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Mayeai mangfatafoi deisaha kariri fi kiaio niarifo we Isaki. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Ainanaya Isaki kia Ribkai, usuayai to inangno Sarai ne yawa tendafoi afui, tuti kiari we ne wiwingna. Isaki eneo Ribkai paria tuti na tonanafo sobu wawori. Weo enerorong fituayai na kutu inang Sarai mirehafo.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Abrahami ne ririafoi na ne wiwingno Keturai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abrahami rirau aha, ne wiwingfoi wonong fino Keturai. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Na ne wiwing nani, sobu arikang manea aha, amani ewonomi fino, Simrani, Yoksani, Medani, Midiani, Isybaki, Suahi. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yoksani dawingno, Syebai tuti Dedani. Dedani nini ne ririafoi dino inontarai Asyuri fosa, inontarai Letusi fosa tuti inontarai Leumi fosa. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Midiani ne arikang saino, Efai, Eferi, Henoki, Abidai tuti Eldai. Ea mani ewe riria na Abrahami ne wiwingno Keturai. <verse eid="GEN 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abrahami ne fio minohi tutirafo dohongnai we Isaki. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Wape na Abrahami minohi darangfo kontai dohong fianggeng bitoya we ne arikangno etaubau enumi na ne wiwing siaifosa. Tuti demi ne arikang siaifosa era to katai na do wanang murangfoia enayai nayai, ambori ehatai weru Isaki.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abrahami mireha esarai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Abrahami ne fuina piaring piatorua suraya ring (175). <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Nana mani weinongkutungna tuti nung baibuara, arahio mireha tuti Abrahami fianduhi ria ne werengno emarareha fafong fosa. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Ampefe ne kaisung mandufo suru Isaki tuti Ismaeli, usarai na fafo winsaburung Makpelai, romio Sohari inontarai Heti foi antungno Efroni nenifoi, wiatai na do wanang murang Mamre. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Wingsaburung nini Abrahami wioriri ria inontarai Heti fosa. Sarai kontai raminde Abrahami sirai na nanai kontai. Ampefe Abrahami tuti Sarai une fafo na katai nani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Nun. 23:3-16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Abrahami mireha kawurua, Allai mioang ne kaisungno Isaki tuti Isaki niayai kefang we kamirei mereha Lahai-Roi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ismaeli ne ririafoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Abrahami ne kaisung na Hagari, Sarai ne woming wiwingno Mesiri foi, amani Ismaeli ne ririfoi sonina. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Ismaeli ne arikang ewesuraya mandufo ewonomifo, ahuai kariri etaubau enumifo mani tonina. Nebayoti kaisung fuba dine, mayeai Kedari, Adbeeli, Mipsami, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Misymai, Dumai, Masai, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadadi, Temai, Yeturi, Nafisi tuti Kedmai.<verse eid="GEN 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Ismaeli ne arikang sainana, tuti ewonomi finana. Ea mani ewenungkamiei we ene riria suraya mandufo. Ene munuefo tuti ene yawa tendafo kariri ewonomifo.<verse eid="GEN 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ismaeli ne fuina piaring piareia suraya itu (137) mani mireha, tuti fianduhi ria ne werengno emarareha fafong fosa. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Ismaeli ne ririafoi enayai na katai Hawilai paria sobu Syuri, katai nini wiatai na Mesiri do wanang murangfoi to Asyuria. Tuti ne ririafoi enayai siai weru Abrahami ne riria siaifosa.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esauwi tuti Yakupi utaubau unumifo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Abrahami ne kaisung Isaki ne fi airiri kariri darangfo, tuti na ne ririafoi mani sonina. Abrahami dawingno Isaki. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Na kutu Isaki ne fuina piaru (40) mani dau Ribkai. Ribkai mani Betueli inontarai Arami na Padan-Arami ne kamitung dine, tuti Labani inontarai Arami foi rorowing dine.<verse eid="GEN 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Isaki wenadi we Yahwei, weo ne wiwing Ribkai kirawahi fefe. Ampefe Yahwei yoa we ne nadifoi, donio Ribkai doama, ne arikang tantamurui suruine <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Wape doama nanai, ne arikang mano unayai na Ribkai enemanabufoi urota wawera suru. Ampefe medu deyo, “We fianie isobu fi toninai?” Ainanaya dutang Yahwei kaririai we fi sobuai nanai.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Yahwei medu wei deyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“Kaiwasa rabuang boru unayai na enemumanabuwai nanai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">tuti kaiwasa rabuang borune ambori uweaiteta wawera suru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">manggatui ambori wemambiriu sewa weru mampuai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">tuti mampuai ambori yufi we fiata manggatui.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:12">Rm. 9:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Tete ne rahidafo mai we minohi nanafo, tarai minohituti arikang tantamurui suruine. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Mano reantenangfoi kiawariai mandiei mani, netarai rerawafoi derura. Tuti netaraifoi wenuawuru sentenang, toyari ansungno wenuawuru, ampefe esahui na Esauwi. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Mayeai mano fuifoi dariai aha. Warangfo yu Esauwi awedidifuifo, ampefe esahui na Yakupi. Na kutu utaubau unumi mani, Isaki ne fuina piatoru (60).<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Arikangfo suru ufiabai toyai. Esauwi sewai na da sangfo tuti firaise we niayai na airorongfo. Wape Yakupi mani inontaraio wiro medu funoma kaha tuti dohong funoma kaha, tuti firaise we niayai na yawa tendafoi terai. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Isaki enewawu Esauwi, weo firaise we dang andowa tarai fefe. Wape Ribkai enewawu Yakupi.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Rahida bei mani Yakupi yang fiang fea. Mayeai Esauwi daraberahi na da sangfo ma. Esauwi nuruainso wewisi tuti netarai mirua paria. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Esauwi medu we Yakupi deyo, “Bohong karabu barikao rangsa wasa manea ma yangsa wo, weo iwawisi paria.” Nanai wedaya esahu Esauwi we Edomi nina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edomi na kaiwo Iberani mani berika.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Wape Yakupi yoa wei deyo, “Tonana mani, bohongno nemu haki wearikang fuba wa we yau akawuru wo.” <verse eid="GEN 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Ampefe Esauwi medu deyo, “Boti, katu mani imereha rai. Haki wekaisung fuba nanai wiro we fieai we yau kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakupi medu wei deyo, “Fofora we yau akawuruwo.” Ampefe Esauwi fefora na Yakupi urengreafo we dohong ne haki wearikang fubafo weia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:16">Ibr. 12:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Ainanaya Yakupi dohong roti tuti karabu barika yangsafo manea we Esauwia. Dampi tuti dunung awao kai nanai, mayeai dobariri da wa. Tonanaifa Esauwi wiro deto ne haki wearikang fubafo ahang kahai.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Isaki niayai na nu inontarai Filistini foi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Na rahida bei kaharifoi miung na katai Isaki niayai naifoi, toyari ne dariai kawurua na rabuang bo Abrahami minohi darangfo. Ampefe Isaki da to Gerari, kataio inontarai Filistini ene mananu Abimeleki niayai naifoi. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Mayeai Yahwei deinawi netarai wei tuti medu wei deyo, “Wiro ro to Mesiri fanai. Nayai na kataio Yeisaharai we wau nei. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Na katai nini nayai we inontarai aisei. Yau ambori iwe riria wau tuti Imoang wau. Weo katai nini sentenang ambori Yohongni we wau tuti nemu ririanei. Tuti Yau ambori Yohong kariri kaiwo faforao Yohongnai kawurua we nemu dai Abrahami ne. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Yau ambori inari nemu ririanei bitoya netarai toyari awaha na rorafaisi. Tuti ambori Yohong katai nini sentenang we nemu ririanei. Tuti na nemu ririanei, kaiwasa na nunei sentenang esobu moangfo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">Nun. 22:16-18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Weo nemu dai Abrahami tarao Nehu kaiwone kawurua ampa. I niari kariri fi kiaio Yemi weafo, Nehu kaiwo kutuane, tuti Nehu kaiwo aunau ne.” <verse eid="GEN 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Ampefe Isaki niayai na Geraria.<verse eid="GEN 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Na kutu inontarai Gerari fosa etutangni we Ribkai, Isaki yoa wesa deyo, “Rorohuwing dine.” Weo Isaki mitai yoa we ne wiwing dine, enetituaitai dohonao inontarai fosa na katai nani emungnife tuti eha Ribkai, weo ureng bohi paria.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Nun. 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 20:2">20:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Isaki kawurua niayai na wanai wairoi kuteaia. Na rahida bei, Abimeleki mananu inontarai Filistini foi doari deti na suwireifoi aweu, na tantuma deti Isaki fiaung ne wiwingno Ribkai. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Mayeai Abimeleki sahu Isaki ma tuti medu wei deyo, “Yeitawanaifa weo i mani nemu wiwing dine. Todoni fino modu boyo nemu tahatui dine nina?” Isaki yoa wei deyo, “Enehutituaitai, masino yeyo nehu wiwing dine mani, inontaraifosa na katai nini emung yau tuti eha Ribkaife.” <verse eid="GEN 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Wape Abimeleki medu wei deyo, “Fianai aino nari we amea ninai? Masino inontarai Gerari nesa manei dena ria nemu wiwingfoi, tuti fi nanai kawariai mani, wauno wedaya sasari we ameane.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Mayeai Abimeleki deretawang ne inontaraifosa kiai deyo, “Mandoni dino tetawa inontarai nini ete ne wiwingnei mani, ambori sobu aiboi mararehafo.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Na kutu Isaki niayai na katai nani, i dohong romi tuti sanang fi, na fuina bo nani kontaio fi sanangfo wetarai piaring we kiparai, weo Yahwei mioangni fefe. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Ne rafoi bitoya tuti ne rafoi bitoya aha, donio i weinontarai mano ne ra bitoya paria. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Isaki ne fiahung kambing, domba tuti sapi bitoya paria, kontaio ne mangfata erufi wei efau paria, donio inontarai Filistini fosa enemirorong pirahai wei. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Donio kamirei merehao tamang Abrahami ne mangfatafosa esirayai na raminde minohi darangfo, inontarai Filistini fosa etaukahobuai na kahofa aha.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Mayeai Abimeleki medu we Isaki deyo, “Ro weru amene katainei, weo nemu mambiriufo fuba sewa amea ampa.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Ampefe Isaki da weru Gerari, da to enang Geraria biaung ne yawa tendafoi tuti niayai na nanai. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Mayeai Isaki demi ne mangfata fosa esirai riwang kamirei merehao raminde tamang Abrahami ne mangfatafosa esirayafo, weo inontarai Filistini fosa etaukahobuai aha, na kutu Abrahami mireha kawuru ampo. Kamirei merehafoi kiai Isaki dohong wonongfo kariri wonongno raminde tamang Abrahami dohongnafo.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Isaki ne mangfatafosa kontai esarai kamirei merehafo na enang Gerari nanai, esobu mereha urengfoi duwi pampang. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Mayeaia mani mantahung fiahung fosa na Gerari, erama emamuna we Isaki ne mantahung fiahung fosa. Emadu eteyo, “Kamirei mereha nini amene fi dine.” Ampefe Isaki dohong kamirei merehafoi wonong fino Eseki, nana mani “Aiteta.” Weo emamuna we Isaki ne mantahung fosa na wana.<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Ainanaya Isaki ne mangfatafosa esarai kamirei mereha bei siai aha, wape inontarai Gerari fosa emamuna we Isaki ne mangfatafosa aha. Ampefe Isaki dohong kamirei merehafoi wonong fino “Sitnai” nana mani “Mamuna.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Mayeai Isaki da weru katai nani, tuti ne mangfatafosa esarai kamirei mereha bei siai aha. Wape wiro emamuna wei ahang kaha, ampefe Isaki dohong kamirei merehafoi wonong fino “Rehoboti” nana mani “Katai fiabai.” Tuti medu deyo, “Ninaia mani, Yahwei dohong tata tahasau ampa, donio tanayai na mai na katai nini tuti tatawing separaifa.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Na nanai Isaki da to Bersyeba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Mayeai dirua mani Yahwei deinawi netarai we Isaki, tuti Medu wei deyo, “Yau mani Allai mano tamamu Abrahami somi weifoi di Yau. Wiro mutai fanai, weo Yau ambori Iwe riria wau. Yau ambori Imoang wau tuti Inari nemu ririanei bitoya. Weo Yererai kawurua we Abrahami, Nehu mangfatafoi ampa.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Mayeai Isaki biaung mesba bei na Bersyeba we somi we Yahwei na nanai. I biaung ne yawa tendafoi tuti ne mangfatafosa esarai kamirei mereha bei na nanai.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Na rahida bei, Abimeleki mananu Gerari foi tuti ne mantaunau Ahusati, tuti Pikholi mano wenunggamiei we afai mamuna fosa, itorama itotuambawa Isaki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22">Nun. 21:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Ainanaya Isaki dutang sitoru deyo, “We fianie muntorama muntotuambawa yau ninai? Raminde nanai menemirireu yau tuti metata yau weru mene katainei. We fiani muntora we yau ma nina?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Itoroa wei itoreyo, “Amewati terai na ameuremine we Yahwei weriria wau paria. Ampefe amemadu ameteyo ne mahikai mani, wau tuti amea tafafora tuti tatabuhi kaiwo arera ruhiai, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />weo wau ambori wiro nari karirafo we amea kaha. Tuti amea kontaio wiro amenari karirafo we wau kaha, mae amenari ne bengfo we wau tuti ametua wau ro na maia. Kasau we amea ampa weo Yahwei mioang wau.”<verse eid="GEN 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Mayeai Isaki meinenang fiangfo, etampi etunung ruhiai na mai. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Aha kamiaia mani, itorohong kaiwo arerai na itofafora ruhiai. Mayeai Isaki sawing sitoru tuti itora werui na maia.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Na rahida nani kontaio Isaki ne mangfatafosa era ma eteisaharai wei, kariri kamirei mereha esarai kawuru ampafoi, tuti emadu wei eteyo, “Amesobu mereha ampa.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Mayeai Isaki dohong kamirei merehafoi wonong fino “Syeba” nana mani “Fafora,” donio bendari nani wonong fino Bersyeba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bersyeba na kaiwo Iberani mani “Kamirei mereha Fafora” ete “Kamirei mereha Itu.” Atina Kejadiani 21:31.</char></note> paria sobu ninai.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Na kutu Esauwi ne fuina piaru fo (40) mani, kia kamitung inontarai Heti mandu we ne wiwing, amani Yuditi, Beeri ne kamitungfoi tuti Basmati, Eloni ne kamitungfoi. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Wiwingfo suru unari Isaki tuti Ribkai unemirorong pirahai paria.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Isaki mioang Yakupi wekaisung fuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Na kutu Isaki weinongkutungna tuti urengfo fafa, donio wiro deti ahang kaha, ampefe sahu Esauwi ne kaisung fubafoi, tuti medu wei deyo, “Nehu kaisung ne waune.” Esauwi yoa we tamangna deyo, “Daie, boyo!” <verse eid="GEN 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaki medu we Esauwi deyo, “Boti, iweinonggutung ampa, tuti wiro yeitawang rahida imereha nayafo kaha. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Ampefe ka nemu afaiwai tuti atowa, ro to airorongfo wera we andowa manei we yau. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Andowa netaraiwai rang ne maingfo kariri nehu fiang yohong weafo, mayeai ka we yau ma, ambori yangna kai mani imoang wau na iminohi yarang nina.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Wape Ribkai tarao kaiwo Isaki medurai we Esauwi, ne kaisungfoi. Na kutu Esauwi da to airorongfo sera we andowa we tamangnafo, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Ribkai medu we Yakupi, ne kaisungfoi deyo, “Arahio tarahuo tamamu medu we nemu tafua Esauwi deyo, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />Wera we andowa manei, rangni we fiang maing we yau, ambori yang tuti imoang wau na Yahwei arongfo, na iminohi yarang nina. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Ampefe nehu kaisung ne wau, taramuo kaiwo imadurane tuti bohong kaririai. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Ro to tone katai kambing tuti domba etoa nayafo, birio kambing antung biriaya mandu, ambori irang suru we fiang maing we tamamuai toyario ne eneoafo. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Ka we daia we dang, ambori mioang wau na minohi darang nina.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Mayeai Yakupi medu we inangno Ribkai deyo, “Wape nehu tafua Esauwi ne taraifoi wenuawuru, mae yau mani bereri. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Dohonao dai wara kariri nehu tarainei we wenuawuru kahafo. Nana mani deitawangnai we itofari, ampefe wiro mioang yau kaha, mae deikanggani yaufe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Wape inang medu wei deyo, “Yauno isodai ne tonanafo ne. Ampefe taramuo nehu kaiwone, roa ka kambing antung mandu ma.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Ainanaya Yakupi da wa kia kambingfo suru we inanai ma. Mayeai inang niaria we fiang maing, toyari fiangno tamang dohong we dangfo. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Mayeai Ribkai kia ne kaisung fuba Esauwi ne ansung mehikaio derarati na munu rorongfo ma, ainanaya demi ne kaisung fui Yakupi sataraifa. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Tuti sensang wedua Yakupi warangfo tuti rahanang we nuawuru kahafo na kambing rerawafo. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Ainanaya dohong fiangno yangnaia maing nanai tuti roti niunungfo we ne kaisungno Yakupia.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Ainanaya Yakupi suayai to tamang ne rorongfoi afui, tuti medu deyo, “Daie!” Tamang yoa wei deyo, “Nehu kaisung mandoni diwau?” <verse eid="GEN 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakupi yoa we tamanai deyo, “Yau Esauwi, nemu kaisung fubafoi di yaune. Yohong kariri kaiwo dai modurai we yaufe ampa. Boa bari wau munohi tuti bangno andowa tarai imungni tuti irangnia nini, ambori dai moang yau.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Mayeai Isaki medu we ne kaisungfoi deyo, “Nehu kaisung ne wau ahera paria we wobu andowane.” Yakupi yoa deyo, “Yahwei, nemu Allai andino fiata yaune.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Ainanaya Isaki medu we Yakupi deyo, “Ro kefang yau ma ambori warahururang kariri wau, taraie nehu kaisung Esauwi di wau ete bereri e.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Mayeai Yakupi da kefang tamang Isakia, tuti tamang wararurang kariri tuti medu deyo, “Rawafuinei mani, rawafui Yakupi, wape wararengne mani, warareng Esauwi.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Ampefe Isaki wiro deroangno Yakupi kaha, weo wararengfo wenuawuru toyari Yakupi ne tafua Esauwi fefe. Wape na kutu Isaki de mioang Yakupi mani, <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />dutangnai aha deyo, “Taraie nehu kaisung Esauwi di wau e?” Yakupi yoa we tamangna deyo, “Yo! Yau aranane.” <verse eid="GEN 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Mayeai Isaki medu deyo, “Bohong fiangwa kefang yau ma, ambori yang andowa taraio rangnawa, tuti imoang wau.” Ampefe dohong fiangfo kefang we tamangnaia, mayeai tamang dangna. Tuti kia angguri kontai we tamangnaia we dunung.<verse eid="GEN 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Mayeai tamang Isaki medu wei deyo, “Nehu kaisung ne wau, ro kefang yau ma tuti nuna yau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Ainanaya Yakupi da kefang tamangnaia tuti niuna tamanai. Na kutu Isaki niuna Esauwi ne ansungno Yakupi satarafo ne nunsaifo nanai, mioang Yakupi, na medu deyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">“Tarai nehu kaisungnei ne nunsaine toyario nunsai airorongno Yahwei mioangna fo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:27-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Ibr. 11:20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Kadono Allai ambori dohong randamang na rorafaisi bia sau nemu kahofane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:28">tuti kahofafo beng tuti potang kontaio angguri bitoya paria aha.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Kaiwasanei kiai na nunei ewemangfata we wau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">tuti kaiwasa na doni kontai ambori esomi we wau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">tuti wau weparenta nemu doroi fosa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">tuti nemu ai ne arikang fosa esomi we wau.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Mandoni dino deikanggani wau mani, wenani kontaio Allai deikanggani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">tuti mandoni dino mioang wau mani, wenani kontaio Allai mioangni.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Nun. 12:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Isaki mioang Yakupia kai tuti Yakupi da to boriai weru tamang Isaki, wiro waroi ahang kaha mae, ne tafua Esauwi daraberahi na sangfo ma. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />I kontaio meinenang fiang maingfo, mayeai kia da we tamangnaia. Medu we tamanai deyo, “Daie, boabari wau bang andowa imuninei ne taraio irangnane, ambori moang yau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Wape Isaki medu wei deyo, “Mandoni di wau?” Esauwi yoa deyo, “Esauwi diyau, nemu kaisung fubafi diyau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Na kutu Isaki deitawangnai we Esauwi dinani, soiri tuti netaraifoi rirora, ampefe medu deyo, “Mandoni dino antanafa miung andowafoi tuti yangnia miasa kiari we yau ma nina? Yau yangna kai kawurua, na wiro roma kaharai tuti imoangni kawuruampa, tuti todoni kontaio i mani inontarai mano sobu moangfo ampa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Na kutu Esauwi tarao kaiwo tamang medurafo nanai, enerorong pirahai tuti sai na mambiriu. Tuti medu we tamanai deyo, “Daie, moang yau kontai!” <verse eid="GEN 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Tamang yoa wei deyo, “Bereri! Wiro imoang wau kaha. Weo nemu tahatuifoi da ma tetofa yau, tuti kia moangno yohongnai we waufo ampa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esauwi medu deyo, “Antu to we i mani ahui we Yakupi, weo tetofa yau we beru ampa. Dewa nehu hakio iwe kaisung fubafo, tuti dewa nario moangnaio we yaufo.” Mayeai Esauwi dutang tamanai aha deyo, “Daie, nemu moang siai feai we yau ahang kahae?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Nun. 25:29-34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Ainanaya Isaki yoa we Esauwi deyo, “Taramuma, iruasi kawurua we wenungkamiei sau wau. Tuti ne doroi fosa kawurua yohongsa ewe mangfata wei, tuti imoangni na yohong potang tuti angguri wei. Ampefe nehu kaisung ne wau, fianai aino yohongnai we wau ahang ne?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esauwi medu we tamangna deyo, “Daie, manta moangna beyari nanai terai na waune ne? Daie moang yau kontai.” Tuti Esauwi sai na rawafui fiabai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:17">Ibr. 12:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Mayeai tamang Isaki yoa wei deyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“Taramuo yau, wau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fi ninai we Esauwi tuti ne ririanei.</char></note> ambori nayai wairoi weru kahofa bengne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">tuti nayai waroi weru randamang na rora faisi.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Wau ambori munohifo na nemu fi mamuna wa terai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">tuti wau ambori wewoming we nemu tahatuifoi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Wape masino rurai paria momuna mani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">ambori kaharai weru ne mambiriufo ki.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Ibr. 11:20</ref>.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:8">Nun. 36:8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:20">2Raj. 8:20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakupi wewu netarai to Harani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Esauwi enerireu Yakupi paria, weo moangno tamang Isaki dohongnai weifo. Mayeai Esauwi medu na enerorong deyo, “Waroi ahang kaha mae nehu dai ambori mireha rai. Na rahida antowe koya we dai foa kai mani, yau ambori imung nehu tahatui Yakupi!” <verse eid="GEN 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Na kutu Ribkai tarao fi ne kaisung fuba Esauwi samafo nanai, demi inontarai manei sahu ne kaisung fui Yakupi ma, mayeai medu wei deyo, “Nemu tafua Esauwi de biai ne kasoufo na miung wau. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Ampefe nehu kaisungne wau, taramuo nehu kaiwone. Moinenang we wowu nemu tarai to Harani, we rorohumang Labani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Tuti munohi riati toura kuteai na nanai paria nemu tafuai ne kasoufo kai, <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />tuti aroporo fianai aino nari kawuru wei ampo. Mayeai ahang wori yemi inontarai manea eha wau to ninai ma ki. Weo wiro imaya we mumarareha na rahida boyari kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Mayeai Ribkai da wa medu we Isaki aha deyo, “Wiro enehuoa kahai we wiwing Heti Esauwi kia suru we ne wiwingfo. Masino Yakupi kontai kia wiwing Heti manei we ne wiwing mani, wefianie yarang? Neo mahikai mani imereha ra.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Mayeai Isaki sahu Yakupia, ainanaya mioangni tuti deretawangni deyo, “Wiro ka wiwing Kanani manei we nemu wiwing fanai. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Moinenang ro to Padan-Arami, to inamu Ribkai tamang Betueli, tufumuaifa ne munufoia. Na wanai ka inamu roromang Labani ne kamitung manei we nemu wiwing. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Kadono Allai Mano Wemambiriu Sewafoi mioang wau, niari wau bawing separai tuti niari wau nemu riria bitoya, donio ewe kaiwasa bitoya. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Kadono I dohong moang we wau tuti nemu ririanei kariri ne dohongnai we Abrahamifo, donio wau nemu katai nini, katai munohi nai we inontarai aisei,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Nun. 17:4-8</ref>.</char></note> kataio Allai dohongni we Abrahami kawuruampa.”<verse eid="GEN 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Ainanaya Isaki sawing Yakupia, mayeai Yakupi da to Padan-Arami, da we Betueli inontarai Arami foi ne kaisung Labani, Yakupi tuti Esauwi uinami Ribkai roromangfoi.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Esauwi detio Isaki kawurua mioang Yakupi tuti sawingni da to Padan-Arami we kia wiwing na nanai. Na kutu mioang Yakupi fo deretawangni deyo, “Wiro ka kadawing Kanani manei we nemu wiwing fanai.” <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Tuti Yakupi taraoai tuti niari kariri kaiwo tamanai tuti inanai umadurafo, tuti da to Padan-Arami. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Ampefe Esauwi deitawanai, weo tamang Isaki wiro eneo wiwing Kanani kaha. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Nanai wedaya Esauwi da we Ismaelia tuti kia Mahalati we ne wiwing, kiontaio ne wiwing fafongfo suru. Mahalati mani Abrahami ne kaisung Ismaeli ne kamitung dine, imani Nebayoti ne tahatui dine.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakupi ne amieifoi na Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Mayeai Yakupi da weru Bersyeba tuti da to Harani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Da paria sobu katai bei, tuti fiotourai na nanai, weo wofoi sawaia. I kia kamiei bei na katai nani tuti dohongni we airukang we deirukani, mayeai denawa. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Na kutu denafo, i demiei, deti tehi bei doari na nunei paria sobu rorafaisi, tuti deti Allai ne wewai fosa ebia etautai na tehifoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:51">Yoh. 1:51</ref>. </char></note><figure style="fig" alt="Yusupi demiai" file="CO00683C.TIF" size="col" ref="28:12" /> <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Na amiei rorongfo deti Yahwei doa rurangni mae medu wei deyo, “Yau mani Yahwei di Yau, Allai mano tufumu Abrahami tuti tamamu Isaki usomi wei foi di Yau. Kahofa katai watai nai nini ambori Yohongni we wau tuti we nemu ririafoi ki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:14-15">Nun. 13:14-15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Nemu ririanei ambori ne bitoyafo toyario kangganang kahofa, esefarai to do wanang murang, to do wanang fui, do wanang ba tuti do wanang sai. Tuti na wau kontaio nemu ririanei, kaiwasa kiai na nunei ambori esobu moangfo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Nun. 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Taramu ma, Yau ambori iweriria wau pampang tuti Yau ambori yeitawang wau to katai bodoni dino ro weifo. Yau ambori ika wau to katai nini aha ma, weo Yau wiro itawing wau kaha, Yau ambori yohong kariri fianai aino Yererai we wau kawuruampo.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Na kutu Yakupi denawa doafo i medu deyo, “Tarai, antanafa Yahwei niayai na katai nini, tuti wiro iwaitawangnai kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Mitai tuti medu deyo, “Katai nini mirarebanai paria. Tarai, Allai ne munufoi di nini, rahutu fiabai waidani di nini.” <verse eid="GEN 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Kamiaia mani Yakupi kia kamieio deirukanifoi, tuti dohongni doa tirai we kamiei tugu we deinawi kariri fi nanai, tuti sari maning saitunifo to kamieifoi we somi we Allai. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Yakupi dohong katai nani wonong fino Beteli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beteli na kaiwo Iberani mani, Allai ne munu.</char></note>, fafongpa bendari nani wonong fino Lusi.<verse eid="GEN 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Mayeai Yakupi dohong kaiwo arera deyo, “Masino Allai ambori weriria yau tuti ambori Deitawang yau na rangbo iranai nini, tuti Dohong roti we yang tuti ansung we itatarai, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />donio yarabera yau na mai to nehu dai ne munufoi aha, ampefe Wau terai Yahweh mano isomi we Wau. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Tuti kamieio yohongni doatirai we tugu nini ambori we katai we omi we Allai. Na fi kiaio Bohongni we yaunei ambori yohong sepersepuluh we wau pampang.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi na Labani ne munufoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Mayeai Yakupi da weru Beteli, da fo waroi paria to do wanang murangfoi. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Na kutu deti wari kataifoi sentenang, deti kamirei mereha bei na katai kehabi weninoi foi, tuti deti kambing tuti domba rabuang botoru ewatai kefang kamirei merehafoi. Weo na kamirei mereha nani dino inontarai etohong ene kambing tuti domba etunung mereha nai ne. Kamirei merehafoi etabungni na kamiei fuba bei. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Masino mantahungfosa efanduhi kambing tuti domba rabuangfosa kiai to kamirei mereha foia mani, mantahungfosa etadoi kamieifoi weru kamirei merehafoi borongfo. Mayeai etohong kambing tuti domba etunung. Masino etunungna kai mani, mantahungfosa etadoi nari kamieifoi aha wedua kamirei merehafoi borongfo.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakupi dutang mantahung fiahung fosa deyo, “Doroi meaine, mera na doni ma?” Eroa wei eteyo, “Amera na Harani ma.” <verse eid="GEN 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Yakupi dutang berasa nariai aha deyo, “Metaroangso Nahori tufumangno Labanie?” Eroa wei eteyo, “Yo, ametaroangsoi.” <verse eid="GEN 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Ainanaya dutangnai aha deyo, “Minohi na mai e?” Eroa wei eteyo, “Minohi na mai. Botia, ne kamitungno Raheli diwani, da tuti ne kambing tuti domba fosa ma wana.” <verse eid="GEN 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Mayeai Yakupi deyo, “Mewati, rahida rabuang nendai, wiro ramindena we mefanduhi fiahungnesa to ene munu fiahungfoi kaharai. Ampefe metohong mene kambing tuti domba fosa etunungwo, mayeai mehasara etampi aha.” <verse eid="GEN 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Wape eroa wei eteyo, “Wiro amenari tonana kaha. Ametamang paria fiahung rabuangfosa era kiai ma kawuru wo, arahio ametadoi kamieifoi weru kamirei merehafoi borongfo, tuti ametohong amene kambing tuti domba nesa etunung finanai.” <verse eid="GEN 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Na kutu Yakupi medu ria ea rai mae, Raheli da tuti tamang ne kambing tuti domba fosa ma, weo andino dehungsa ne. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Na kutu Yakupi deti Raheli, nera Labani antuwingfoi tuti ne kambing tuti domba fosa nanai, da kefangna, mayeai dedoi kamieifoi weru kamirei merehafoi borongfo tuti dohong kambing tuti domba fosa etunung. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Mayeai Yakupi niuna Raheli tuti sai na rawafui fiabai, weo firaise fefe. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Ainanaya Yakupi deikaririai we Raheli deyo, “Yau mani Labani rorowingno Ribkai ne kaisung di yau.” Ampefe Raheli mitoa deisaha kaiwo taraoafo we tamangno Labani. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Na kutu Labani tarao kaiwo kariri rorowingno Ribkai antungno Yakupi nana fo, mito ahera weia. Mayeai fiaungni tuti niunahi, ainanaya kiari to ne munufoia. Ampefe Yakupi deisaha kariri fi fuba sodairi foi kiai we Labani. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labani medu wei deyo, “Tarai, wau tuti yau mani rika fifau.” Ampefe Yakupi minohi ria Labani embai bei.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Mayeai Labani medu we Yakupi deyo, “Wau mani anohumang di wau, mai kahai we rufi we yau arora. Boisaharai we yau fiembaitai fianai aino masi we yohongnai we wau ne?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Labani ne kamitung mandu, mano fuba foi wonong fino Leai tuti mano fui foi wonong fino Raheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Leai urengfo mahikai, wape Raheli urengfo mahikai sewa tuti netarai denteng paria. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakupi ne mayanafo nayai na Raheli, ampefe medu we Labani deyo, “Yeyo irufi we wau defuina itu we isobu Raheli, nemu kamitung fui wai.” <verse eid="GEN 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Ainanaya Labani yoa wei deyo, “Mahikai sewa mani yohongni we wau, masino yohongni we inontarai siai. Ampefe munohi ria yau na nina.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Ampefe Yakupi yufi defuina itu we sobu Raheli, wape defuina itu nanai toyari rahida beiru teai, weo ne mayanafo nayai na Raheli fefe.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Defuina itu foa kaia nanai, Yakupi medu we Labani deyo, “Rahida turapawafo mai ampa, ampefe bohongno Raheli we yau, ambori irauti.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Ainanaya Labani wenoti inontarai na nana fosa ma tuti niari muniara mandirau foi. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Wape dirua mani, Labani kia Leai we Yakupia, donio Yakupi dena riatia. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Tuti Labani dohongno Silpai kontai ambori we woming we ne arikang Leai.<verse eid="GEN 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Wape kamiaia mani, na tantuma Yakupi detioai weo Leai dine. Ainanaya Yakupi medu we Labani deyo, “Wefianie nari yau toninai? Irufi we wau we isobu Raheli, todonie tofa yau?” <verse eid="GEN 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani yoa wei deyo, “Na amene koangnei mani, wiro inontarai manei dohong ne kamitung fui foi rirau fafong weru mano fuba foi kaha. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Bomang rahida ituo ohongsua mune muniara mandiraune kai kawuruwo, ambori yohong Raheli we wau we fiembaitai, masino rufi we yau defuina itu aha.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Ainanaya Yakupi niari kariri finanai, amani dohongsua ne muniara mandirau ria Leai foa kai, mayeai Labani dohong ne kamitungno Raheli we Yakupi dauti. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani kontai dohong ne woming wiwingno Bilhai, ambori Bilhai we woming we ne kamitung Raheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yakupi dena ria Raheli, tuti ne mayanafo tau we Raheli sewa Leai. Ampefe yufi we Labani defuina itu aha.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakupi ne arikangfosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Yahwei detioai we Yakupi ne mayanafo tau we Raheli sewa Leai, ampefe Dohong Leai nearikang, mae Niari Raheli kirawahi. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Leai doama, minohituti ne kaisung manei, dohongni wonong fino Rubeni. Weo enetituai deyo, “Antu, Yahwei kawurua Detio nehu dadirane, ampefe ninaia mani nehu mangnei ne mayanafo ambori tau we yau.”<verse eid="GEN 29:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Leai nearikang nariai aha, minohituti ne kaisung manei, medu deyo, “Tarai we Yahwei taraoai. Weo wiro nehu mangnei ne mayana tau we yau kaha, ampefe Dohong arikang nini kontai we yau aha.” Ainanaya dohong ne kaisungfoi wonong fino Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Leai doa ahama, ainanaya minohituti ne kaisung manei. Ampefe medu deyo, “Kutu nina mani, nehu mangnei enerorongfoi sawaia mitu we yau, weo iminohituti kaisung mantoru wei fefe.” Ainanaya dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino Lewi. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Mayeai mani Leai doama minohituti ne kaisung manei aha. Ampefe medu deyo, “Nina mani yau ambori ifiai Yahwei.” Nanai wedaya Dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino Yehudai. Na minohituti Yehudai kawuruampo wiro nearikang ahang kahaia.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Na kutu Raheli deitawanai we wiro ne arikang we Yakupi kahai nanai, enerorong pirahai we ne tafuai. Ampefe medu we Yakupi deyo, “Bohong arikang manei we yau, bereri mani imereha rai.” <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Ampefe Yakupi kesou Raheli paria tuti medu deyo, “Allai di yau e? Donio nehu mambiriu we iwedua wau we nemu arikang kahai ninae?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Ainanaya Raheli medu wei deyo, “Boti nehu womingno Bilhai dinini. Bena riati ambori minohituti arikang manei we yau tuti na Bilhai isobu riria.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Ampefe dohongno ne womingno Bilhai we Yakupi ne wiwing, tuti dena riati. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Bilhai doama minohituti kaisung manei we Yakupi. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Ampefe Raheli medu deyo, “Allai Dohong ne maifo we yau, kontai kawurua Tarao fianai aino yutang wea fo, tuti Dohong kaisung manei we yau.” Nanai wedaya dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino, Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Raheli ne woming wiwingno Bilhai doama, minohituti kaisung mano mandufoi we Yakupi aha. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Ainanaya Raheli medu deyo, “Irurai paria we iwawoai ria nehu tafuai, tuti isobuaifa.” Ampefe dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino Naftali. <verse eid="GEN 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Na kutu Leai kontai deitawanai we i ne arikang ahang kahai nanai, kia ne woming wiwingno Silpai dohongni we Yakupi we ne wiwing. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Tuti Leai ne woming wiwingno Silpai minohituti kaisung manei we Yakupi. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Leai medu deyo, “Isobu mai ampa.” Ampefe dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino Gati. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Mayeai Leai ne woming wiwingno Silpai minohituti kaisung mano mandu foi we Yakupi aha. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Leai medu deyo, “Yau imirising paria! Ninaia mani, wiwingnesa kiai esahu yau we mano isobu mararisingne.” Ampefe dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino Asyeri.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Na kutu eteting potangfoi mani, Rubeni da na romi rorongfo, sobu dudaimi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dudaimi mani, aibongno ne reraung fiabai tuti ne ainari bemining ete weungu. Aibong dudaimi nini esahui kontai we “Aibong apeli mayana.” Aibong nini we rawang we dohong wiwing kirawahi ne arikang.</char></note> bong manea, ampefe kia ai bongfosa we inangno Leai. Raheli medu we Leai deyo, “Bohong dudaimi bongno nemu kaisungwai kiasa wasa, beiru teai we yau.” <verse eid="GEN 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Ainanaya Leai yoa wei deyo, “Oh! Wiro demoyarai we ka nehu mangnei kahae? Tuti nina mani boyo ka nari nehu aibong dudaimio nehu kaisungnei kiasa ma nesa ninae?” Raheli yoa wei deyo, “Bento ampefe diru nini Yakupi dena ria wau, we ibai nemu kaisungwai ne dudaimi bongnei.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Na kutu ramindenafo Yakupi daraberahi na romifo, Leai da weuwia tuti medu wei deyo, “Diru nini bena ria yau, weo ibai kutu wau na dudaimi bongno nehu kaisungnei kiarifoi ampa.” Ampefe diru nani Yakupi dena ria Leaia. <verse eid="GEN 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Ainanaya Allai yoa we Leai ne nadifoi. Ampefe Leai doama minohituti kaisung mano ringfoi we Yakupi. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Leai medu deyo, “Allai dohong fiembaitai we yau kawuru ampa, weo kawurua yohong nehu woming wiwingfoi we nehu mangnei ampa.” Ampefe dohong arikangfoi wonong fino Isakari. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Mayeai Leai doama minohituti ne kaisung mano wonang foi we Yakupi. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Ainanaya Leai medu deyo, “Allai kawurua dohong fikahutu mahikai paria we yau. Kutu nina mani, nehu mangnei ambori dohong sua yau, weo yawing kaisung wonang wei fefe.” Ampefe dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino Sebuloni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Mayeai Leai minohituti kamitung manei aha tuti dohongni wonong fino Dinai.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Ainanaya Allai aro Raheli ampefe yoa we ne nadifoi, tuti dohongni kirawahi kaha. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Ampefe Raheli doama minohituti kaisung manei. Ainanaya medu deyo, “Allai niari yau imamaya kahai ampa.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Ampefe dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino Yusupi, mae medu deyo, “Kadono Yahwei dohong kaisung manei we yau aha.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakupi sobu ra bitoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Raheli kawurua minohituti Yusupi fo, Yakupi medu we Labani deyo, “Daie! Boiai yau ambori yarabera yau to nehu katai itaubaunuhu nai foi aha. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Yeyo ika nehu wiwingnesa tuti nehu arikangnesa, ea kiai nehu fiembaitai na kutu irufi we waufo. Weo boitawanaifa irufi we waufo na mamboni paria.” <verse eid="GEN 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Wape Labani medu wei deyo, “Masino enemuwawu yau mani nayai na nina, weo wau wedaya mani Yahwei mioang yaune.” <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Kontai medu aha deyo, “Boyo ibai wau na beiru mani ambori ibaitai ki.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakupi yoa wei deyo, “Mantaung wau boitawang kariri todoni irufi we wau fo ampa, tuti todoni yehung nemu fiahungwasara bitoya nina. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Weo wiro nemu ra bitoya kaha, na rahida bo ira ma sobu wau fo. Wape ninaia mani nemu ra bitoya paria. Yahwei kawurua mioang wau na kutu inayai na ninaifa. Ampefe ninaia mani yeyo irufi we nehu munurorongne.”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani yoa deyo, “Fianai aino yohongnai we wau ne?” Yakupi yoa deyo, “Oh! Wiro yutang wau we bohong fieai we yau kaha. Mae yeyo yehung nemu kambing tuti domba wasa aha, masino roa we fi yeoane. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Rahida nini roa we yau, we ira sabu nemu domba ehamantatowarai rabuangnei kiai, tuti yiri domba antung mang mano nyumetang tuti kambing ehamantatowarai fosa kiai, ikasa we yau. Nana mani nehu fiembaita finana. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Tuti ambori na rahida fui mani boitawanai we inari fi na mai ete bereri e. Masino ro ma botio nehu fiembaitafo, amani kambing ehamantatowarai kaha tuti domba antung mang enuametang kaha fosa, nana mani ikamananasa ria wau.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Mayeai Labani yoa wei deyo, “Yo, iroa, ampefe nari kariri fi boyoai nanaia.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Ainanaya na rahida nani kontaio Labani diri kambing mang tuti kambing wiwingno enetarai ehamantatowara fosa tuti mano enetarai beibua kahutua fosa kiai, tuti domba mang enuametang fosa kiai, tuti dohongsa we ne arikangfosa ambori etahungsa.<verse eid="GEN 30:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Mayeai Labani demi ne arikang fosa eha fiahung fosa era wairoi rahida botoru, ambori enayai waroi weru Yakupi. Ampefe Yakupi niayai na nanai we deitawang Labani ne kambing tuti domba enaya fosa.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Mayeai Yakupi kia ai arirawang kahe na ai hawari, ai badami tuti ai berangani,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ai botoru ninai na kaiwo Iberani, wiro tanami na Indonesia kaha.</char></note> tuti seikahutu ai rerafo awao baibua, donio kiamantatowarai. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Yakupi dohong ai arirawangfo watai na katai kambing tuti domba fosa etunung nai foi. Weo kambing tuti domba fosa erirau mani na kutu erama etunungfo. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Masino kambing fosa erirau kefang ai arirawangfo mani, ambori ene arikangfosa ehamantatowaraifa.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Mayeai mani, Yakupi diri dombao ete eriraufosa tuti dohong domba tuti kambing ehamantatowarai tuti enuametang fosa enumiwawerasa, na Labani ne domba tuti kambing fosa. Na niari toninane Yakupi sobu fiahung efau we mantauni, tuti kiasa weru Labani ne kambing tuti domba fosa.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Na kutu kambing tuti domba mano ewemambiriu fosa erirau mani, Yakupi dohong ai arirawangfoa watai na katai kambing tuti domba fosa etunung mereha naifoi rorongfo. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Wape masino kambing tuti domba efanahang fosa erama mani, wiro dohong ai arirawangfoa watai na katai etunung mereha naifoi rorongfo kaha. Ampefe fiahung efanahang fosa mani we Labani, mae neo ewemambiriu fosa mani Yakupi nengsaine. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Na ne niari tonanafo Yakupi ne rafoi fiabai aha, tuti ne kambing tuti domba bitoya, woming mang tuti wiwing efau, keledai tuti unta bitoya kontai.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi wewu ne tarai weru Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Na rahida bei Yakupi taraoai we Labani ne kaisung fosa emadu eteyo, “Yakupi kawurua kia tane dai ne ra fi kiai sentenang ampa, tuti na tane dai ne rafoi, ne ra bitoya ninaifa.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Kontaio Yakupi detioai weo Labani urengfo wiro mararising kariri fafongne ahang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Mayeai Yahwei medu we Yakupi deyo, “Barabera wau we nemu wawa fosa ene nu foi tuti we nemu terafosara. Yau ambori iwiwiaing wau.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Ainanaya Yakupi demi inontarai manei sahu Leai tuti Raheli we ura weia to katai wia rora weninoifoi, katai ne kambing tuti domba etoa nai foi. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Mayeai medu we suru deyo, “Iwatio mune dai urengfo wiro mararising we yau kariri fafong nanai ahang kaha, wape towea kaha, weo Allai mano nehu dai somi wei nei weriria yau pampang. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Kontai muwaitawangnaifa, weo irufi we mune dai na mamboni paria. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Wape mune dai meikanggani yau, tuti yiwang nehu fiembaitafo pampang kawuru ampa. Masino tonanai ki, Allai wiro suati niari ne karirafo we yau kaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Weo na kutu mune dai medu deyo, ‘Kambing tuti domba ebaibua kahutua fosa mani ambori ewe fiembaitai we wau,’ ampefe kambing tuti domba fosa kiai etawing arikang ebaibua kahutuai. Tuti masino medu deyo, ‘Kambing tuti domba ehamantatowara fosa ambori we fiembaitai we wau,’ ampefe kambing tuti domba fosa kiai etawing arikang ehamantatowarai. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Tonanaifa, Allai kawurua kia mune dai ne fiahungfosa tuti dohongsa we yau.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />Na kutu kambing fosa ete eriraufo mani, yemiei tuti yetioai we kambing mang fosa erau kambing wiwing mano ehamantatowarai tuti ebaibua kahutua fosa. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Tuti Allai ne wewai manei medu we yau na amiei rorongfoi deyo, ‘Yakupe!’ Iroa wei yeyo, ‘Ya Seng, yau nina!’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Mayeai wewaifoi medu we yau deyo, Boti sauaraifa, kambing mang tuti domba mang fosa erau kambing wiwing tuti domba wiwingno ehamantatowarai tuti ebaibua kahutua fosa terai. Inari fi ninaifa, weo kawurua Yetio Labani meikanggani wau fo ampa. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Yau mani Allai mano Yeinawi nehu tarai we wau na Beteli fo. Na wanaifa wau baungno kamiai tugu tuti warari na maning saituni tuti bohong kaiwo arerai we Yau. Ampefe moinenang we ro weru nu nini tuti barabera wau to nu taubaunumu naifoi aha.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-22">Nun. 28:18-22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Ainanaya Raheli tuti Leai uroa we Yakupi ureyo, “Wiro ausobu fieai na dai ne rafoi ahang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Ninaia mani niari auru toyari inontarai aisei, weo dewayang auru we wau kawurua ampa. Kontai ra dewayang auru weafe mantauni dangna kai ampa. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Wape ra fubao Allai kiari weru aune daifoi tuti Dohongni we waufoi mani, ra nani we auru tuti tone arikangnesa. Ampefe nari kariri fianai aino Allai medurai we waufo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Ainanaya Yakupi meinenang fi kia fo, yuai ne arikangfosa tuti ne wiwingfosa to untafosa ayai. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Mayeai sikahera da tutu ne fiahung rabuangfoi tuti fi kiaio kawurua sobuai na Padan-Arami fo, da we tamang Isaki to kahofa Kanani. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Na kutu ete erafo mani, Labani da wa kiutu ne domba fosa enumiwawurufo na katai kehabi weninoifoi. Na kutu nanai kontaio Raheli kiamanana tamang ne terafimi fosa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Terafimi na kaiwo Iberani mani aririwangno nungkamieifoi toyari inontarai nungkamiei. Aririwang nini esomi wei weo andino deitawang ene munurorongfo ne.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakupi tetofa Labani inontarai Arami foi na wiro deisaharai, weo de wewu weruifo. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Ampefe Yakupi kia ne rafoi kiai tuti wewu weru Labania. I da kutu waya Efrati tuti da to uai Gileati.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani dawi Yakupi na kurufuifo aha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />We rahida botorua mani, arahio inontarai eteisaharai we Labani weo Yakupi wewu netarai ampa. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Na ahera Labani kia ne inontaraifosa efanduhisa tuti etawi Yakupi. Era wao rahida bo itufoi mani arahio ewati Yakupi na katai weuaio Gileati. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Dirua mani, Allai da ma na amiei rorong we Labani inontarai Arami foi, tuti medu wei deyo, “Bonansiau! Wiro modu kaiwo tapapa rabuang bei we Yakupi fanai!”<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Na kutu Labani tuti ne inontaraifosa erawa sobu kataifoi mani, Yakupi kawurua biaung ne yawa tendafoi na katai weuaio Gileati. Labani tuti ne inontaraifosa kontai ebaung ene yawa tendafo kefang we Yakupi. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Ainanaya Labani medu we Yakupi deyo, “We fianie nari toninaifa, donio tofa yau tuti wowu nehu kamitungne suru toyari inontaraio tofu suru na mamuna rorongfo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />We fianie tofa yau tuti bodiwa weru yau ninaifa? Todoni fino boisaharai we yau kaha, ambori yedung wau na mararising, na rarung tuti na rebana tuti kecapi? <figure style="fig" file="BK00184C.TIF" size="col" ref="31:27">Rebana</figure> <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Wau kontai wiro bohong rahida we yau we inuna nehu tafui ea tuti nehu kamitungfo suru kaha. Webonggoi paria na fi nari ninaifa. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Yau mani nehu mambiriu we inari ne karirafo we mea. Wape nemu dai ne Allai medu we yau na dirufa Deyo, ‘Bonansiau! Wiro modu kaiwo tapapa rabuang bei we Yakupi fanai.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Iwaitawangnai weo wau boyo barabera wau we nemu dai aha. Wape we fianie kumanana nehu aririwangfesa ninai?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Ainanaya Yakupi yoa we Labani deyo, “Imatai, weo enehutituaitai dohongnao kohiwa nemu kamitungne suru weru yau fe. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Wape werawa wobu nemu aririwangwai na mandoni mani, wenani sodai aiboi marareha fo. Wera wei na tune doroi nesa euremireane, werawa wobu nemu fieai ika mani, ka nemua.” Yakupi medu tonanai weo serawawerahai, weo Raheli dino kiamanana tamang ne terafimi fosa ne.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Ainanaya Labani suai to Yakupi ne yawa tendafoi afui tuti to Leai ne yawa tendafoi afui kontai to ne woming wiwingfo suru une yawa tendafo afui, sera we ne terafimi fosa. Wape wiro sobu terafimi fosa kaha. Mayeai suai to Raheli ne yawa tendafoi aha. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Wape Raheli kawurua kia terafimi fosa tuti sonisa na rotang untafoi tuti minohi tawangni. Labani sera yawa tendafoa kai, wape wiro sobu terafimi fosa kaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Ainanaya Raheli medu we tamanai deyo, “Daie, dohonao kosou yau fe, weo wiro yoa yemang we wau kaha, weo iwati fi wiwing fefe.” Tuti Labani sera sauarai na mai paria, wape wiro sobu terafimi fosa kaha.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Mayeai Yakupi kesou paria ampefe medu we Labani deyo, “Kahie! Inari sara fiani, tuti sasari fianai aino inarine, donio rurai paria we bawi yau ma ninaifa? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Wera maino amene fianggengfea kai ampa, ampefe kahi wobu nemu fi wera wea fea? Masino wobua mani, boinawiai na ninaifa, na nemu inontarai nesa tuti nehu inontarai nesa euremine, ambori ehutuaifa we na turu mani mandoni dino dohong sarawa kaha ne. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Defuina piarei (20) iminohi ria wau, nemu domba tuti kambing wasa wiro antung manei mireha na inang enemanabufoi kaha, tuti wiro yang nemu kambing tuti domba mang wasa manei kaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Andowa memuna miung maneia mireha mani, wiro ikari we wau ahama kaha, mae mantaung yauno iriwangni ne. Inontarai ehamanana manei na rahida ete dirufo mani, bawi yau we iriwangni. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Wofoi sina yau na rahidafo, diru mani ikararutu tuti wiro yena kaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Defuina piareia (20) ninai iminohi na nemu mununei, irufi we wau fuina suraya boa (14) we isobu nemu kamitungne suru, tuti fuina wonang (6) we isobu nemu fiahungnesa, tuti meikanggani yau na kutu nehu fiembaitafo pampang. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Masino Allai mano nehu tafui Abrahami somi wei tuti dai Isaki detori foi weriria yau kaha mani, taraie kahi tawing yau ira na warahu arora. Wape nehu dadirane tuti fi irune, kawurua Allai deitawanai ampa tuti I kawurua kiutu kaiwo na diruafa, we mandoni dino niari sarawane.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakupi tuti Labani urohong kaiwo arera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Ainanaya Labani yoa we Yakupi deyo, “Wiwing nini suru mani nehu kamitung suruine tuti arikang ninisa mani nehu tafui saine, tuti fiahung ninisa mani nehu fiahung saine. Kontai fi kiaio yetioai na nina mani nehu fi fine kai. Wape wiro inari fieai we irutawang nehu kamitungne suru tuti tafuisa kaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Ampefe tonana mani, ro ma tutabuhi kaiwo arerai na yau tuti wau, ambori kaiwo arerai ninai we fi aiririai pampang.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Mayeai Yakupi kia kamiei bei dohongnia doari we kamiei tugu. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Tuti Yakupi medu we une inontarai fosa deyo, “Mefanduhi kamiei feai.” Ampefe efanduhi kamieifoa tuti etauwa dadai. Mayeai ea kiai era ruhiaia eminohi etampi rurang kamiei etauwi foi. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Labani dohong kamiei etauwi foi na wonong fino Yegari-Sahadutai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yegari-Sahadutai na kaiwo Arami mani, kamiei tauwi we fiainawiai.</char></note>, wape Yakupi dohong wonong fino Galeti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Galeti na kaiwo Iberani mani, kamiei tauwi we fiainawiai.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Ainanaya Labani medu deyo, “Kamiei tutauwi nini, na rahida bonini tofongna mani, we fi ainawiai we yau tuti wau.” Nanai wedaya kamiei utauwi nini dohongni wonong fino Galeti <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />tuti Mispai. Weo Labani medu deyo, “Kadono Yahwei deitawang wedua turu, na kutu tunayai taterai wairoi ki. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Masino meikanggani nehu kamitungne suru ete rau wiwing siai aha mani, aromuoaifa, wiro inontarai manei niayai kefang turu kaha, wape Allai dino deitawang turu ne.”<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Tuti Labani medu we Yakupi aha deyo, “Kamiei tutauwinei tuti kamiei tugu inariri doa nini, andino we fiainawiai we yau tuti wau. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Kamiei tutauwinei tuti kamiei tugu nini we fiainawiai weo wiro ira roaing kamiei ne suru mau sobu wau, we inari karira we wau kaha, tuti wau kontai wiro ro roaing kamiei ne suru ma nari karira we yau kaha. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Allai mano tane wereng Abrahami tuti Nahori usomi wei foi, Andino kiutu kaiwo we turu.” Ainanaya Yakupi fefora na Allai mano tamang Isaki somi weifoi. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Tuti Yakupi miung andowa manei, dohongni we korbani na uaifoi. Ainanaya wenoti inontarai fosa kiai ma etampi ruhiai tuti etena na uaifoi. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Kameaia mani, Labani niuna ne tafuisa tuti ne kamitungfo suru tuti mioangsa. Mayeai daraberahi to ne katai niayai nai foi aha.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi mitai we da wa kenggung ne tafuai Esauwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Ainanaya Yakupi da nariai aha, mayeai Allai ne wewai fosa era ma ehangguni. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Na kutu Yakupi detisa nanafo medu deyo, “Katai nini Allai ne afai mamuna enayai nai.” Ampefe dohong katai nani wonong fino Mahanaimi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mahanaimi na kaiwo Iberani mani, yawa tenda boru.</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Mayeai mani Yakupi demi ne inontaraifo manea era foniai to kahofa Seiri na nu Edomi foi, we esobu ne tafua Esauwi. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />I dohong parenta wesa deyo, “Merawa memadu we nehu tafua Esauwi tonina, yau Yakupi, nemu mangfata nei. Yau inayai ria kahi Labani iwe inontarai aisei paria sobu rahida bonini. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Yau kawurua nehu sapi, keledai, kambing tuti domba, woming mang tuti wiwing. Tuti yemi nehu inontarai eteisaharai fi ninai we tafua wau, ambori enemuwawu yau.”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Ainanaya inontaraio Yakupi demisafo emadua kai nanai, mayeai etaraberasa we Yakupi aha tuti emadu wei eteyo, “Ameteisaharai we nemu tafua Esauwi kawurua ampa, tuti i da ma we sobu wau, da tutu ne inontarai piaring we bea (400).” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Yakupi tarao kaiwofo nanai mitai paria tuti arohuayai. Ampefe deto kutu ne inontarai era riati fosa, tuti ne fiahung kambing, domba, sapi tuti unta fosa we rabuang boru. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Weo enetituaitai deyo, “Masino Esauwi da ma memuna tuti sahatawang nehu inontarai nesa rabuang bei mani, rabuang bo wei foi ambori ekaharaifa.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Mayeai Yakupi wenadi deyo, “Ya Alla mano nehu tafui Abrahami tuti nehu dai Isaki usomi we Wau. Ya Yahweh Wauno kawurua Modu we yau Boyo, Barabera wau to nemu nufoi tuti nemu terafosara. Tuti Yauno yererai we ambori Yohong ne mahikaifo we wau. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Wiro imai we isobu Nemu Bengwa tuti Enemuwawuwa kaha, neo Boinawiai we Nemu mangfata ne yau. Weo manta ika aitatohi nini na kutu ira kutu waya Yardeni nini, wape yarabera yau to ninai ma ne nehu inontarai tuti fiahung rabuang boru ampa. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Kadono tawing yau weru nehu tafua Esauwi, weo imataiti fefe. Dohonao da ma miung yau tuti nehu wiwingnesa tuti nehu arikangnesa fe. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Weo Wau modu kawurua Boyo, Wau ambori nari mahikaifo we yau, tuti Nari nehu ririanei netarai toyario ninuaing na nafareng, ne bitoyafo wiro ato afongsoi kaha.” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Nun. 22:17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Ainanaya dirua mani dena na nanaifa. Kamiaia mani kia fiembaitafo dohongnai we ne tafua Esauwi, <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />amani, kambing wiwing piaring we beru (200) tuti kambing mang piarei (20), domba wiwing piaring we beru (200) tuti domba mang piarei (20), <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />unta piareia surao (30) etohong uio ene arikang fosa, sapi wiwing piaru (40) tuti sapi mang sura (10), keledai wiwing piarei (20) tuti keledai mang sura (10). <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Yakupi deto kahutu fiahung fosa werabuang beiru tuti dohongsa we ne mangfata fosa we ewaitawangsa. Medu wesa deyo, “Mera foni yau, tuti meteitawang merawa, wiro rabuang bei da kefang rabuang bei fanai.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Yakupi demi ne mangfata mano da fafongfoi deyo, “Masino ne tafua Esauwi sobu wau tuti dutang bera wau deyo, Nemu dai di mandonie? Tuti boyo ro to donie? Mandoni dino ne fiahung fuba nini kiaine? <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Roa wei tonina, Nemu mangfata Yakupi nengsaine. Fiahung nini kiai dohongsa we fiembaitai we ne tafua Esauwi wau, tuti Yakupi mantauni da na fui fe fo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Yakupi medu kaiwo nanai kontai we mangfata mandufoi tuti mantorufoi tuti inontarai fubao era tutu fiahung rabuangfoi kiai, deyo, “Toyari kaiwo antanafa imadurai kawurua nanai, memadurai we Esauwi masino mera sobui. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Tuti todoni kontaio meteisaharai wei meteyo, Nemu mangfata Yakupi mantauni datua amea na fuifo ma fo.” Weo Yakupi enetituaitai deyo, “Na fiembaitaio yohongnai ninai, kadono Esauwi enerorong denteng we yau, na wiro ausobu auru kaharai.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Ampefe fiembaitafo demi ne mangfata fosa eha fafong, wape mantauni dena na ne yawa tendafoi diru nani.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Allai dapa Yakupi na Penieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Diru nanai kontaio Yakupi doa weru denafo, kia ne wiwingfo suru tuti ne woming wiwingfo suru tuti ne arikang suraya mansiari (11) fosa, era kutu waya Yaboki na katai sayafo. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Kiasa era kutu waya foia nanai, Yakupi daraberahi aha tuti demi ne mangfata fosa eha ne fianggengfo era kutu wayafoi aha. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Mae Yakupi mesiri niayai na nanai. Na tantuma inontarai mang manei da wei ma, ururai we ubabari suru paria siwewarai. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Na kutu inontaraifoi deitawanai we wiro sahatawang Yakupi kahai nanai, bioifating Yakupi neina awedungfoi, ampefe neina awedungfoi tifating. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Ainanaya inontaraifoi medu wei deyo, “Tawing yau ambori ira, weo siwewarai ampa.” Wape Yakupi medu wei deyo, “Moang yau akawuru wori, itawing wau ro ki.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:24-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:3-4">Hos. 12:3-4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Ainanaya inontaraifoi dutang berahi deyo, “Wonomu fidoni?” Yakupi yoa wei deyo, “Yakupi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Mayeai inontaraifoi medu wei deyo, “Na ninai tofongna mani wiro wonomu fino Yakupi ahang kaha, mae Israeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israeli na kaiwo Iberani mani Yakupi dapa Allai.</char></note>. Weo bapa Allai tuti inontaraifoi tuti tahatawang suru.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:10">Nun. 35:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Ainanaya Yakupi dutang berahi aha deyo, “Wonomu fidoni?” Wape inontaraifoi yoa wei deyo, “We fianie butang we wonohune?” Mayeai mioang Yakupi na nanaia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:17-18">Hak. 13:17-18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Ampefe Yakupi dohong katai nani wonong fino Penieli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Penieli na kaiwo Iberani mani Allai urengfo.</char></note>. Weo deyo, “Yau kawurua yeti Allai urengfo na urehune ampa, wape wiro imereha kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Wofoi sambewaraia, mayeai Yakupi da weru Penieli, tuti da soberahi weo neina awedung neungfoi tifating fefe. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Nanai wedaya paria sobu nina mani, inontarai Israeli fosa wiro etangno andowa taraio nayai na awedungfoi kaha. Weo inontaraifoi bioi fating Yakupi awedung neungfoi fefe.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi tuti Esauwi uweboyari aha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Na kutu Yakupi da fo, yuai ureng detia mani, na tantuma deti Esauwi tuti ne inontarai ewepiaring webea (400) era tutiri ma. Ampefe deto ne arikangfosa we bea amani, Leai tuti ne arikangfosa, Raheli tuti ne arikangfosa, kontai ne woming wiwingfo suru tuti une arikangfosa. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Dohongno ne woming wiwingfo suru tuti une arikangfosa era na fongfo, Leai tuti ne arikangfosa era na rabuangfo, mae Raheli tuti ne kaisungno Yusupi ura na fui parifo. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Mayeai Yakupi mantauni da na fongfo, da wa kefang we Esauwi nanai, disangkapa awebuka somi aweu ureng disangso kahofa wau we beitu.<verse eid="GEN 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Wape Esauwi mitoa fiaungni tuti niunahi, ainanaya usai ruhiaifa. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Mayeai Esauwi detia tofongna mani, deti wiwing fosa tuti arikangfosa, ampefe dutangnai deyo, “Mandoni saino era ria wau ninai?” Yakupi yoa deyo, “Arikangno Allai kawurua dohongsa we nemu mangfata ne yau.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Ainanaya woming wiwingfo suru tuti une arikangfosa era kefangna, esomi we Esauwi. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Tonanai kontai Leai tuti ne arikangfosa, Yusupi tuti inangno Raheli, ea kontai era kefang Esauwia esomi wei. <verse eid="GEN 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Ainanaya Esauwi dutang Yakupi deyo, “Enemutituai fianie? Bomi nemu inontarai nesa tuti fiahung nesa era we rabuang ma ehanggung yau ninai?” Yakupi yoa wei deyo, “Ambori dai enemuwawu yau.” <verse eid="GEN 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Wape Esauwi medu wei deyo, “Nehu tahatuine waune, nehu fiahung bitoya kontai, ampefe ka nemu sara.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Wape Yakupi medu wei deyo, “Nari tonana fanai, masino isobu enemuwawuwa kawuru ampa, ampefe ka fiembaitaio yohongnai nina. Weo iwati uremune mani toyario iwati Allai urengfo, tuti bomang we yau na mai. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Ampefe ka fianai aino yohongnai kawurua we wau nina. Weo Allai kawurua dohongno mahikaifo we yau, tuti fianggeng bitoya paria we yau ampa.” Ampefe Yakupi wewori Esauwi pampang, donio Esauwi yoa we fianai aino dohongnafo. <verse eid="GEN 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Ampefe Esauwi medu deyo, “Tonana mani merama tara ruhiai pari, yau ambori ira na fongfo”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Wape Yakupi medu we ne tahafuai deyo, “Daie boitawanai weo nehu arikangnesa wiro ene mambiriu feai kaha, tuti kambing, domba tuti sapio etohong uio ene arikangfosa kontai. Masino tara ahera na rahida boyari mani, fiahung fosa kiai ambori emarareha rai. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Ampefe bento ro fafongna, yau, nehu arikangnesa tuti nehu fiahungnesa ambori amera tua wau to Seiri.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Ainanaya Esauwi medu deyo, “Tonana mani yohong nehu inontarai era ria yaune maneiru teai we efata wau.” Wape Yakupi deyo, “Nana fanai, weo kawurua demoyarai we isobu ne mahikaifo ria dai wau ampa.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Ampefe na rahida bo nani kontaio Esauwi tuti ne inontarai fosa etaraberasa to Seiri aha. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Wape Yakupi da ria Esauwi kaha, mae da to Sukoti, na wanai biaung ne munufoi tuti niari warumai we ne fiahungfosa. Nanai wedaya katai nani esahui we Sukoti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sukoti na kaiwo Iberani mani yawa tenda we adiwanai. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Mayeaia mani Yakupi da weru Sukoti. Na Padan-Arami Yakupi da to Kanani, da na mai paria sobu Sikemi, mayeai biaung ne yawa tendafoi na bendari Sikemi do wanang murangfoi. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Mayeai wiori kahofa feai na nanai ria Sikemi tamangno Hemori ne ririafosa, na doi peraki piaring (100) we biaung ne yawa tendafoi nai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos. 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Yoh. 4:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />I biaung mesba bei na nanai tuti dohongni wonong fino El, Allai mano Israeli somi wei.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Sikhemi dohong kanggani Dinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Na rahida bei Yakupi tuti Leai une kamitungno Dinai da wa suambawa wiwing Kanani maneiru teai na katai nani. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Mananu na katai nani mani inontarai Hewi dine, wonong fino Hemori. Na kutu antungno Sikemi deti Dinai nanai, wewuria tuti dohong kanggani. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Yakupi ne kamitungno Dinai kia enerorong paria, ampefe ne mayanafo tau wei nina. Donio yurai we wewori Dinai enerorongfoi ambori Dinai ne mayanafo tau wei. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Nanai wedaya Sikemi medu we tamangno Hemori deyo, “Daie! Yeyo irau kadawingfoi, ampefe roa butang wei.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Na kutu Yakupi taraoai we Sikhemi dohong kanggani Dinai nanai, wiro niari fieai kaha, weo ne kaisung fosa enayai na katai wiarora weninoifoi ewaitawang wedua ne fiahungfosa, ampefe Yakupi nemboru tutu kaiwofo paria etaraberasa wo.<verse eid="GEN 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Mayeai Sikemi tamangno Hemori da we Yakupia we medu riati. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Da wa mani tete Yakupi ne kaisung fosa etaraberasa na katai wiarora weninoifoi ma, tuti etarami kaiwofo nanai enemirorong pirahai tuti ehasou paria. Weo Sikemi kawurua dohong mamaya Israeli ne munurorongfo, na dohong kanggani Yakupi ne kamitungfoi. Na fi toninane, todoni kontaio wiro mai we nari kaha.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Ainanaya Hemori medu we Yakupi tuti ne kaisungfosa deyo, “Nehu kaisungno Sikemi enerorong sau we nemu kamitungwai paria. Kadono metohongni wei ambori kiari we ne wiwing. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Tuti roma tutabuhi kaiwo arerai, weo nemu inontarai wiwingnesa erau nehu inontarai mangnesa, tuti nehu inontarai wiwingnesa erau nemu inontarai mangnesa. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Menayai na katai nini ria amea, katainei fiabai we mea, menayai na ninai tuti merao nu nini na mantaung mea. Tuti menayai na ninaifa.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Mayeai Sikemi medu we Dinai tamangna tuti ne tafuaisa deyo, “Kadono meroa we fianai aino yutang weai nina, mae metutang we fiani mani ambori yohongnai ki, <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />masino fiembaitai fianai aino menemioane mani meteisaharai, tuti meteisaha arata ne fiabaifo. Yau ambori yohongnai ki, wape metohong kamitungfoi ikari we nehu wiwing.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Sikemi kawurua dohong kanggani Dinai, ampefe Yakupi ne kaisungfosa etatofa Sikemi tuti tamangno Hemori suru. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Emadu we suru eteyo, “Amemamaya we amene tahatuinei dau mangno wesunati kahafoi. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Ameroa we fio butang weane, masino wau tuti inontarai mangwasa kiai todoni kontaio mewesunati kariri amea. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Arahio ameroa we ametohong amene kamitungnesa mehasa we mene wiwing, tuti ameha mene kamitungwasa we amene wiwing. Amea kiai amenayai ria mea tuti tane nu boyari. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Wape masino wiro meroa we fio ameteyoai, we mewesunati fo kaha mani, ameha nari amerorombingnei tuti amera weru katainei.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Ainanaya Hemori tuti antungno Sikemi uroa we kaiwo emadurafo. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Sikemi bariboaifoi mani etatori paria na Hemori ne munurorongfo, i meinenang we sikaherawa daraberahi tuti dohong kariri kaiwo emadurafo, weo ne mayana tau we Yakupi ne kamitungno Dinai paria.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Mayeai Hemori tuti antungno Sikemi ura to rahutu borong bendarifoi tuti umadu we inontaraifosa kiai na bendarifoi ureyo, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Inontarai wanisa ete enayai ria tata na mai. Ampefe bento enayai na nu nini tuti eteyo enayai na doni mani na mantaungsa, weo katai nini fiabai we ea kontai. Ampefe taha ene kamitungfosa we tane wiwing tuti ea kontai eha tane kamitungnesa we ne wiwing. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Wape inontarai wanisa ete enayai ria tata tuti tane nu boyari, masino mang ne tata kiai todoni kontaio tawe sunati kariri ea. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Tuti masino tanari kariri fianai aino eteyoa fo mani, ene fiahungfosa tuti ene fianggengfoi kiai ambori we tata kontai ki. Ampefe merama taroa we kaiwo eteyoafo, ambori tanayai ruhiai.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Ampefe inontarai mano efanduhisa na rahutu borong bendarifoi eroa we kaiwo Hemori tuti antungno Sikemi umadurafo. Ampefe mang mano ebabafosa na bendarifoi ewesunati.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Na rahida bo botorufoi na ewesunati ampo, na kutuo mang mano ewesunati fosa enumiruainso epirahai. Yakupi ne kaisung mandu, amani Simeoni tuti Lewi, Dinai ne tafuai suruine. Uka une sondufo, na mamunggasai usuayai to bendarifoi afui, na wiro umatai kaha. Mayeai umung mang fosara ehai. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Umung Hemori tuti ne kaisungno Sikemi na sondu kontai, mayeai uka Dinai weru Sikemi ne munufoi.<verse eid="GEN 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Ainanaya Yakupi ne arikang mano wei fosa erama etawa inontarai mano emarareha fosa ene fianggengfo na bendarifoi. Ehasou tutu ene tahatui Dinai, weo Sikemi dohong kanggani fefe. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Etawa ene fiahung kambingfosa, dombafosa, sapifosa, keledaifosa tuti fi kiaio nayai na bendari rorongfo tuti na borieifo. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Etawa ene rafoi kiai, ene arikangfosa tuti ene wiwingfosa, eru aitamuosa. Kontai etawa fi kiaio watai na munu rorongfo na bendarifoi.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Mayeai Yakupi medu we Simeoni tuti Lewi deyo, “Munari wonohune karira ampa, ampefe nina mani inontarai Kanani tuti inontarai Ferisi tuti inontarai mano enayai na nu nini enemirireu yau. Wiro tafau kaha, masino efanduhisa we etapa tata mani, etahatawang tata, emung tata awao taworu.” <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Wape uroa wei ureyo, “Mawa we dohong kanggani amene tahatuinei toyari wiwing dirue?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi daraberahi to Beteli aha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Na rahida bei Allai medu we Yakupi deyo, “Moinenang we barabera wau to Beteli aha, we nayai na wanai tuti baungno mesba bei we Yau, Allai mano kawurua Yeinawi nehu tarai we waufoi, na kutu wowu nemu tarai weru nemu tafua Esauwi fo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:11-17">Nun. 28:11-17</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Mayeai Yakupi medu we ne munurorongfosa kiai tuti we inontarai fubao enayai ruhiafosa deyo, “Mehabi aririwang aiseio mehasa wasa, meruairurang menemirorong waia mirarebanai tuti metata ansung mararebanai. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Mera ma tamainenang tara to Beteli, na wanai ambori ibaungno mesba bei we Allai, mano kawurua Fiata yau na kutu isobu dadirafo tuti mano kawurua weriria yau na nehu rang rorong ira nayane.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Ainanaya etohong ene aririwang aisei watai riasafo tuti fimarandinai na etaramifo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fi marandinai na etaramifo mani, enari kontai we esomi we aririwang fosa tuti enari kontai we ai reraung sahu inontarai.</char></note>, etohongnaia kai we Yakupi, mayeai Yakupi kiara sirayai rurang ai fiabai rowei kefang to bendari Sikemi. <verse eid="GEN 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Na kutu Yakupi tuti ne inontarai fosa erafo, Allai ne mambiriufo nayai woru bendario watai kefang na nanafo. Ampefe inontarai na nana fosa ematai paria, donio wiro etawi Yakupi tuti ne inontarai fosa kaha.<verse eid="GEN 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Ainanaya Yakupi tuti ne inontarai fosa erawa sobu kahofa Kanani na bendari Beteli, fafongpa wonong fino Lusi. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Na katai nani Yakupi biaungno mesba bei tuti dohong kataifoi wonong fino El-Beteli, weo Allai kawurua deinawi netarai wei na nanai, na kutu wewu netarai weru ne tafuaifo.<verse eid="GEN 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Na katai nani kontaio Deborai, wiwingno dewawu Yakupi inangno Ribkai na ketuifo mireha. Ampefe esarai na ai fiabai rowei arowawahifo na bendari Beteli do wanang sai. Nanai wedaya inontarai esahu ai fiabai nani we, “Ai rayai.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Na kutu Yakupi da weru Padan-Arami to Beteli fo aha mani, Allai deinawi netarai wei aha tuti mioangni. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Allai medu wei deyo, “Na rahida bonini tofongna mani, wiro wonomu fino Yakupi ahang kaha, mae wonomu fino Israeli, wonomu finana.” Ampefe Allai dohong wonong fino Israeli.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Nun. 32:28</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Ainanaya Allai medu wei aha deyo, “Yau mani Allai Mano Iwemambiriu Sewa di Yau. Bawing separai bitoya, tuti na mene ririanei ambori we kaiwasa bitoya, tuti na nemu ririanei ambori ewemananu ki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Nun. 17:4-8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Tuti nu nini mani kawurua Yohongni we Abrahami tuti Isaki, ambori Yohongni we wau tuti we nemu ririanei.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Mayeai Allai da weru Yakupi na kataio Medu wei naifoi.<verse eid="GEN 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Ainanaya Yakupi biaungno tugu bei na katai nani, amani kamiei tugu dine, sari angguri tuti maning saituni sau kamieifoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-19">Nun. 28:18-19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakupi dohong kataio Allai medu wei nai nani wonong fino Beteli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Benyamini saubaunung, inang Raheli mireha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Mayeai Yakupi tuti ne inontaraifosa era weru Beteli. Era wa kefang we Efrata mani, Raheli amaina pirahai we minohi, wape sobu dadira paria na minohituti arikangfoi fo. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Na kutu niruainso pirahai paria nanai, bidanfoi medu wei deyo, “Mutai fanai tawang wau, weo nemu arikang mang dine aha.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Wape Raheli rerai we mirehafo mani, dohong ne kaisungfoi wonong fino Ben-Oni, wape Yakupi dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino Benyamini.<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Ampefe Raheli mirehafo, esarai na rang deraung to Efrata kataio fui nina esahui we Betlehemi. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakupi biaungno tugu bei na Raheli ne fafo foi, tuti tugu nani doari na wanaifa.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Mayeaia mani Israeli da nariai aha, da wa biaung ne yawa tendafoi na Migdal-Ederi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Migdal-Ederi mani, menara we inontarai eteitawang wedua ene fiahung fosa.</char></note> do wanang sai foi. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22a" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22a" />Na kutu Israeli niayai na katai nani fo, Rubeni dena ria tamangno Israeli ne wiwingno Bilhai, Raheli ne womingfoi, ampefe fio niari nanai Israeli taraoaifa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:4">Nun. 49:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:22a" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakupi ne arikang fosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22b" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22b" />Yakupi ne arikang mang fosa mani ewesuraya mandu. <verse eid="GEN 35:22b" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Leai ne kaisung wonang, amani Rubeni, Yakupi ne kaisung reantenang dine, mayea mani Simeoni, Lewi, Yehudai, Isakari tuti Sebuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Raheli ne kaisung mandu, amani Yusupi tuti Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Tuti Bilhai, Raheli ne woming wiwingfoi ne kaisung mandu, amani Dani tuti Naftali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Tuti Silpai, Leai ne woming wiwingfoi ne kaisung mandu, amani Gati tuti Asyeri. Ampefe Yakupi ne kaisung etaubau enumi na Padan-Arami sainana.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Ainanaya Yakupi da wa sobu tamangno Isaki na Mamre kefang we Kiryat-Arbai ahui kontai we Hebroni, katai Abrahami tuti Isaki unayai nai we inontarai aisei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:18">Nun. 13:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isaki weinongkutung paria, ne fuina piaring piara (180) mani mireha, <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />ampefe Isaki ne arikangfo suru, Esauwi tuti Yakupi usarai ria ne wereng fosa.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Esauwi ne ririafoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Fi aiririai kariri Esauwi mano esahui we Edomi foi mani sonina. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esauwi kia wiwing Kanani mantoru we bineng, amani Adai, Eloni inontarai Heti foi ne kamitung dine, tuti Oholibamai, Anai ne kamitungfoi, Sibeoni inontarai Hewi foi tufuwing dine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:34">Nun. 26:34</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />Tuti Basmati, Ismaeli ne kamitungfoi, imani Nebayoti rorowing dine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:9">Nun. 28:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Adai dawingno Elipasi we Esauwi, tuti Basmati dawingno Rehueli, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />mae Oholibamai dawingno Yeushi, Yaelami tuti Korahi. Esauwi ne arikang sainana, etaubau enumi na kahofa Kanani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Mayeai Esauwi kia ne wiwing fosa, ne kaisung tuti kamitung fosa, tuti ne inontarai mano enayai ruhia fosa kiai. Kia ne fiahungfosa tuti ne ra fubao sobuai kawurua na kahofa Kanani fo. Ainanaya da weru ne tahatui Yakupi to nu siai beia. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Weo une rafoi bitoya kareraifa, donio wiro unayai ruhia kaha, tuti nu unayai nai nani wiro katai kehabi weninoi bei demoyarai we une fiahung fosa etang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Ampefe Esauwi mano ahui we Edomi foi, da wa niayai na katai weuaifo na Seiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Fi aiririai kariri inontarai Edomi na katai weuai Seiri na ene werengno Esauwi mani sonina.<verse eid="GEN 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Esauwi ne wiwingno Adai dawingno kaisung manei wonong fino Elipasi tuti Esauwi ne wiwingno Basmati dawingno Rehueli. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Elipasi ne arikang saino, Temani, Omari, Sefoi, Gaetami tuti Kenasi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elipasi ne wiwing siai manei wonong fino Timnai. Timnai dawingno Amaleki we Elipasi. Esauwi tuti Adai une tafui sainana. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Rehueli ne arikang saino, Nahati, Serahi, Syamai tuti Misai. Esauwi tuti Basmati une tafui sainana. <verse eid="GEN 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Esauwi ne wiwingno Oholibamai ne kaisung saino, Yeushi, Yaelami tuti Korahi. Oholibamai nini mani Anai ne kamitung dine, i mani Sibeoni tufuwing dine.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Riria Esauwi mano ewemambaiseng sainina. Riria Elipasi, Esauwi ne kaisung fubafoi, andino we wereng we inontarai Temani fosa, inontarai Omari fosa, inontarai Sefoi fosa, inontarai Kenasi fosa, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />inontarai Korahi fosa, inontarai Gaetami fosa tuti Amaleki fosa. Eaino ewemambaiseng na kahofa Edomi ne. Ea kiai eweriria na Esauwi tuti Adai une kaisung Elipasi. <verse eid="GEN 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Esauwi tuti Basmati une kaisungno Rehueli andino we wereng we inontarai Nahati fosa, Serahi fosa, Syamai fosa tuti Misai fosa. Riria ninisa kontai enayai na kahofa Edomi. <verse eid="GEN 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Anai ne kamitungno Oholibamai, Esauwi ne wiwingnei, une kaisung nesaino ewe wereng we inontarai Yeushi fosa, inontarai Yaelami fosa tuti inontarai Korahi fosa. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Mano ewemambaiseng na Esauwi mano ahui kontai we Edomi foi sainana.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seiri ne ririafoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Seiri inontarai Hori foi ne arikang saino, Lotani, Syobali, Sibeoni, Anai, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Disyoni, Eseri tuti Disyani. Inontarai Hori ewenunggamiei na Seiri ne ririafoi, ninsaino reantenang pari enayai na kahofa Edomi ne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edomi tuti Seiri mani wonong we katai weuai Seiri sentenang. Ampefe Edomi tuti Seiri mani wonong we katai boyari. Seiri mani katai nanai wonong fafong fine.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Lotani ne kaisung mandu amani, Hori tuti Hemani. Lotani rorowing dino Timnai. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Syobali ne kaisung ewering amani, Alwani, Manahati, Ebali, Syefoi tuti Onami. <verse eid="GEN 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Sibeoni ne kaisung mandu amani, Anai tuti Ayai. Anai nini dino sobu mereha ureng meninggapoi fo na katai wiarora wekamamiei foi, na kutu deitawang wedua tamang Sibeoni ne keledai fosa. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Anai ne arikang mandu amani, Disyoni tuti rorowingno Oholibamai. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Disyoni ne arikang ewe mana amani, Hemdani, Esybani, Yitrani tuti Kerani. <verse eid="GEN 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Eseri ne arikang itowemantoru amani, Bilhani, Saawani tuti Akani. <verse eid="GEN 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Disyani ne arikang mandu amani, Usi tuti Arani. <verse eid="GEN 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Ampefe riria na Seiri inontarai Hori nini dino we wereng we inontarai Lotani fosa, Syobali fosa, Sibeoni fosa, Anai fosa, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Disyoni fosa, Eseri fosa tuti Disyani fosa. Inontarai Hori ewenungkamiei sainana. Ansaino enayai na kahofa Seiri ne.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mananu eru na Edomi fosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Na rabuang bo inontarai Israeli fosa ene mananu kaharai, mananu mano eru parenta na nu Edomi foi sainina. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Na Edomi mano yu parenta mani Beori antungno Belai na bendari Dinhabai. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Belai mireha mani, Serahi antungno Yobapi yiwangni wemananu aha. I mani na bendari Bosrai. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobapi mireha mani, Husyami na nu Temani foi yiwangni wemananu aha. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Husyami mirehara mani, Bedadi antungno Hadadi yiwangni wemananu aha. I mani na bendari Awiti. Hadadi nini dino memunara sahatawang inontarai Midiani fosa na Moapi ne. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi mireha mani, Samlai na bendari Masrekai foi yiwangni wemananu aha. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samlai mireha mani, Sauli na bendari Rehoboti, na waya deraungfo, yiwangni wemananu aha. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Sauli mirehara mani, Akhbori antungno Baal-Hanani, yiwangni wemananu aha. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Baal-Hanani mireha mani, Hadari na bendari Pahui yiwangni wemananu aha, tuti ne wiwingfoi wonong fino Mehetabeeli. Mehetabeeli nini tamang dino Matreti tuti tufung dino Mesahapi.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Mambaiseng mano eweriria na Esauwi, ewonomifo tuti ene kahofafo ansainina. Timnai, Alwai, Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibamai, Elai, Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenasi, Temani, Mibsari, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magdieli tuti Irami. Riria ninisa ene katai taterai, tuti kataifo wonongfo mani kariri ewonomifo. Inontarai Edomi ene wereng dino Esauwi.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Yusupi ne amieifoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Na rabuang bonani Yakupi niayai na nu Kanani, kataio tamang niayai weinontarai aisei foi. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Kaiwo kariri Yakupi tuti ne ririafoi mani sonina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Na kutu Yusupi ne fuina suraya itu (17) fo mani webariboaia, deitawang wedua kambing tuti domba ria ne tafuaisa, na tamang ne wiwingno Bilhai tuti Silpai une arikangfosa. Tuti Yusupi deisaha fi karira ne tafuai enari fo we tamangno Yakupi.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Israeli enewawu Yusupi sewa weru ne arikang mano wei fosa, weo Yusupi nini saubaunung na kutu Yakupi weinongkutungfo. Na rahida bei Yakupi demi inontarai manei niari ansung dewaroi mehikai paria bei we Yusupi. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Na kutu ne tafuai ewatioai we ene dai enewawu Yusupi sewa ea nanai, ampefe enemirireuwi tuti wiro emadu nari wei kaha.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Na diru bei mani Yusupi demiei. Na kutu deiriri ne amieifoi we ne tafuaisa nanai, ne tafuai enemirireuwi paria aha. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Weo medu wesa deyo, “Metaramio nehu amiei nei, <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />yemiei yetio tanayai na romi tuti tawora potangno takutuia. Na tantuma nehu potangfoi doatiraia mimoya, tuti mene potangfo era ma etoawari nehufoi tuti esomi aweu ene raindengfo sobu kahofa wau we nehufoi.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Ainanaya ne tafuaisa emadu wei eteyo, “Boitarahio wemananu tuti weparenta amea re?” Ampefe enemirireuwi mambiriu aha, weo ne amieifoi, tuti ne kaiwo medurai kariri ne amieifoi disang enemirorongfoi.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Ainanaya demiei amiei siai bei aha, tuti deiriri we ne doroifosa. Medu deyo, “Yemiei aha mani, yeti wo faisi, embai faisi tuti awaha suraya boyari esomi we yau.” <verse eid="GEN 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Na kutu deiriri amieifoi we tamanai tuti ne tafuaisa nanai, tamang suari deyo, “Amiei fiani dino boiriri aha ninai? Boitarahio yau, inamuai tuti ne tafuaisa kiai ametisangkapa ameawemibuka amesomi aweu ameuremine disangso kahofa we wau e?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Ampefe ne tafuaisa enemirorong pirahai wei paria, wape tamangno Yakupi enetituai amieifo na enerorongfoi pampang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kis. 7:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etawayang Yusupi tuti mano eworirifoi ehari to Mesiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Na rahida bei mani, Yusupi ne tafuaisa erawa ewaitawang wedua etamamifoi ne kambing tuti domba na Sikemi. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Mayeai Israeli demi Yusupi deyo, “Ro to Sikemi, we nemu tafuaisa, weo enayai ewaitawang wedua tane kambing tuti domba fosa fo.” Yusupi yoa deyo, “Yo, daie ira.” <verse eid="GEN 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Israeli medu deyo, “Roa boti nemu tafuaisa tuti tane kambing tuti domba fosa enayai na mai e, mayeai barabera wau ma boisaharai we yau.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Ampefe Yakupi demi da weru enang Hebroni. Tuti Yusupi da paria sobu Sikemi. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Na kutu Yusupi da sera we ne tafuaisa na katai wiarora weninoi foi nanai, sobu inontarai mang manei na nanai. Inontarai foi dutangni deyo, “Wera we fiani e?” <verse eid="GEN 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yusupi yoa wei deyo, “Isera we nehu tafuaisa. Botisa mani boisaharai we yau, na doni ewaitawang wedua kambing tuti domba fosa?” <verse eid="GEN 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Ainanaya inontaraifoi medu wei deyo, “Era weru katai nini ampa. Itarahuo emadu weo era to Dotani.” Ampefe Yusupi da ria ne tafuaisa paria to Dotani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Na wairoi ne tafuai ewatioi. Wape wiro da wa kefang ea kaharai mae, emadu ruhi kaiwo kawurua we emungni. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Emadu wawerasa eteyo, “Mewatia, tane mano demiei biriufi da ma wanaifa! <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Merama tamungni tuti tasoari to kamirei mereha sirahia ne bei. Tuti ambori tamadu tateyo, andowa memuna manei miungni ampa. Tuti ambori tawati kariri ne amiei deyoi foi antu ete bereri e!”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Wape na kutu Rubeni tarao kaiwo etamafo nanai, yurai we sawing Yusupi werusa, tuti medu wesa deyo, “Wiro tamungni fanai.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Mayeai Rubeni medu wesa aha deyo, “Wiro tawarami rika soi fanai tuti wiro taboia wekahai fanai, mae tasoari rarang kamirei mereha sirahiao wiatai na katai wiarora wekamamiei nini.” Rubeni medu tonanai, weo yurai we sawing Yusupi tuti kiari we etamami Yakupi aha.<verse eid="GEN 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Arahio Yusupi da wa sobu ne tafuaisa nanai, na tantuma etisu Yusupi ne ansung mehikaio satari foi. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Tuti eharia esoari to kamirei mereha sirahiafoi. <verse eid="GEN 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Mayeai eminohi etampi. Na tantuma, ewatia mani, ewati inontarai Ismaeli mano etawayang fi, era na Gileati to Mesiri. Etaunaungso ene untafo na kesi tuti maning nungsai mamporifo. <figure style="fig" file="HK00037C.TIF" size="span" ref="37:25">Etaunaungso untafo</figure><verse eid="GEN 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Ainanaya Yehudai medu we ne doroifosa deyo, “Tamung tane tahatuinei tuti tatadiwari mani, wiro tasobu fiea kaha. <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Todoni mani, mera ma tatawayangni we inontarai Ismaeli nesa. Wiro tatohong farioi fanai, weo i mani tane tahatui dine tuti tane rika boyari.” Tuti Yehudai ne doroifosa eroa we kaiwo medurafo.<verse eid="GEN 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Donio na kutu inontarai Midiani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inontarai Midiani tuti inontarai Ismaeli mani inontarai mano etawayang fi saine. Inontarai ninisa mani emasi. </char></note> mano etawayang fi fosa era ma nanai, Yusupi ne tafuai eruaisi weru kamirei merehafoi ayai tuti etawayangni wesa, na doi peraki piarei (20). Ainanaya eha Yusupi to Mesiria.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kis. 7:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Na kutu Rubeni da to kamirei mereha foia mani deti Yusupi ahang kahai nanai, fiosiabu ne ansungfo, weo enerorongfoi fituayai paria. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Mayeai daraberahi we ne tahatui fosa deyo, “Arikangfoi wiro niayai na kamirei merehafoi ahang kahaia, fianai aino ambori inari ne?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ainanaya eha Yusupi ne ansungfoi tuti emungno kambing manei, mayeai erorang ansungfoi na rikafoi. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Ansung mehikai pari nani, etemi manei na ea kia ansungfoi we etamamifoia we detioi, na medu deyo, “Ansung nini amesobui, ampefe dai boroangwei, nemu kaisungnei ne ansung fi dine ne?” <verse eid="GEN 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Na kutu Yakupi deroang ansungfoi nanai medu deyo, “Antu, nehu kaisungno Yusupi ne ansungfi dinini. Tarai andowa memuna miungni ampa. Oh, nehu kaisungno Yusupi mireha ampa! Andowa memuna fiosiabu netaraifoi.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Tuti Yakupi fiosiabu ne ansungfo, mayeai wiorakota enerabuang na ireu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ireu nyumetang kerirafoi enariri na kambing ete unta nuawuru. Ireu nini deinawi kariri mindafo. Na ene koangfoi mani wairoi rahida tarihio piareia sura (30).</char></note> nyumetang kerirafoi wairoi paria, weo minda we ne kaisungfoi fefe. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Ne arikang fosa kiai, mang tuti wiwing fosa erurai we ewaworiri. Manamo deiayasa deyo, “Bereri! Isai we nehu kaisungfoi paria ira riati isobui na raimeri!” Ampefe tonanaifa Yakupi minda pampang we ne kaisungno Yusupi.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Na kutu siari nanai kontaio, na Mesiri, inontarai Midiani fosa etawayang Yusupi we Potifari, inontarai mano wenunggamiei we mano ewaitawang wedua mananufoi.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yehudai tuti Tamari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Na rabuang bo nani Yehudai da weru ne doroifosa to bendari Adulami tuti minohi ria inontarai manei wonong fino Hirai. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Na nanai Yehudai deti wiwing Kanani manei, Syuai ne kamitung dine. Ainanaya Yehudai kiari we ne wiwing tuti dena riati. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Wiwingfoi doama tuti minohituti kaisung manei, Yehudai dohongni wonong fino Eri. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Mayeai wiwingfoi doama tuti minohituti kaisung manei aha, wiwingfoi dohongni wonong fino Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Mayeai aha mani wiwingfoi minohituti kaisung manei aha, tuti dohongni wonong fino Syelai. Na kutu Syelai saubaunungfo mani Yehudai niayai na Kesipi.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Mayeaia mani Yehudai kia wiwing manei we ne kaisung fubao Eri, wiwingfoi wonong fino Tamari. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Wape Eri, Yehudai ne kaisung fubafoi ne koang kerira paria na Yahwei urengfo, ampefe Yahwei dohong aiboi wei awao mireha.<verse eid="GEN 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Ainanaya Yehudai medu we Eri ne tahatui Onani deyo, “Ka nemu tafuai ne wiwingfoi tuti rauti weriwang nemu tafuai, kariri tane koangnei, ambori bohong riria we nemu tafuai aha.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Wape Onani deitawanai weo arikang fosa mani wiro nesa kaha. Ampefe dena ria Tamari mani, sua ne ka fo tabata to boriei, ambori na tonanafo wiro dohong riria we ne tafuai kaha. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Wape fianai aino niari fo mani, karira na Yahwei urengreafo, ampefe Yahwei dohong aiboi weia mereha kontai.<verse eid="GEN 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Donio Yehudai enetituatai we dohongnao ne kaisungno Syelai mireha toyari ne tafuai suru fe. Ampefe Yehudai medu we urawingno Tamari deyo, “Roa nayai na tamamu ne munufoi we wiwingna paria Syelai fiabai akawuru wori rauti ki.” Ampefe Tamari da wa niayai na tamang ne munufoia.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Wefuina beiru teai aha mani, Syuai ne kamitungfoi, mano Yehudai ne wiwingnei mirehara. Yehudai minohi koya weia kai nanai, kia ne maniwowirio Hirai inontarai Adulami foi ura to Timnai, kataio inontarai ehutu ene domba ene nuawurufo nayai.<verse eid="GEN 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Na kutu Tamari sobu kaiwo we nyongno Yehudai da to Timnai we kiutu ne domba fosa ene nuawurufo nanai, <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />ampefe disu ne ansung wiwingna fo, sata ansung siai tuti tebung wedua urengfo. Mayeai da wa minohi na bendari Enaimi ne rahutu borongno ra to Timnaifo. Tamari deitawanai weo Yehudai antungno Syelai fiabai ampa, wape Yehudai wiro dohongni we ne mang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Na kutu Yehudai detioi nanai, deitarahio wiwing diru dine, weo tebung wedua urengfo fefe. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Ainanaya Yehudai da wa dutangni deyo, “Ro ma yena ria wau.” Medu tonanai weo deitawana kaha, weo wiwingnei mani urawingfoi dine. Tamari medu wei deyo, “Bena ria yau mani bai beiru?” <verse eid="GEN 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yehudai medu wei deyo, “Yohongno kambing antung manei we wau ki.” Tamari yoa wei deyo, “Yo, wape bohong fiani we fiainawiai ma irutawangnai, paria bonatu kambingfoi we yau ma?” <verse eid="GEN 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yehudai dutangni aha deyo, “Fiainawiai fianai aino yohongna ne?” Tamari yoa wei deyo, “Bohongno nemu cincino wonomu nayai naio weraori sawai na ramukanangwai tuti nemu aitatohio wonomu nayai nai wai.” Ainanaya Yehudai dohongno finanai we Tamaria, mayeai dena riatia, donio wiwingfoi doama. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Tamari daraberahi to tamang ne munufoi aha tuti sata ne ansung wiwingna fo aha.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Mayeaia mani, Yehudai demi ne maniwowirio Hirai inontarai Adulami foi, kia kambingfoi da wa we biai wiwingfoi, ambori kia fio dohongnai watai we fiainawiafo. Wape Hirai da ma mani wiro sobu wiwing diru foi kaha. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Hirai dutang inontarai na nanafosa deyo, “Wiwing diruo minohi na rang deraung Enaimi fi andi donie?” Eroa wei eteyo, “Wiro wiwing diru manei na nina kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Ainanaya Hirai daraberahi we Yehudai aha tuti medu wei deyo, “Wiro isobu wiwingfoi kaha, tuti inontarai fosa na katai nani eteyo, wiro wiwing diru manei na wana kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Ampefe Yehudai medu deyo, “Bento fianggengfo kia weia, ambori wiro tasobu mamaya fanai. Irurai we ibaiti na kambingnei, wape wiro wobu wiwingfoi kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Tarahio we embai botoru teai aha mani, Yehudai taraoai we urawingno Tamari doama, weo niariri we wiwing diru fefe. Ainanaya Yehudai medu deyo, “Meha wiwingwai ma ambori ohongni adia kasoia mireha.” <verse eid="GEN 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Na kutu eha Tamari to boriei we emungnifo mani, dohong kaiwo anatu we nyongno Yehudai deyo, “Mang mano ne fianggeng ninai andino dena ria yau mani donio iwearikang ninaifa. Ampefe mewati kariri mandoni dino neo cincino wonong nayai naio weraori na rahanangfo tuti aitatohi wonong nayai nai nei.” <verse eid="GEN 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yehudai deroang ne fianggengfo tuti deyo, “Wiwingfoi wiro dohong sarawa kaha. Wape yauno wiro yohong Syelai we ne mang kariri tane koangnei kaha.” Ampefe Yehudai wiro dena ria Tamari ahang kaha.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Na kutu wiwingfoi niruainso amaina pirahai nanai, arahio eteitawangnai weo arikang tantamurui mandu na enemanabufoi. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Tuti na kutu de minohituti arikangfo suru mani, arikangfo manei dohong warang bei dariai ariei. Ampefe bidanfoi tebuhiri na banang kirmisi barika feai na warangfo, tuti medu deyo, “Arikangno saubaunung fafong dinini.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Wape arikangfoi fiorung warangfoi to rorong nariai aha, tuti arikang mano weifoi dino saubaunung fafong ne. Bidanfoi medu we arikangfoi deyo, “Wemambiriu paria, donio kowariai fafong nina.” Ampefe Yehudai dohong kaisungfoi wonong fino Peresi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peresi na kaiwo Iberani mani, Yurai we soboriei.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Mayeaia mani arahio kaisung mano warangfo tabuhirai na banang kirmisi barikafo dariai ki, tuti kaisung nani wonong fino Serahi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Serahi na kaiwo Iberani mani berika tuti siwewarai ete wo dautai.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Yusupi na Potifari ne Munufoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Na rabuang bo nani, inontarai Ismaeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inontarai Ismaeli tuti inontarai Midiani mani inontarai mano etawayang fi saine. Inontarai ninisa mani emasi.</char></note> fosa eha Yusupi to Mesiri kawurua nanai. Tuti etawayangni we Potifari, inontarai mano wenunggamiei we mano ewaitawang wedua mananu ne munufoi.<verse eid="GEN 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Wape Yahwei weriria Yusupi pampang, donio fianai aino niari fo mani beng paria. Ampefe niayai na Potifari inontarai Mesiri foi ne munufoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kis. 7:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Potifari detioai weo Yahwei weriria Yusupi tuti Mioangni na fio yu fo, <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />ampefe Potifari firaise we Yusupi. Donio yuasi we ne mangfata we mantauni tuti we deitawang wedua ne fianggeng munurorongfoi kiai. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Na siario yuai Yusupi we deitawang ne munurorongfo tuti ne fianggengfo kiai nanai, Yahwei mioang inontarai Mesiri foi ne munurorongfo, weo Yusupi fefe. Tuti Yahwei mioang ne fianggengfoi kiai, na munufoi ete na romifo. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Potifari ne fianggengfoi kiai dohongni we Yusupi we deitawani, tuti na ne tonanane Potifari wiro urewa we ne fianggengfoi ahang kaha, mae manta ne fio dang fo aino bereri ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusupi mani netaraifoi denteng tuti ureng bohi paria. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Mayeaia mani Potifari ne wiwingfoi enerorong sau we Yusupi paria, ampefe medu wei deyo, “Ro ma bena ria yau.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Wape Yusupi deiayari tuti medu wei deyo, “Dai Potifari yoaso yau we yeitawang ne fianggengnei kiai na ne mununei. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Na mununei nehu mambiriu fuba kariri i we yeitawang wedua ne fianggengnei kiai, manta ai wauno bereri ne. Todoni fino inari fio kerira nini tuti inari sasari we Allai?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Rahida neungne wiwingfoi wewori Yusupi pampang, wape Yusupi wiro miaya we dena riati kaha.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Na rahida beia mani, Yusupi da to munufoi afui we yufi nayai, tuti wiro inontarai manei na munufoi kaha. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Ainanaya wiwingfoi yu na Yusupi ne ansungfo tuti yabiti na mamboni, mae medu wei deyo, “Ro ma bena ria yau.” Wape Yusupi merira, ampefe mito arora to boriei weru wiwingfoi, mae ne ansungfo wiwingfoi yutawanai.<verse eid="GEN 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Na kutu Potifari ne wiwingfoi detioai we Yusupi mito to boriei weru ne ansungfo tuti ansungfo yutawanai na warangfo nanai, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />sahu mangfata fosa ma, medu wesa deyo, “Mewati, inontarai Iberanio nehu mangnei kiari ma nini, meikanggani tata. Inontarai nini suayai afui de dena ria yau, manamo ibibe isahu tutiri. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Tuti na kutu taraoai we ibibe isahu tutiri tonana fo, mitai mito to boriei weru ne ansungne.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Potifari ne wiwingfoi yutawang ansungfo paria ne mangfoi daraberahi to munufoi ma. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Na kutu Potifari daraberahi ma nanafo, ne wiwingfoi deiriri finanai wei, deyo, “Woming inontarai Iberanio kari ma nini, antanafa da ma we niari kanggani yau. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Wape na kutu ibibe isahu tutiri nanai, mitai mito to boriei, ampefe ne ansungne watai ria yau.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Potifari tarao kaiwo ne wiwingfoi medurai kariri fio Yusupi niari weifo nanai, Potifari kesou paria. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Ainanaya Potifari demi ne inontarai fosa etafu Yusupi tuti ehari to munu aitamu rorongfo, kataio mananufoi yu aitamu inontarai etohong sarawai. Ampefe Yusupi eru aitamuoi na nana.<verse eid="GEN 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Wape Yahwei weriria Yusupi tuti Deinawi ne enewawufo pampang, ampefe mano wenunggamiei we munu aitamufoi eneo Yusupi paria.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kis. 7:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Nanai wedaya mani, mano wenunggamiei we munu aitamufoi yuai Yusupi wenunggamiei we mano ewatai na aitamu rorongfosa, tuti fio eru na munu aitamufoi. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Tuti mano wenunggamiei we munu aitamufoi wiro niari fieai ahang kaha, yoaso Yusupi paria. Weo Yahwei weriria Yusupi donio fianai aino niari fo mani na mai paria.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yusupi deisaha inontarai mandu une amiei ne werorongfo na aitamufoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Na rahida beia mani, mananu Mesiri foi ne mangfata urufi wei foi, amani mano wenunggamiei we deitawang ne fio dunungfo tuti mano wenunggamiei we deitawang ne roti dangfo unari sarawai we mananufoi. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Ampefe mananu Firauni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Firauni mani wang we mananu Mesiri. Wiro wonong tera fine kaha. </char></note> kesou suru paria. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Donio demi ne inontarai fosa eha suru to aitamufoi. Aitamufoi wiatai na mano wenunggamiei we deitawang mananufoi ne munufoi. Na katai nani eru aitamuo Yusupi kontai. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Inontarai mano wenunggamiei we mano ewaitawang wedua mananufoi, dohong suru afui tuti demi Yusupi we fiata suru. Ampefe eru aitamuo uru wairoi kuteaifa.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Na diru beia mani, inontarai mano eru aitamuo surufo, amani mano wenunggamiei we deitawang mananu Mesiri foi ne fio dunungfo, tuti mano wenunggamiei mano enari ne rotifo, uramiei ruhiaifa na diru nani. Wape une amieifo suru ne werorongfo wiro masi kaha.<verse eid="GEN 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Kameaia mani, Yusupi da we surua, deti we suru mani wiro uremi mararising kaha. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Ainanaya Yusupi dutang bera suru mano itonayai ruhiai na aitamufoi, deyo, “We fianie rahida bo nini wiro muremine mararising kahai nina?” <verse eid="GEN 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Uroa wei ureyo, “Diruafa auramiei, wape wiro manei ne awai feai we deisaha kariri aune amiei ne suru une werorongfo kaha.” Mayeai Yusupi deyo, “Manta Allai mesiri andino dohong awai we inontarai, ambori deisaha kariri amieine. Ampefe mureiriri kariri mune aimiei ne suru we yau.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Mayeai mano wenunggamiei we deitawang mananufoi ne fio dunungfo, deiriri kariri ne amieifoi we Yusupi deyo, “Na nehu amieinei iwati ai angguri rowei doari na arohune. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Na tantuma, ai angguri nani sobaurai webotoru, arahio arirawangfo deo wereraung mani, nebufoi dariai kawurua tuti bongfoi miraia. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Tuti na warahune iru Firauni ne nofi dunung nai foi. Angguri bongfoi ikaria tuti ikuari to Firauni ne nofi foi, mayeai yohongni we Firaunia.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yusupi medu wei deyo, “Nemu amieinei werorong tonina, angguri arawang botoru fo mani, deinawi rahida botoru. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />We rahida botoru aha mani, Firauni ambori sawing wau tuti dohong wau rufi kariri fafong nanai aha. Tuti wau ambori bohong Firauni dunung na nofi foi aha, toyari na kutu wenunggamiei we boitawang mananunei ne mereha dunungfo. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Wape aromuo yau, masino wobu maifo. Boinawi nemu enemuwawu yau ne, na boiriri kaririai we Firauni toyari fianai aino isodairai nina, tuti fata yau ambori ira to boriei weru munu aitamu nini. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Weo ehamanana yau weru nu inontarai Iberani foi, tuti na ninaifa wiro inari sara fiea kaha, neo wedaya yau mani isuayai to aitamu rorong nini”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Na kutu mano wenunggamiei we deitawang wedua mananufoi ne roti dangfo, taraoai we ne maniwowirifoi ne amieifoi ne werorongfo denteng paria, ampefe medu we Yusupi deyo, “Yau kontai yemiei, amani iwatio ika roti sosiru botoru, watai sau nuhukamieinei. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Na sosiru boyai pari foi mani, roti tatowa bitoya we fiang we mananu Firauni. Wape romufosa esifo ma etang roti na sosiru bo yaifoi, na nuhu kamieinei.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yusupi yoa wei deyo, “Nemu amieinei ne werorongfo mani tonina, sosiru botoru fo mani, deinawi rahida botoru. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Na rahida botoru ninai, Firauni ambori demi ne inontarai fosa ferangkutu numukamieiwai, tuti eruai nemu taraiwai ayai sawai, tuti romufosa esifo ma etang nemu taraiwai.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Tuti rahida botorua mani, tete rahida Firauni saubaunungnai foi, ampefe Firauni dohongsua ne rahida saubaunung nai foi, ria ne inontarai mano erufi wei fosa. Mayeai demi ne inontarai erufi wei fosa etawing inontarai mano wenunggamiei we deitawang ne fio dunungfo, tuti mano wenunggamiei we deitawang ne roti dangfo weru aitamu rorongfo. Tuti eha surua uminohi rahang ne inontarai mano erufi wei fosa. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Inontarai mano wenunggamiei we deitawang wedua ne fio dunungfo, mananufoi dohongni we yu ne fio yu fafongfo aha. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Mae mano wenunggamiei we deitawang wedua mananufoi ne roti dangfo emungni, kariri kaiwo Yusupi medurai wei kariri amieifoi.<verse eid="GEN 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Wape mano wenunggamiei we deitawang wedua mananufoi ne fio dunungfo, firandengno Yusupia, tuti wiro arooi ahang kahaifa.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Yusupi deisaha kariri Firauni ne amieifoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Defuina boru kawurua mani Firauni demiei, i doari na waya Nili deraungfo. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Na tantuma detio sapi ituo ebeng tuti enetarai biriayai etariai na waya Nili rorongfoi, tuti etang ninoi na waya deraungfo. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Mayeaia mani deti sapi itu aha etariai na waya Nili rorongfoi. Sapi itufo eharira tuti ehawariroi, etoari rurang sapi ebiriaya fosa na waya Nili deraungfo. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ainanaya sapi itu mano eharira tuti ehawariroi fosa etangno sapi itu mano ebeng tuti enetarai biriayai fo. Mayeaia Firauni doari weru denafo.<verse eid="GEN 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Ainanaya Firauni dena aha tuti demiei we berufo mani. Na tantuma detio potang nenggaing bei ne bong itu mamasa tuti netaraifo beng paria.<figure style="fig" file="HK00099C.TIF" size="span" ref="41:5">Potang</figure> <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Wape mayeaia mani, na tantuma detio potang bong itu biriaya kaha tuti samamorang, weo wanang murangno menggaponi sioaifa. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Mayeaia mani potang bong ebiriaya kahafo etong potang bong ituo ebeng tuti ebiriayafo. Ainanaya Firauni kipatetafi weru denafo tuti deitawanai weo manta demiei teraifa.<verse eid="GEN 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Na kutu kamiaifo mananufoi enerorong weansarai paria. Ampefe demi esahu inontarai mano eteitawang amiei ne werorongfo tuti inontarai mano esawai fosa kiai na Mesiri ma. Firauni deisaha ne amieifoi wesa, wape wiro manei medu bau amieifoi ne werorongfo wei kaha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan. 2:2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Ainanaya mano wenunggamiei we deitawang mananufoi ne fio dunungfo medu we Firauni deyo, “Rahida bonini yeisaha nehu sarawaio fafongpa inari ne. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Raminde nanai nehu mananune wau kosou paria we mano erufi we wau fosa. Donio ru aitamuo yau tuti mano wenunggamiei we deitawang wedua roti bangfo. Tuti woa auru to aitamu rorongfo, na mano wenunggamiei we inontarai mano ewaitawang wedua munu mananufoi, ne munufoi afui. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Na diru bei mani, yau tuti mano wenunggamiei we deitawang wedua roti bangne auramiei, tuti amieine suru une werorongfo mai kaha.<verse eid="GEN 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Na aitamu rorongfo mani, bariboai manei inontarai Iberani dine, mano wenunggamiei we deitawang munu mananufoi ne mangfata dine. Aureisaha aune amieifo suru wei, tuti deisaha bau amiei borufo ne werorong masi kahafo. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Tuti fi kiaio deisaharafo we tarai kaririai, yau bohong yau to nehu fi iru fafongfo aha, wape mano wenungkamiei we deitawang roti bangfo sobu aiboi mararehafo.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Ainanaya Firauni demi ne inontarai fosa esahu Yusupi, ampefe na ahera ehari to boriei weru aitamu rorongfo. Yusupi dei derewawurufo tuti yiwang ne ansungfo, mayeai da wa doari na Firauni arongfo. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Firauni medu we Yusupi deyo, “Yemiei tuti wiro manei deisaha bau amieinei ne werorongfo kaha. Wape itarahuoai we wau mani taramuo amieifoi terai, tuti boisaha bau amieifoi ne werorongfo.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yusupi yoa we Firauni deyo, “Wiro yau kaha, mae Allai dino ambori deisaharai na mai we nehu mananune wau.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Ainanaya Firauni medu we Yusupi deyo, “Na nehu amieinei mani, yoari na waya Nili deraungfo. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Mayeai na tantuma yeti na waya rorongno Nili sapi itu ene tarai biriayai tuti ebeng etariai, tuti etang ninoi na waya deraungfo. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Wape mayeai aha mani, na tantuma yeti sapi siai itu etariai aha, ehawariroi tuti eharira paria, wiro yeti sapi eharira tonina nesa na Mesiri tantenang kaha. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Sapi ituo ehawariroi fosa etangno sapi ituo ebiriayai yetisa reantenangfo. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Wape masino etang sapi ituo enetarai biriaya fosa to nanai ki, wiro enetarai biriaya kaha, mae enetarai karira toyari fafongne. Ainanaya yoari weru yenafoa. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Mayeai yena nariai aha tuti yemiei. Na tantuma yetio potang nenggaing bei ne bong itu mamasa tuti netaraifo beng paria. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Wape mayeaia mani, na tantuma yetio potang bong itu biriaya kaha, sarahiai tuti samamorang weo wanang murang sioaifa. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Potang bongno ehawariroifo etangno potang bong ituo emahikaifo. Yeisaha amiei ne suru kawurua we mano esawai nesa ehai. Wape wiro manei deisaha bau amiei ne werorongfo we yau kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Mayeai Yusupi medu we Firauni deyo, “Nehu mananu ne wau, nemu amiei boru ne mani umasi. Allai kawurua deisaharai we nehu mananune wau weo fianai aino ambori Niari ne. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Sapi ituo enetarai biriayai fo mani fuina itu, tuti potang bong itu mahikaifo mani fuina itu kontai, nana mani fuina itu fianang bitoya. Ampefe amiei ne suru umasi. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Sapi ituo ehawariroi tuti eharira, mano etariai aha mani, fuina itu. Tonanai kontai potang memasa tuti siamorang na wanang murang sioi foi. Nana mani, kahari foi miung fuina itu.<verse eid="GEN 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Ampefe fi antanafa imadurai we nehu mananu Firaune wau, weo Allai kawurua deinawiai we nehu mananu ne wau fianai aino ambori Niarifo. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Nehu mananune wau taramuma, fuina itu aha mani ambori nu Mesiri nei sentenang sefangna fianang bitoya paria. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Mayeai mani ambori kaharifoi da ahama miung fuina itu. Ampefe aromiporo fuina ituo obu fianang bitoya na nu Mesiri foi, weo kaharifoi dohong kataifoi sirahiai sentenang. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Na tonanafo wiro wati obu fitantanang bitoya na katai foi ahang kaha, weo kahari foi fiabai paria. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Nehu mananune wau, nemu amiei boti suru we beru wa mani, fi nanai Allai kiutuai kawuru ampa tuti ambori Niari kaririai ahera rai.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />Ampefe neo mahikai mani, nehu mananune wau wera we inontarai mano sewai manei tuti ruasi ambori ne mambiriu we yuparenta nu Mesiri nei. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Kontaio nehu mananune wau nari tonina, ruai inontarai mano erufi siai manea we efanduhi potangno inontarai Mesiri etetingnafo. Ambori etato kutuai we ring tuti eha weaia etararatai, na fuina ituo fianang bitoya nina. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Efanduhi fi angnifoi kiai na fuina ituo fianang bitoya nina, tuti na nehu mananu ne mambiriufo efanduhi fiani foi kiai na bendarifo tantenang tuti ararati we fiang. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Na tonanafo fianangfoi kiai meinenang we nu Mesiri foi sentenang, na fuina ituo kaharifoi miungfo, ambori inontarai Mesiri fosa ewawisia emarareha kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusupi weinontarai fuba na nu Mesiri foi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Firauni tuti ne inontarai mano erufi wei fosa eroa we kaiwo Yusupi medurafo. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Mayeai Firauni medu wesa deyo, “Wiro inontarai manei sewai kariri inontarai nini kaha. I mani inontarai mano Allai Nuaninufoi sensoni dine.”<verse eid="GEN 41:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Firauni medu we Yusupi deyo, “Allai deisaha fi nini kiai we wau kawuru ampa, wiro inontarai manei sewai kariri wau kaha. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Ampefe iruai wau weinontarai fuba. Nemu mambiriu we weparenta nehu rai nei sentenang tuti etaramio wau teraifa. Wiro manei wemambiriu sewa wau kaha, manta mananune yauno iwemambiriu sewane.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:10">Kis. 7:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Mayeai mani Firauni medu we Yusupi aha deyo, “Rahida nini iruai wau we inontarai fuba wemambiriu sau nu Mesiri nei sentenang.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:41-42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:29">Dan. 5:29</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Ainanaya Firauni fiating ne cincino wonongfo nayai nai foi weru wara kehafoi tuti satari na Yusupi wara kehafoi. Tuti sensung Yusupi na ansung mananu tuti sata raori emasi na rahanangfo. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Mayeai Firauni demi Yusupi dautai to kereta mananu bo borufoi, tuti etafai esahututiri, eteyo, “Mesomi wei!” Tonanaifa, Firauni yuai Yusupi we inontarai fuba, ne mambiriu we weparenta nu Mesiri foi sentenang.<verse eid="GEN 41:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Firauni medu we Yusupi deyo, “Yau mani Firauni, wape wiro inontarai manei na nu Mesiri nei sentenang niari fiea kaha, masino wiro roa wei kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Mayeai Firauni dohong Yusupi wonong Mesiri fino Safnat-Paneahi, tuti dohong Asnati, imami Potiferai na Oni ne kamitung dine we Yusupi ne wiwing. Tonanaifa Yusupi weinontarai fuba wemambiriu sau nu Mesiri foi sentenang.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yusupi ne fuina piareia sura (30) fo mani, yu fi we Firauni mananu Mesiri foi. Mayeai Yusupi da weru Firauni tuti da wari nu Mesiri foi sentenang. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Kahofafo tifu fitantanang wetarai bitoya paria na fuina ituo dohong mahikaifo. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Ampefe Yusupi fianduhi fianangfoi kiai na fuina itu dohong mahikaifo na nu Mesiri foi. Ainanaya Yusupi derara fianangfoi na bendarifo, fianang etetingni na bendari bei mani etararatai na bendari nani kontai. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Potangno Yusupi fianduhi bitoya paria toyari ninuaing na nafareng, donio inontarai fosa efotou etatorifo, weo wiro atoafong soi kaha.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Wiro fuina kaharifoi da ma kaharai mae, Yusupi ne wiwing Asnati, imami Potiferai na Oni ne kamitungfoi minohituti kaisung mandu kawurua. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yusupi dohong kaisung rentenangfoi wonong fino Manasyei, weo deyo, “Allai niari kawurua, awao arohuporo nehu dadirane tuti mano enayai na nehu dai ne munurorongfo.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Tuti we ne kaisung mandufoi dohongni wonong fino Efraimi, weo medu deyo, “Allai niari yau isobu arikang na nu bo isobu dadira nai nei.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Mayeai fuina itu dohong mahikai na nu Mesiri foi kaharai nanai, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />fuina itu kaharifoi miungfo da ma, toyari fio Yusupi medurai kawuru ampo. Nunei sentenang sodai kaharifoi, wape na nu Mesiri foi sentenang andino ne fiangne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:11">Kis. 7:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Na kutu inontarai Mesiri fosa esodai kaharifoi, tuti etutang Firauni we fiang, Firauni medu we inontarai Mesiri foi sentenang deyo, “Mera we Yusupia, tuti menari kariri fianai aino medurai we meafo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:5">Yoh. 2:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 41:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Kaharifoi miung nu Mesiri foi. Ampefe Yusupi fiai munu baba efanduhi fianang naifoi tuti dewayang potongfoi we inontarai Mesiri fosa, weo kaharifoi fiabai paria na nu Mesiri foi sentenang. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Kontaio inontarai na nunei sentenang era to Mesiri we ewori potang ria Yusupi, we kaharifoi fiabai paria na nunei sentenang.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Yusupi ne tafuaisa era to nu Mesiri foia we ewori potang nayai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Na kutu Yakupi taraoai, weo na Mesiri mani etawayang potang, ampefe medu we ne arikang fosa deyo, “We fianie meminohi mewati wawera meuremi ne?” <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Medu aha deyo, “Itarahuoai kawuru ampa, weo na Mesiri mani etawayang potang. Mera to wanaia mewori potang na wanai we tata, ambori wiro tawawisia tamarareha kaha.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:12">Kis. 7:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Mayeai Yusupi ne tafuai ewesura fosa era to Mesiria we ewori potang. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Wape Yakupi wiro yoa we Benyamini, Yusupi ne tahatuifoi da ria ne tafuaisa kaha. Weo enetituaitai, dohonao i ambori sodai neo karirafo ahangfe. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Ampefe na inontarai mano era wa ewori potangfo mani, Yakupi mano ahui we Israeli foi ne arikang ewesura fosa era kontai, weo kaharifoi miung nu Kanani fefe.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Na rabuang bonani mani, Yusupi weinontarai fuba na nu Mesiri foi kawurua, andino dewayang potang we inontarai na nunei sentenang ne. Ampefe Yusupi ne tafuaisa era wa esomi wei awao euremi disangso kahofa wau. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yusupi deti ne tafuaisa nanai deroangsosara. Wape niari anggari we i mani inontarai aisei dine. Na tapapa dutangsa deyo, “Mera na doni ma?” Eroa wei eteyo, “Amea mani inontarai Kanani di amea. Amera ma we amewori fiang ria wau.” <verse eid="GEN 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Yusupi deroangno ne tafuaisa, wape wiro etaroangni kaha.<verse eid="GEN 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Mayeai Yusupi aro ne amiei kariri eafo. Yusupi medu wesa deyo, “Mea mani inontaraio meuremi boa dimea. Merama we mewati kariri nu nini inontarai manea ewaitawangni ete bererie?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:5-10">Nun. 37:5-10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Wape eroa wei eteyo, “Daie bereri! Amea mani nemu mangfata mano manta amera ma we amewori fiang. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Amea mani amene dai mansiari, amea mani inontarai beng di amea, wiro inontarai ameuremi boa di amea kaha.” <verse eid="GEN 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Wape Yusupi medu wesa deyo, “Bereri! Mea mani mera ma we mewati kariri nu nini inontarai manea ewaitawangni ete bererie.” <verse eid="GEN 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Mayeai eroa wei eteyo, “Amea mani amewe suraya mandu (12) amewe mambetahatui, na fino amene dai mansiari na nu Kanani foi. Wape mano fuifi minohi ria amene dai fo, tuti manei mireha ampa.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Ainanaya Yusupi medu wesa deyo, “Bento! Toyari neo antanafa imadurai kawurua we mea nanai, mea mani inontarai meuremi boa dimea. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Na kaiwo memadurai ninai, todoni kontaio ye ititua kariri mea. Na mananu Firauni wonongne, wiro mera weru katai nini kaha, masino mene tahatuifoi wiro da ma kaha. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Metami manei na mea daraberahia kia mene tahatuifoi ma. Wape mano weine mea mani irutawang mea na ninai we ititua kariri kaiwo memadurane wetaraie. Masino wiro wetarai kaha mani, na mananu Firauni wonongne, mea mani inontarai meuremi boa dimea.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Mayeai esoasa to aitamu rorongfoa ewatai nai rahida botoru.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Na rahida bo botorufoi Yusupi medu wesa deyo, “Yau mani inontarai mano isomi we Allai tuti iroasoi, ampefe menari toninaifa ambori metarang. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Masino mea mani inontaraio menemirorong mesi di mea mani, manei na mea irutawangni na munu aitamu rorongne. Wape mano weine mea mani meha potangne mera we mene munurorongfoa weo ewawisi fefe. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Mene tahatui fuifoi, todoni kontaio mehari we yau ma, ambori kaiwo memadurane wetarai tuti memarareha kaha.” Ampefe eroa we kaiwo Yusupi medurafo. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Emadu wawerasa eteyo, “Antu paria arahi tasodai dadira finina, weo raminde tanari sarawai we tane tahatuinei. I sahu we tata we taaromioi, wape wiro tataramio sahufo kaha. Nanai wedaya tasobu dadirafe nina.” <verse eid="GEN 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Ainanaya Rubeni medu wesa deyo, “Raminde imadurai we mea yeyo, wiro menari karira we tane tahatuinei fanai! Wape wiro metaramio kaiwo imadurane kaha. Ampefe nina mani ne rikanei su tata finina.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:21-22">Nun. 37:21-22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Wape eserawawerahai, weo Yusupi deitawang kaiwo emadurafo. Ampefe emadu we Yusupi mani, inontarai mano deitawang ene kaiwofoi andino yiwang kaiwo emadurafo we Yusupi ahane. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Ampefe Yusupi da werusa, tuti saia. Mayeai daraberahi wesa aha tuti meduriasa. Ainanaya kia Simeoni werusa tuti demi ne inontarai fosa ewora warangfo na ne tafuai euremifo. <verse eid="GEN 42:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Mayeaia mani Yusupi demi inontarai mano erufi fosa, esoni potangfo na ne tafuai ene karungfo, tuti ene doifo etohong berahai aha esoniai na mansiari-mansiari ne karungfo. Kontaio demisa, emainenang fiang wesa na ene rang rorongfo. Inontarai mano erufi fosa enari kariri fianai aino Yusupi demisa weafo. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Ainanaya eruai potangfo to ene keledaifo, mayeai era wa nina.<verse eid="GEN 42:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Na katai ete etena nayafo mani, manei nasa sefa ne karungfoi we dohong ne keledaifoi dampi, na tantuma detio ne doifo watai sau potangfo na karung rorongfo. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Medu we ne doroifosa deyo, “Nehu doife tawera aha ma nina, mewati nayai na karung rorongfe nina!” Ampefe earomikuayai tuti ematai, tuti ewati wawerasa, mae emadu eteyo, “Fianai aino Allai niari we tata ninai?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Na kutu erawa esobu etamami Yakupi na nu Kanani foi, eteisaha kariri fianai aino esodairafo. Emadu eteyo, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Inontarai mano wenunggamiei na nu Mesiri foi, sua amea na tapapa paria tuti dinggai amea we inontarai ameuremi boa diamea. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Wape amemadu wei ameteyo, ‘Amea mani inontarai beng diamea, wiro inontarai ameuremi boa diamea kaha. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Amea mani mambetahatui suraya mandu (12) amene dai mansiari. Manei na amea mireha ampa tuti amene tahatui mano fuifoi niayai ria amene dai na kahofa Kanani fo.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Ainanaya inontarai mano wenunggamiei we nu Mesirifoi medu we amea deyo, Na fio memadurai ninai, yeo ititua kariri mea, antue inontarai beng dimea ete bererie? Ampefe todoni kontaio manei na mea niayai na nina. Wape mano weine mea mani, meha potangne merawe mene munurorongfoa weo ewawisi fefe. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Wape metarabera mea mani, meha mene tahatui fuiwai we yau ma. Ambori yeitawanaifa weo mea mani wiro inontaraio meuremi boa kaha, wape inontarai beng dimea, tuti ambori yohong mene tahatuinei tiwera we mea aha, tuti ambori mewori fi tuti metawayang fi na nu Mesiri nini, wiro inontarai manei sua mea kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Na kutu efai karungfo tuti etitaifo, na tantuma ewati aderi esoni doi nayafo nayai na ene karung rorongfo, ampefe ea tuti ene dai ewati aderi doifo nanai ematai paria. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Ampefe etamami Yakupi medu wesa deyo, “Mewedaya isera we nehu arikang ne sitoru. Yusupi mireha ampa, Simeoni daraberahi kaha, tuti meteyo meha Benyamini kontai aha, yau isodai dadira marabane paria!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Mayeai Rubeni medu we tamanai deyo, “Daie, bohong Benyamini we yauma, yau ambori ikari tiwera we wau ahama. Masino bereri mani, dai mung nehu arikang mangne suru.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Wape Yakupi medu we Rubeni deyo, “Bereri! Benyamini wiro daria mea kaha. Weo ne tafuai mireha ampa tuti manta andino niayai terane. Masino sobu dadira na rang rorong mera nai neife, dohonao mewedaya paituang nini yau ambori ibia to raimerife, weo enehurorongnei fituayai fefe.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi ne kaisung fosa era to Mesiri aha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Wape kaharifoi fiabai pampang na nu Kanani foi. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Tuti potangno eha kawurua na Mesirifo etangna kaia nanai, ene dai medu wesa deyo, “Mera wa mewori fiang kuteai we tata.” <verse eid="GEN 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Ampefe Yehudai yoa we tamanai deyo, “Inontarai wenunggamiei na Mesiri foi deretawang amea kawurua na mambiriu paria. Deyo, wiro deti ameuremine fanai, masino amene tahatuinei wiro da riata kaha. <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Ampefe masino dai roa we amene tahatuinei da ria amea mani, amemaya we amerawa amewori fiang we tata. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Wape masino wiro roa we dariata kaha mani, amea kontai wiro amera to wana kaha, weo inontaraifoi medu we amea kawurua ampa deyo, Wiro mewati urehune fanai, masino mene tahatuifoi wiro daria mea kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Ainanaya Israeli medu deyo, “We fianie menari yau isobu dadira, na meteisaharai we inontaraifoi, weo mene tahatui manei ne?” <verse eid="GEN 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Tuti eroa wei eteyo, “Inontaraifoi dutang bera kariri amea pampang, dutang kariri tane munurorongne, deyo, ‘Mene dai darangfo ne? Mene tahatui mang manei konta ne?’ Tuti ameteisaha kariri fianai aino dutang amea weafo. Amea wiro amewaitawanai kaha weo i ambori medu deyo, ‘Meha mene tahatui wai ma.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Mayeai Yehudai medu we tamangno Israeli deyo, “Roa we kaisungnei daria yau, ambori amemainenang we amera ahera, donio tatarang, wiro tamarareha fanai, amea, wau tuti amene arikang nesa. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Yauno ambori iwaitawangnai. Masino wiro ikari we wau ma kaha tuti yohongni na aromu ne kaha mani, yauno inari sarawai we dai wau we fitawafa. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Tarahio wiro tatamang waroi kaha mani, tonina mani amera we beru kawuru ampa.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Ainanaya etamami Israeli medu wesa deyo, “Masino tonana mani, menari toninaifa, meha tane fianangno mahikaifo na nu nini, mesoniai na mene karungwa mehara metohongnai we inontaraifoi we fiembaitai, amani kesi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesinei mani, esafai tuti eha ne kaiseanei, weamani ehai adia nai tuti ehai sambewarai na dirufo. </char></note>, aniwa ne maing, maningno nungsai mampori, kemiri bong tuti badami bong.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Badami bongnei mani karabu dine wape robong fiabai.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Tuti meha doifo beru kiparai. Doio dohongnai tawera kawurua to mene karung rorongfo, todoni kontaio meha tawera aha, tarahio esoni sarawaifa. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Meha mene tahatuinei kontai, memainenang tuti metarabera mea we inontaraifoia. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Allai Mano Wemambiriu Sewafoi kadono niari inontaraifoi enewawu mea, donio sawing Simeoni tuti Benyamini, metarabera mea kiai we yau ahama. Wape we yau mani, masino nehu kaisungne suru unai weru yau mani, bento, imainenang kawuru ampa.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Ainanaya Yakupi ne kaisung fosa eha fiembaitafo tuti eha doi ne faufo beru kiparai, tuti eha Benyamini kontai, mayeai emainenang tuti era to Mesiri. Erawa sobu Mesiri fo tuti etoari na Yusupi arongfo. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Na kutu Yusupi deti Benyamini daria ne tafuaisa fo, medu we mangfata mano wenunggamiei we deitawang ne munufoi deyo, “Ka inontarai ninisa to nehu munu foia, mung fiahung manei tuti moinenangni we fiang, weo rahida rabuang mani inontarai ninisa etampi ria yau.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Mangfatafoi niari kariri kaiwo Yusupi medurai weifo, tuti kiasa era to Yusupi ne munu rorongfoi.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Na kutu kiasa to Yusupi ne munufoi nanai, ematai paria. Enemitituaitai tuti emadu wawerasa eteyo, “Fio wedaya kia tata to ninai ma mani, doio tawera ma nayai na tane karung rorongne na kutu reantenang ta ra to ninai ma ne, ambori etafu tata tuti enari tata we woming tuti eha tane keledai nesa.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Ampefe era kefang Yusupi ne mangfatafoi tuti emadu wei na rahutu borongfo eteyo, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />“Daie, ameteyo amemadu ria wau! Amea mani raminde amera ma we amewori fiang. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Wape na kutu amerawa sobu katai bei we ametena nai tuti amefai amene karungne mani, amene doine nayai tantenang na amene karung rorongne. Wape kutu ninai ameha tawera ahamane. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Ameserawawerahai mandoni dino soni doifo to amene karung rorongfo ne, kutu ninai ameha doi siai feai kontai we amewori fiang nayai.” <verse eid="GEN 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Wape mangfatafoi medu wesa deyo, “Menemboru, wiro mematai fanai, mene Allai tuti mene dai ne Allai andino soni doi to mene karung rorongwa. Mene doiwa mani iru kawuru ampa.” Mayeai kia Simeoni to boriai tuti dohongni wesa. <verse eid="GEN 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Ainanaya mangfatafoi kiasa esuayai to Yusupi ne munu rorongfo afui, dohong mereha we eruai eawemifo, kontaio dohong fiang we ene keledai fosa.<verse eid="GEN 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Ainanaya emainenang fiembaitafo etamang we Yusupi dama na kutu rahida rabuangfo, weo etaramioai kawurua we etampi riati na nanaifa. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Na kutu Yusupi dawa sobu ne munufoi, eha fiembaitafo etohongnai we Yusupi na munu rorongfo, mayeai etisangkapa eawemibuka esomi aweu euremi disangso kahofa wau. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Ainanaya Yusupi dutangsa kariri enayai na maie, mayeai medu aha deyo, “Mene dai mano wepaituang meteikaririfoi niayai na maie? Tuti darangfo raie?” <verse eid="GEN 43:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Eroa wei eteyo, “Amene dai, nemu mangfatafoi niayai na mai, tuti darangfo.” Mayeai etisangkapa eawemibuka tuti esomi aweu euremi disangso kahofa wau.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Na kutu Yusupi deti netahatui Benyamini mano une ai mansiarifoi, ampefe medu aha deyo, “Mene tahatui fuio meteikariri we yau fi dininie?” Mayeai medu aha deyo, “Kadono Allai dohong mahikaifo we nehu kaisung ne wau.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Ainanaya Yusupi sikera daweru nanai, weo enerorongfoi fituayai we aro ne tahatuifoi, ampefe sera we katai we sai nayai. Yusupi suayai to ne rorongfoi afui tuti sai na nanaia. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Saia kai nanai, mayeai yuairurang urengfo tuti da to boriei, enetawani tuti medu we ne mangfatafoi deyo, “Memainenang fiangfo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Ainanaya ne mangfata fosa emainenang fiangfo, Yusupi nengfo na meja bei siai, ne doroi fosa enengfo na meja bei siai tuti inontarai Mesiri mano etampi ruhiai riasafo enengfo na meja bei siai. Weo inontarai Mesiri wiro etampi ruhiai ria inontarai Iberani kaha, weo fi nanai inontarai Mesiri ene wori fine. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Yusupi ne doroi fosa eminohi na arongfo, eminohi tatuwasa na mano reantenangfoi paria sobu mano fuifoi, donio ewati wawerasa na epapuhung paria. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Fiang we etangfo mani mangfata fosa eha na Yusupi ne mejafoi, wape Benyamini nengfo we bering fuba sewa ne tafuai enengfo. Ainanaya etampi tuti etunung ruhiai ria Yusupi na efaraise paria.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Yusupi titua kariri ne doroi fosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Na kutu etampia kai nanai, Yusupi demi ne mangfata mano wenunggamiei na ne munufoi deyo, “Woni inontarai ninisa ene karungwa na potang awao sayefang kariri eha wa, tuti ene doiwa woniai na mansiari-mansiari ne karung rorongwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Tuti woni nehu nofi peraki wai, na arikang mano fuifoi ne karungfoi tuti ne doi biai potang nayafo kontai.” Ampefe mangfatafoi niari kariri fianai aino Yusupi medurai weifo. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Ahara mani, na kamiai kutung, inontarai fosa etawing Yusupi ne doroi fosa era tutu ene keledai fosara. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Wape arahio era to boriei weru bendari foi, wiro waroi kaharai mae, Yusupi medu we ne mangfatafoi deyo, “Moinenang bawi inontarai fosa, tuti masino wobusa mani, modu wesa boyo, ‘We fianie mebai ne bengfo na ne karira ne? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />We fianie mehamanana nehu dai irufi wei nei ne nofi peraki we dunung tuti weaso nai nei? Menari karira paria.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Na kutu Yusupi ne mangfata foi sobu eafo, medu wesa kariri fianai aino Yusupi dererai weifo nanai. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Eroa wei eteyo, “Fianai aino dai modurai we amea ninai? Amefafora we wiro amenari tonana kaha. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Dai mantaung wau boitawanai weo doi amesobuai na amene karung rorongne na kahofa Kanani fo, ametohong berahai we dai wau ampa. We fianie amehamanana emasi ete peraki na nemu dai ne munufoi? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Daie, wera na amene karungne, masino manei na amea andino kia nofi perakinei mani, wenani dino sobu aiboi mararehafo, tuti mano weine amea ambori amewewoming we dai wau.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Ainanaya Yusupi ne mangfatafoi medu wesa deyo, “Yo iroa we kaiwo memadurawa. Wape mandoni dino kia nofi perakinei mani, wenani dino ambori we woming we yaune, mae mano weine mea mani mera wa.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Mayeai esahera etu ene karungfo to kahofafo tuti mansiari-mansiari fiai ne karungfoi. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Tuti mangfatafoi sera sauarai na ene karungfo, na mano fubafoi paria sobu mano fuifoi, tuti sobu nofi perakifoi na Benyamini ne karung rorongfo. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Na kutu ne tafuaisa ewatioai nanafo, efosiabu ene ansungfo weo enemirorong fituaya fefe. Mayeai eruai ene karungfo to ene keledaifosa ayai tuti etaraberasa to bendarifoi aha.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Na kutu Yehudai tuti ne doroifosa era wa sobu Yusupi ne munufoi mani, Yusupi niayai na nanaifa. Ampefe etisangkapa eawemibuka esomiaweu euremi disangso kahofa wau, na Yusupi arongfo. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yusupi medu wesa deyo, “We fianie menari toninaifa? Mewaitawangna kahae, weo inontaraio kariri yau nina mani wiro iwe aso kahae?” <verse eid="GEN 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Ainanaya Yehudai medu we Yusupi deyo, “Fianai aino ambori amemadurai tuti ameroa weai we dai waune? Tuti na fiani ambori ameteinawiai we amenari ne bengne? Allai deinawi amene sarawane ampa. Ampefe ninaia mani, amea tuti mano obu nofi peraki naifoi, amewewoming we dai wau.” <verse eid="GEN 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Wape Yusupi yoa wesa deyo, “Bereri, wiro inari tonana kaha! Mandoni dino obu nofi perakifoi nai mani, wenani dino wewoming we yaune, wape mano weine mea mani, metarabera mea na mai we mene dai aha.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehudai sawatutu Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Etaramio Yusupi medufoa kai nanai, Yehudai da kefang Yusupia tuti medu wei deyo, “Daie! Yeyo imadu, roa we nemu mangfata ne yau, imadu kaiwo kuteai we dai wau. Tuti wiro kosou nemu mangfata ne yau fanai, weo dai wau mani nemu mambiriu toyario Firauni mantauni. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Dai wau butang nemu mangfata ne amea kawuru ampa, boyo, ‘Mene dai darang fo ne ete mene doroi siai maneie?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Tuti ameroa we dai wau, ameteyo, ‘Amene dai manei wepaituang ampa tuti ne kaisung fui manei, mano saubaunung na kutu dai wepaituangfo. Ne tafuai mireha ampa, mantauni dino darangne, uru mani une ai mansiari, nanai wedaya mani dai enewawuti paria.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Mayeai dai modu we nemu mangfata ne amea boyo, ‘Mehari we yau ma, ambori yetioi.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Wape ameroa we dai wau, ameteyo, ‘Kaisung foi wiro niayai waroi weru tamangna kaha, weo masino niayai waroi weru tamangna mani, tamanai ambori mireha ki.’<verse eid="GEN 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Mayeai dai modu we nemu mangfata ne amea, boyo, ‘Masino mene tahatui fuifoi wiro da ria mea ma kaha mani, wiro mewati urehune ahang kaha.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Na kutu ametarabera amea we nemu mangfatafoi, amene dai, ameteisaha kariri fianai aino dai modurai we ameane. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Ainanaya amene dai medu deyo, ‘Metarabera mea, mewori fiang kuteai we tata.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Wape ameroa wei, ameteyo, ‘Wiro amera to wana kaha. Masino amene tahatui fuinei da ria amea mani, arahio ambori amera to wanaifa. Weo wiro amewatio inontarai foi urengfo fanai, masino amene tahatui fuinei wiro da ria amea kahaifa.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Ainanaya amene dai, nemu mangfatafoi, medu we amea deyo, Mewaitawangnaifa weo nehu wiwingnei minohituti kaisung mandu we yau. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Mano fafongfoi da weru yau ampa, tuti imadu yeyo, tarai, andowa memuna miungni ampa, tuti paria sobu ninai wiro yetioi daraberahi kaha. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Masino kaisung nini mehari weru yau tuti sodai ne karirafo mani, mewedaya mano nuhu baibuane yau ambori ibiari to raimeri, weo isodai karira fefe.”<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Yehudai medu we Yusupi aha deyo, “Nemu mangfatafoi, amene dai manta darang, masino Benyamini darang. Masino kaisung nini wiro daraberahi ria amea we amene daia kaha mani, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />taraie amene dai ambori mireha, weo deti kaisung nini kaha. Na tonanane amenari sarawaifa, weo amewedaya amene dai mano wepaitungfoi sobu dadirafo, donio biari to raimeri. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Wape nemu mangfata ne yau, yererai we amene dai kawurua ampa we yeitawangni. Imadu yeyo, ‘Masino ikari we dai ahang kaha mani, yauno iwesasari we dai wau we fitawafa.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Nanai wedaya mani yutang dai wau, maya mani, roa we nemu mangfata ne yau, inayai na ninai iwewoming we wau, iriwang kaisung nini daraberahi ria ne tafuaisa. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Weo todoni fino ametarabera amea we amene daia, masino kaisung nini wiro da ria amea kahai? Wiro nehu mambiriu feai we yeti fi karirao amene dai sodairafo kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yusupi deikaririai i mani mandoni dine fo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Na kutu Yehudai medua kai nanafo, Yusupi wiro enerorong mitu ahang kahai, na inontarai mano etoa kefangni fosa earomifo. Ainanaya demi ne mangfata fosa deyo, “Mera kai to boriei weru ninaifa.” Ampefe wiro manei niayai ria Yusupi ahang kaha, na kutu Yusupi deisaharai we ne doroi fosa, we i mani mandoni dinefo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Kis. 7:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Mayeaia mani Yusupi sai fuba paria, donio inontarai Mesiri fosa tuti Firauni ne munu mananu rorongfo etaramioaifa.<verse eid="GEN 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Tuti Yusupi medu we ne doroifosa deyo, “Yau mani Yusupi di yau! Tane dai darangfo ne?” Wape ne doroifosa wiro eroa wei kaha, weo ematai fefe emadu kaha. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Ainanaya Yusupi medu we ne doroifosa deyo, “Mera kefang ma.” Ampefe era kefang weia, medua aha deyo, “Yau mani Yusupi di yau, mene tahatuio raminde metawayangni to nu Mesiri foi. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Wape wiro mematai tuti metatua ahang fanai, weo metawayang yau to ninai ma ne. Allai mantauni dino demi yau ira foni mea, ambori inontarai nesa etarang pampang. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Weo fuina boru kawurua kaharinei miung nu Mesiri nini, tuti fuina ring aha mani, wiro inontarai enari romi ete eteting fi kaha. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Donio Allai demi yau kawurua ira foni mea, ambori na fitantuma ninai, dohong mea tuti mene ririanei ambori metarang na nunei. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Ampefe wiro meaino metami yau toninai ma kaha, wape Allai Andino dohong yau iwe mantainau we Firauni, tuti iwe dai we ne munu mananu rorongfo tuti iweparenta sau kahofa Mesiri foi sentenangne. <verse eid="GEN 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Ampefe metarabera mea ahera we daia tuti memadu wei meteyo, ‘Nemu kaisungno Yusupi medu toninaifa, Allai dohong yau kawurua iwemambiriu sau kahofa Mesirifoi sentenang. Wiro bomang fanai, ro ahera weia. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Wau ambori nayai na kahofa Gosyeni tuti ambori kefang we yau, wau tuti nemu arikang wasa tuti nemu tafuisa, nemu kambing, domba tuti sapi, tuti fi kiaio nemuni wai. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Na wanaifa yau yewawu wau, weo kahari nini niayai fuina ring aha. Fio inari ninaifa, ambori wau, nemu munurorongwa tuti inontarai mano era ria wau wasa, wiro ene pari fi fanai.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Kis. 7:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Yusupi medua aha, “Metarami ma, mantaung mea mewati terai na meuremife ampa. Manggatui Benyamini wau kontai boti terai na uremu ne ampa, weo Yusupi di yau, yauno imadu ria meane. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Ampefe meteisaharai we dai kariri nehu fi kiaio mehikai isobuai na nu Mesiri nini, tuti fi kiaio mewatioinei, tuti meha dai aherama.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Ainanaya Yusupi fiaung ne tahatui Benyamini rahanangfo tuti sai weo firaise fefe. Benyamini kontaio fiaung Yusupi tuti sai na warabiawafo. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Yusupi fiaung ne tafuaisa tuti niunasa mae sai weo firaise fefe. Mayeaia mani arahio emadu riati.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Na kutu inontarai na Firauni ne munu mananu rorongfo etaramioai, weo Yusupi ne doroifosa era ma, ampefe Firauni tuti ne inontarai erufi wei fosa efaraise paria. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Ainanaya Firauni medu we Yusupi deyo, “Modu we nemu doroifosa boyo, Menari toninaifa, metainaungso mene keledai wasa na potang tuti metarabera mea to kahafo Kanania. <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />Meha mene dai tuti ne munurorongfo tuti mera we yau ma. Yau ambori yohong fianai aino mahikai paria na kahofa Mesiri nini, ambori mesobu fio mahikaifo na kahofa ninaifa. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Tuti wau, boisaharai wesa boyo, Menari toninaifa, meha kereta beiru teai na kahofa Mesiri nei, we meha mene arikang fosa, mene wiwing fosa tuti mene dai weru wanaifa, tuti mera to ninai ma. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Wiro menemitituai mene fianggeng fubao mera weruifoi fanai. Weo fi fubao mehikai na kahofa Mesiri nei mani mene fi fine.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Ainanaya Israeli ne kaisung fosa enari kariri fianai aino mananu Firauni demisa weafo. Yusupi dohong kereta we ne doroifosa kariri Firauni demifo, kontai dohong fiang wesa na ene rang rorongfo. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Yusupi dohong ansung roantenang we mansiari-mansiari, wape we Benyamini mani dohong doi peraki piaring we betoru (300) tuti ansung ring. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Yusupi kontai denatu keledai mang sura, etaunaungsoai na fi mahikai sewa na Mesiri fo we tamangnaifa. Tuti keledai wiwing sura, etaunaungsoai na potang, roti tuti fiang we tamanai na rang rorongfo, na kutu da to Mesiri fo. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Ainanaya sawing ne doroifosa tuti medu wesa deyo, “Wiro mehasisou wawera mea na rang rorongwa fanai.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Ampefe tonanaifa, Yusupi ne doroifosa era weru kahofa Mesiri tuti era to kahofa Kanani we etamami Yakupia. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Erawa sobu Kanani mani, eteisaharai we etamami Yakupi, weo Yusupi darang nendai, andino weinontarai fuba tuti wemambiriusau kahofa Mesirifoi sentenangne. Wape Yakupi nemboru terai, wiro yoaso ea kaha. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Wape na kutu eteisaharai wei, kariri fi kiaio Yusupi medurafo, tuti na kutu Yakupi deti kereta Yusupi denatui we kiari nai to Mesiri fo, arahio ene dai Yakupi firaise aha. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Mayeai Yakupi medu wesa deyo, “Tarai! Nehu kaisungno Yusupi darang nendai, ye irawa yetioi na wiro imereha kaharai.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi tuti ne munurorongfo era to Mesiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Ainanaya Israeli fintang ne rafoi kiai, tuti da to Mesiri. Da wa sobu Bersyeba mani, dohong korbani we Allai, mano tamang Isaki somi weifoi.<verse eid="GEN 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Na dirua mani Allai medu we Israeli na fiainawiai bei deyo, “Yakupe, Yakupi wo!” Yakupi yoa Wei deyo, “Ya, Seng.” <verse eid="GEN 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Mayeai Allai medu wei aha deyo, “Yau Allai, Allai mano tamamu Isaki somi Weifoi di Yau, wiro mutai we ro to Mesiri fo fanai, weo Yau ambori inari nemu riria wai fiabai na wanai ki. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Yau ambori iweriria wau, na kutu ro to Mesiri fo, tuti Yau kontai ambori Ika nemu riria wai etauberahai to nu nini aha ma ki. Tuti Yusupi ambori minohi kefang wau na kutu boyo murehafo.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Ainanaya Yakupi da weru Bersyebai to Mesiria. Ne kaisung fosa eruai ene dai, ene wiwing fosa, tuti ene arikang fosa to kereta mananu Firauni denatui ma fo ayai. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Ea kontai eha ene fiahung fosa tuti ene ra esobui na kahofa Kanani fo. Mayeai era to Mesiri, mano era mani Yakupi tuti ne ririafoi kiai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Kis. 7:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Ne kaisungfosa tuti tufumang tuti tufuwing, ne ririafoi kiai kiari to Mesiri.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Yakupi ne kaisung mano era riati to Mesiri mani ewonomi fi nina. Yakupi ne kaisung fubafoi mani Rubeni. <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Rubeni ne kaisungfosa mani, Henoki, Palui, Hesroni tuti Karmi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simeoni ne kaisungfosa mani, Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Sohari tuti Sauli. Sauli inana mani wiwing Kanani dine. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Lewi ne kaisungfosa mani, Gersoni, Kehati tuti Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Yehudai ne kaisungfosa mani, Eri, Onani, Syelai, Peresi tuti Serahi. Wape Eri tuti Onani umereha na Kanani, tuti Peresi ne kaisung suruino Hesroni tuti Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Isakari ne kaisungfosa mani, Tolai, Puai, Ayupi tuti Simroni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Sebuloni ne kaisungfosa mani, Sereti, Eloni tuti Yahleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Riria ninisa mani Leai minohitutisa we Yakupi na Padan-Arami tuti ne kamitungno Dinai. Ampefe ea kiai, mang tuti wiwing mani ewe piareia suraya mantoru (33).<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gati ne kaisungfosa mani, Sifyoni, Hagi, Syuni, Esboni, Eri, Aroti tuti Areli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Asyeri ne kaisungfosa mani, Yimnai, Yiswai, Yiswi tuti Beriai tuti eroromibingno Serahi. Tuti Beriai ne kaisung suruino Heberi tuti Malkieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Riria nanisa mani, na Yakupi binengno Silpai, wiwing womingno Labani dohongni we ne kamitungno Leai. Ea kiai mani ewe suraya wonang (16). <verse eid="GEN 46:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Yakupi ne wiwingno Raheli ne kaisung mandu amani, Yusupi tuti Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Na Mesiri Yusupi ne wiwingno Asnati, Potiferai imami na Oni ne kamitung dine, minohituti kaisung mandu amani, Manasyei tuti Efraimi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50-52">Nun. 41:50-52</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Benyamini ne kaisungfosa mani, Belai, Bekheri, Asybeli, Gerai, Naamani, Ehi, Roshi, Mupimi, Hupimi tuti Areti. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Riria ninisa mani Raheli minohitutisa we Yakupi. Ea kiai mani ewe suraya mana (14).<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Dani ne kaisung mansiari mani, Husimi. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Naftali ne kaisungfosa mani, Yahseeli, Guni, Yeseri tuti Syilemi. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Riria nanisa mani na Yakupi binengno Bilhai, woming wiwingno Labani dohongni we ne kamitung Raheli. Ea kiai mani ewe itu.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Inontarai mano eraria Yakupi to Mesiri fosa mani, ne arikang tera fosa, mae wiro ato urawing fosa kontai kaha. Ea kiai, ewe piatorua wonang (66). <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Yusupi ne kaisung mandu utaubau unumi na Mesiri. Ampefe Yakupi ne munurorong enayai na Mesiri mani ewe piatorua sura (70)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ewe piatorua sura (70) mani, Yakupi tuti Yusupi, Yusupi ne kaisung mandufo suru.</char></note>.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Kis. 7:14</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Era wa kefang kaharai mae, Yakupi demi Yehudai da fafongna deisaharai we Yusupi, ambori Yusupi da to Gosyeni ma sobu tamangnaifa. Tuti era wa sobu Gosyeni. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Ainanaya Yusupi demi ne mangfata fosa emainenang ne keretafoi, ambori da to Gosyeni, we sobu tamangno Israeli. Na kutu sobu tamangnafo, fiaung tamanai tuti saifo wairoi paria, na tamang warabeawafo.<verse eid="GEN 46:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Mayeai Israeli medu we Yusupi deyo, “Ninaia mani imereha te towea kaha, weo iwati uremu ne ampa tuti yeitawangnai weo barang nendai.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Ainanaya Yusupi medu we ne doroifosa tuti ne dai ne munurorong fosa deyo, “Yau ambori ira wa yeikaririai we Firauni yeyo, ‘Nehu doroifosa tuti nehu dai ne munurorong fosa kiai, mano enayai na Kanani fo, era kawuru we yau ma ne.’ <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Yau kontai ambori yeisaharai weo mea mani mantahung kambing tuti domba, weo mea mani metahungno kambing, domba, sapi tuti ene fi kiaio ehafo. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Masino Firauni sahu meara dutang mea deyo, ‘Fianai aino merune?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Meroa wei meteyo, ‘Amea mani mantahung fiahung di amea, na ameraifofafo paria sobu ninai, toyari amene wereng fosa.’ Ambori Firauni dohong kahofa Gosyeni we menayai nai.” Yusupi medu tonanai weo inontarai Mesiri nesa enemirireu mano etahung fiahung fosa.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi da wa medu we Firauni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Mayeai Yusupi da wa deisaharai we Firauni deyo, “Nehu dai tuti nehu doroifosa, eha ene fiahung kambing, domba, sapi tuti ene ra eminohi tutirai na Kanani fo, era ma enayai na Gosyeni ne.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Yusupi kia ne doroi ewering era we Firauni.<verse eid="GEN 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Firauni dutang bera Yusupi ne doroifosa deyo, “Fianai aino meru ne?” Eroa wei eteyo, “Nemu mangfata ne amea mani mantahung domba, toyari amene wereng fosa.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Emadu we Firauni aha eteyo, “Amerama we amenayai na nu nini we inontarai aisei. Weo na Kanani kaharifoi fiabai paria, donio ninoi bereri we nemu mangfatane amene fiahung rabuang nesa etang kaha. Ampefe roa we nemu mangfatane amea we amenayai na kahofa Gosyeni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Ainanaya Firauni medu we Yusupi deyo, “Tamamuaifa tuti nemu doroifosa era kawurua we wau ma. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Nu Mesiri nei fiabai we wau. Ampefe boinawiai we nemu dai tuti nemu doroifosa katai denteng na nu nini, bento ea enayai na Gosyeni. Tuti masino boitawanai, manea na ea esawai mani, bohongsa ewaitawang wedua nehu fiahung nesa.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Yusupi kia tamang Yakupi kontai awa deinawi we Firauni. Mayeai Yakupi mioang Firauni. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Ainanaya Firauni dutang bera Yakupi deyo, “Nemu fuina beiru ampa?” <verse eid="GEN 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakupi yoa wei deyo, “Fuinao iraiwariai iwe inontarai aisei ne, fuina piaring piareia sura (130). Fuina iminohi yarang fuba kaha tuti dadira paria. Wiro netarai toyari nehu wereng fosa ene fuina eraoai fo kaha, amani ene fuina eraiwariai eweinontarai aiseifo.”<verse eid="GEN 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Ainanaya Yakupi mioang Firauni, mayeai dariai to boriai weruia. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Mayeaia mani Yusupi deinawi katai we tamangna tuti ne doroifosa we enayai nai, amani dohong kahofa beng paria na nu Mesiri we ene, na kahofa Ramsesi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ramsesi mani Gosyeni wonong waworu fine.</char></note>, karirio Firauni demi fo. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Tuti Yusupi dewawu tamangna tuti ne doroifosa tuti tamanai ne munurorong fosa na fiang, kariri ene arikang fosa efau toafo.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fio Yusupi niari na Mesiri, na kutu kahari miungfo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Na kutu nanai mani kaharifoi fiabai paria, donio inontarai na kahofa Mesiri foi sentenang tuti kahofa Kanani foi efanahang weo kaharifoi fefe. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Ampefe Yusupi fiangduhi doi na inontarai Mesiri fosa tuti inontarai Kanani fosa, ewori potang nai foi, tuti Yusupi kia doifo to Firauni ne munu mananu rorongfoa. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Na kutu inontarai Mesiri fosa tuti Kanani fosa ene doifo kaia nanai, inontarai Mesiri fosa era wa emadu we Yusupi eteyo, “Bohong fiang we amea! Wiro tua ameara amemarareha fanai. Weo amene doife kai ampa.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yusupi yoa deyo, “Masino doi bereri mani, metohongno mene fiahung wasa, ambori yohong fiang we mea ki.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Ainanaya eha ene fiahung kuda, kambing, domba, sapi tuti keledai we eriwang fiang nayai ria Yusupi. Ampefe na fuina bonani Yusupi dohong fiang wesa weriwang ene fiahung fosa.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Na fuina bo sua aha foi, era aha ma emadu we Yusupi eteyo, “Ameteisaha parai we dai wau, amene doife kai ampa, amene fiahung fesa ehai ampa. Wiro amene fieai ahang kahai, weo amewori fiang nayai. Manta titou amenetarainei tuti amene kahofa ne. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Wiro tua ameara amemarareha fanai, amea tuti amene kahofane. Wori amea tuti amene kahofane we riwang fiang, ampefe amewemangfata we Firauni, tuti amene kahofane mani ne fi fine. Bohong aibong feai kontai, ambori ametarang tuti wiro amemarareha kaha, tuti kahofane wiro sarahia kaha.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Mayeai Yusupi wiori inontarai Mesiri fosa ene kahofa foa kai we Firauni. Inontarai Mesiri fosa mansiari-mansiari dewayang ne kahofafo, weo kaharifoi fiabai miungsa paria. Ampefe nu Mesiri foi sentenang mani Firauni neni. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Tuti inontarai fosa kiai, ewemangfata na nu Mesiri foi sentenang. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Manta imami fosa ene kahofafo aino wiro wiori kaha ne, weo ea mani esobu fiembaitai pampang ria Firauni. Tuti ea mani etarangna fiembaitafo, nanai aino wedaya mani ene kahofafo wiro etawayangna kaha.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yusupi medu we inontarai fosa kiai deyo, “Na rahida nini yau iwori mea kawurua tuti mene kahofane we Firauni, mene aibong finina, ambori mehafasa na kahofafo. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Na kutu meteting fianangfoi mani metato baurai we ring, beyari we Firauni, mae ne seafo weai we fiang we mea tuti mene munurorongfo, tuti weai we metanang aha.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Mayeai emadu aha eteyo, “Daie, enemuwawu amea tuti fata amea ametarang ampa. Kadono amemai na dai uremuwa mani, amemainenang we amewe mangfata we Firauni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Yusupi niari finanai we kaiwo kiutuai we inontarai fosa etohong kaririai na nu Mesiri foi sentenang amani, fianangfoi etato baurai we ring, tuti etohong beyari we Firauni. Kaiwo kutuai nanai nayai paria sobu ninaifa. Mae manta imami fosa ene kahofafo aino wiro Firauni kia kaha.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaiwo Yakupi medurai na rerai we mirehafo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Na kutu inontarai Israeli fosa enayai na kahofa Gosyeni na nu Mesiri foi nanai, ene rafoi bitoya tuti etawing sefarai bitoya aha. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Tuti Yakupi minohi darang na Mesiri fuina suraya itu (17) aha. Ampefe Yakupi darang fuina piaring piarua itu (147). <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Na kutu Israeli rerai we mirehafo mani, demi inontarai esahu ne kaisungno Yusupi, tuti medu wei deyo, “Masino enemuwawu yau mani, ruai waramune ma wasau awehuwowongne tuti fofora, weo wau ambori boinawi nemu enemuwawuwa we yau. Wiro wurai yau na Mesiri nina kaha. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Weo, ye iwatai ria nehu wereng fosa. Ampefe imereha mani, ka yau weru Mesiri tuti wurai yau ria ea na ene fafo fo.” Yusupi yoa deyo, “Yo daie, yau ambori yohong kariri nemu kaiwo modurane ki.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:29-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:29-32">Nun. 49:29-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:6">50:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 47:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Mayeai Yakupi medu deyo, “Fofora we yau we wau ambori nari kaririai ki.” Ampefe Yusupi fefora we tamangnaia. Mayeai Israeli disangkapa awebuka suang aweu somi we Allai na ne fata nunggamieifoi.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi mioang Manasyei tuti Efraimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />We rahida beiru teaia mani, Yusupi sobu kaiwo we tamang meninang. Ainanaya Yusupi kia ne kaisung mandufo suru, Manasyei tuti Efraimi itorawa itotuambawa Yakupi. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Na kutu Yakupi taraoai we Yusupi da ma fo, ampefe Israeli yurai we doari ayai minohi na fatao dena naifoi.<verse eid="GEN 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Mayeai Yakupi medu we Yusupi deyo, “Allai Mano Wemambiriu Sewafoi kawurua Deinawi netarai we yau na Lusi na kahofa Kanani foi tuti mioang yau.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13-14">Nun. 28:13-14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Tuti medu we yau deyo, ‘Yauno inari wau bawing separai, tuti Yau ambori inari nemu ririanei we kaiwasa bitoya. Yau ambori yohong nu nini we nemu ririanei we eneni we fitawafa.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Yakupi medu we Yusupi aha deyo, “Nemu kaisung mandu utaubau unumi na kahofa Mesiri ne, na wiro ira to ninaima kaharai, amani Manasyei tuti Efraimi isahu suru we nehu kaisung toyario Rubeni tuti Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Masino wobu arikang manea aha mani, nemu saine. Wape ene rafoi mani, esobuai na Manasyei tuti Efraimi. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Inari fi nina ne, weo enehutituai inamu Raheli. Na kutu yarabera yau na Padan-Arami mani inamu Raheli mireha na Kanani, kefangwe Efrata. Tuti isarai na wana na rang deraung to Efrata.” Ninaia mani ahuai we Betlehemi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:16-19">Nun. 35:16-19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Na kutu Israeli deti Yusupi ne kaisungfo suru nanai dutangnai deyo, “Kaisung mantei surui nina?” <verse eid="GEN 48:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yusupi yoa we tamanai deyo, “Nehu kaisungno Allai dohong suru we yau na Mesiri nina.” Ampefe Yakupi medu deyo, “Bohong suru kefang we yau ma, ambori imoang suru.”<verse eid="GEN 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Rabuang bonani Israeli weinongkutungna tuti deti wawurai. Mayeai Yusupi dohong ne kaisungfo suru kefang tamangnaia, tuti tamangno fiaung suru tuti niuna suru. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Ainanaya Israeli medu we Yusupi deyo, “Woiroi paria, yeitarahio wiro yeti wau ahang kaha. Wape nina mani Allai dohong yau we yeti wau tuti nemu arikang nesa.”<verse eid="GEN 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Mayeai Yusupi yabi ne kaisungfo suru weru tamangna weo uroa rurang tamangna fefe, tuti suang aweu ureng disangso kahofa wau. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Mayeaia mani Yusupi yu kaisungfo suru, uroa na tamang Yakupi arongfo. Dohong Manasyei doari na tamang Israeli eneung domoya foi, mae Efraimi doari na tamang eneung dowei foi. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Wape Israeli yuai warang domoya foia wiatai sau Efraimi nungkamieifoi, masino fui dine ki. Tuti warang dowei foi yuaisia wiatai sau Manasyei nungkamieifoi, masino Manasyei fuba dine ki. Ampefe Israeli sa wawera warangfo suru. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Mayeaia mani mioang Yusupi na medu deyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Allai mano nehu tafui Abrahami tuti nehu dai Isaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">usomi wei foi mani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">Allai mano wiwiaing yau</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">yarang paria sobu nina, <verse eid="GEN 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />tuti mano we Wewai sawing yau weru ne karirafo ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">kadono Andino mioang kaisung ninisuru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">Donio wonohune kontaio nehu tafui Abrahami tuti nehu dai Isaki, watai we fitawafa na kaisung ninisuru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">tuti kadono urawing separai bitoya na nunei.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Wiro Yakupi medu kaiwo moangfo kaharai, mae Yusupi deti tamang yuai warang domoya foi wiatai sau Efraimi nungkamiei foi. Fi nanai detioai wiro beng kaha, ampefe yu tamang warangfo weru Efraimi nungkamieifoi tuti dohongnai to Manasyei nungkamieifoi. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yusupi medu we tamanai deyo, “Daie, wiro nari tonana fanai, weo Manasyei mani arikang fuba dine, ampefe bohong waramu domoya wai wiatai sau nungkamiei nei.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Manamo Yakupi deiayari deyo, “Nehu kaisungne wau, yeitawangno fianai aino inari nina. Manasyei kontai ambori we inontaraio etatori tuti ne ririanei ambori we kaiwasa fiabai bei. Masino tonanai ki, wape ne tahatui Efraimi ambori inontarai etatori sewa. Tuti ne tahatui ne ririafoi ewe kaiwasa fiabai sewa paria.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Mayeai na rahida nani kontaio, Yakupi mioang kaisungfo suru tuti medu deyo, “Inontarai Israeli nesa eteyo emoang inontarai manei mani, etafu muwonomine, emadu eteyo, ‘Kadono Allai niari wau nemu tarai toyari Efraimi tuti Manasyei.’ ” Ampefe na tonanafo Yakupi dohong moang we Efraimi fafong weru Manasyei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:21">Ibr. 11:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 48:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Mayeai Israeli medu we Yusupi deyo, “Wairoi ahang kaha ambori imereha rai. Wape Allai ambori wiwiaing mea, tuti Kia mea metawera to mene wereng fosa ene nufoi aha. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Kutu ninai yohong kahofa mahikai Sikhemi we wau, wiro we nemu tafuaisa kaha. Kahofa nanai imamunara itahatawang inontarai Amori fosa tuti yewarai werusa na nehu sondu tuti afainei.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yakupi ne kaiwo medurai wefuyai pari we ne kaisung fosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Mayeai Yakupi sahu ne kaisung fosa ma tuti medu wesa deyo, “Mefanduhi mea kefang yau ma, ambori yeikaririai we mea, kariri fianai aino ambori mesodairai na rahidao da ma foi.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Mefanduhi mea metaramididawai, Yakupi ne kaisung ne mea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">metaramio mene dai Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Rubene, wau mani nehu kaisung reantenang di wau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">nehu mambiriu di wau, taubaunumu reantenang na iwe mambiriufo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">Wauno etato wau tuti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">wemambiriu sewa nehu kaisung wei fosa ne.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Wau wiro ato wau we kaisung fuba ahang kaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">weo wau nemutarai kariri merehao wiro taupiki kaha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">Wau bena ria tamamu ne wiwingnei na ne fata dena nai nei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">Wau nari tamamu ne fata dena nai nei werarika ampa!<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Simeoni tuti Lewi mani, mambetahatui di suru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">une fi mamunafo we umei fifiani kontai.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Kadono yau wiro imaya we ikontai ria suru we fi umadu ruhiai karirafo kaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">kadono nuhuaninunei wiro weboyari na efanduhisa fo kaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">weo ukasou mani umung inontarai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">tuti uferangkutu sapi aweng afai singfo we ufaraise.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Yeikanggani ukasoufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">weo ukasou mani umansansoang paria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">yeikanggani suru, weo uremimamang paria.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">Yau ambori yetotatesa na Yakupi ne kaisung fosa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">Tuti isotatesa na inontarai Israeli fosa kiai.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Yehudae, wau ambori tahatawang nemu aiteta fosa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">nemu doroifosa ambori efiai wau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">tamamu ne kaisung nesa ambori etuang esomi na aromuwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yehudae, wau mani nemu tarai toyari singa antung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">memunara kai mani daraberahi to aisangging foi aha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">disangkapari wiatai toyari singa, mandoni dino wemambiriu we biaungni ne?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:9">Bil. 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">Why. 5:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Aitatohi mananu foi wiro tiwera weru Yehudai kaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">paria mano ne haki sauwifoi dama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">tuti kaiwasanei sentenang ambori etuang esomi wei.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />I ambori tebuhi ne keledai foi na ai anggurifo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">tuti ne keledai antungfoi na ai angguri denteng paria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">i ambori fia ne ansungfo na angguri nukuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">tuti ne ansung dawaroifo na angguri nukuru berika toyari rika.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Urengfo mahikai paria, barika sewa weru angguri nukuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">tuti derengfo mutubaru, bua sewa weru ui nei.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Sebuloni ambori niayai na nafareng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">ne katai foi ambori we katai kapari dawohi nayai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">ne katai foi fiabai paria werea na Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Isakari mani netarai toyari keledaio wemambiriu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">wiatai rahangno nawang maraba.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Na kutu deti katai minohi ukai nai bei denteng tuti mehikai mani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">suang aweu sodua fi maraba na warabiawafo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">tuti yu fi toyari woming.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Dani ambori kiutu kaiwo we ne kaiwasa fosa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">netarai toyari riria Israeli mano wei nesa.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Kadono Dani netarai toyari tawai na rangfoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">toyari tawai memuna wiatai na rang ketuifoi tuti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">kiri kuda aweng fo ampefe soiri, wedaya inontarai mano dautai naifoi sawai to fui.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Oh Yahweh, yau mani yemang we Tawing yau weru ne karirafo.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gati mani, ambori inontarai emamuna fosa etawi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">wape i ambori daraberahi dawi sa aha.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Asyer, wau tuti ne ririanei ambori mene fiang bitoya paria tuti denteng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">wau ambori maoinenang fiang mahikaifo we mananu fosa.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Naftali mani netarai toyario rusa wiwingno mito funomai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">i ambori sobu arikang tuti ne arikang fosa euremi bohi paria.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yusupi netarai toyari aio ne bong bitoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">sifu rurang mereha ureng fefe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">arirawangfo sifu dautai ayai na wore kamiei fo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na kaiwo siai feai soi kariri Yusupi mani netarai toyari keledai antung terirai kefang mereha urengfo, mito na uai tarareifo</char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Masino ne aiteta fosa etohongburi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">tuti etanai na ene afaifo,<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />wape ne afaifo papayai tuti warangfo mutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">weo fatafo na Mano we Mambiriu Paria we deitawang wedua Yakupi fo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">I mani Mantahung tuti we Uai Kamiei we Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Kadono nemu dai ne Allai ambori fiata wau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">tuti na Allai Mano weMambiriu sewafoi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">ambori Mioang wau na moangno na rorafaisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">tuti moangno mereha ureng na rawanang kehabi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">tuti kadono nemu ririanei fiabai tuti nemu fiahung nesa ene arikang bitoya.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Tamamu ne moangne fuba sewa weru uai fafongpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">amani fitantanang, mahikai sewa wiwoio na fafongpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Kadono nani kiai bia to Yusupi nungkamieifoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">tuti bia sau inontarai mano wewonong paria na ne doroifosa.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Benyamini mani netarai toyario serigala memuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">na kamiaifo miung ne aiteta fosa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">tuti na ramindenafo mani deto fio dewarai nanai.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Tonanaifa, riria Israeli suraya mandu fosai nana, tuti kaiwo ene dai medurai wesa fo. Na kutu mioangsafo, mansiari-mansiari mioangsa na moangno mai kaririai mansiari-mansiarifo.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakupi mireha tuti esarai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Ainanaya Yakupi deretawang ne arikang fosa deyo, “Katu mani imereha toyari nehu wereng fosa. Ampefe mesarai yau rurang nehu wereng fosa na wingsaburungno, na Efroni inontarai Heti foi ne romifoi, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />wingsaburungfoi wiatai na romi Makpelai, na do wanang murang Mamre na kahofa Kanani. Romio Abrahami wioriri kawuru ria Efroni inontarai Heti foi, we ne fafo fine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:29-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-20">Nun. 23:3-20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Katai nani dino, esarai Abrahami tuti binengno Sarai, Isaki tuti binengno Ribkai,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:9-10">Nun. 25:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:29">35:29</ref>. </char></note> na nanai kontai isarai Leai. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Romifoi tuti wingsaburung na wanai Abrahami wioriri ria inontarai Heti fosara.”<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakupi deretawang ne kaisung fosara kai nanafo, tibari aweu wiatai tuti mirehara. Ampefe mireha ria ne wereng fosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Kis. 7:15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Mayeai Yusupi suang aweu fiaung tamanai, sai tuti niunahi. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Tuti Yusupi demi manggarawang mano erufi wei fosa, we enari tamang netarai mirehafoi na fi nunsai mamporifo. Ampefe manggarawang fosa enari Israeli netarai mirehafoi na fi nunsai mamporifo. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Fi enari nanai dang rahida piaru (40), weo enari fi nunsai mamporifo we inong marareha mani wairoi tonanai. Tuti inontarai Mesiri fosa esai Yakupi wairoi rahida piatoru sura (70).<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Rahida eminohi ewekoyafo kai nanai, Yusupi medu we inontarai mano erufi na Firauni ne munu mananu rorongfo, deyo, “Masino menemiwawu yau mani, memadu we Firauni, meteyo, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />nehu dai demi yau ifafora kawurua, deyo, ‘Wiro waroi ahang kaha mae imereha rai. Wurai yau na nehu fafo imainenangni kawurua na kahofa Kanani fo.’ Ampefe roa we yau ira to wanaia, ambori isarai nehu dai, mayeai yarabera yau aha ma.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29-31">Nun. 47:29-31</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Ainanaya Firauni medu deyo, “Ro to wanaia tuti wurai nemu dai toyari neo demi wau kawurua we foforafo.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Mayeai Yusupi da to Kanani we sirai tamangnaifa. Tuti mano erariati mani, Firauni ne inontarai mano erufi wei fosa, mano ewewafoniai na munu mananu rorongfo tuti mano ewewafoniai na kahofa Mesiri fo, <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Yusupi ne munurorongfosa kontai, ne doroifosa tuti ne dai ne munurorongfosa. Mano wiro era riata kaha mani, ene arikang raifofa fosa tuti ene fiahungfosa, eaino enayai na kahofa Gosyeni ne. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Afaimamunao etautai na kereta tuti kudafo era riati kontai, donio inontarai era riati fosa efau paria.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Na kutu era wa sobu Goren-Haatati, kataio eteni potangnai, na waya Yardeni do wanang murangfoi, na nanai esaifo fuba paria, tuti Yusupi minohi koya we tamanai wairoi rahida itu. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Na kutu inontarai Kanani fosa ewati inontarai Mesiri fosa esai na Goren-Haatatifo, emadu eteyo, “Nina mani inontarai Mesiri esai ne fuba pari finina.” Nanai wedaya mani katai nani wonong fino Abel-Misraimi, nana mani inontarai Mesiri esai fuba paria. Katai nani wiatai na waya Yardeni eneung dowaruai.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Yakupi ne kaisung fosa enari kariri fianai aino dererai wesafo. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Ea ehari to kahofa Kanani, tuti esirai na wingsaburung Makpelai, amani romi na do wanang murang Mamrei, neo Abrahami wiori kawurua ria Efroni inontarai Heti foi we fafo we ne munurorong fosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Kis. 7:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Esirai tamangnaia kai nanai, Yusupi tuti ne doroifosa tuti inontarai mano era ruhiai riati we esirai tamangna foi etaraberasa to Mesiri aha.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusupi wewori ne tafuai enemirorongfoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Na esirai etamamifoia kai nanai, Yusupi ne tafuai ewatioai we etamami foi mireha ampo, emadu eteyo, “Masino Yusupi aroo fi karira tanari weifo mani todoni raie?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Ampefe etami inontarai manei deisaharai we Yusupi, “Wiro nemu dai mireha kaharai mae, dereraia kawurua deyo, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />kaiwo ambori memadurai we Yusupi, meteyo, ‘Boyai nemu tafuai ene sarawai tuti ene sasari nei, weo ea enari ne karirafo we wau kawuruampo.’ Ampefe kutu ninai boyai amene sarawaio amenari we waufo. Amea mani mangfata Allai, mano tane dai somi weifoi.” Na kutu Yusupi tarao kaiwofo nanai saia.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Mayeai ne tafuai mantaungsa era ma etisangkapa eawemibuka na arongfo tuti emadu eteyo, “Amera ma we amewe mangfata we wau.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Wape Yusupi medu wesa deyo, “Mematai fanai, weo wiro Allai di yau kaha. <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Tarai, mea metohong ne karirafo we yau kawuru ampa, wape Allai kawurua yiwangna ne bengfo, kariri fianai aino arahi kawariai nina, ambori dewawu inontarainei sentenang etarang. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Ampefe wiro mematai fanai, yau ambori yohong fiang we mea tuti we mene arikang wasa kontai.” Tonanaifa, Yusupi wewori ne tafuai enemirorongfoi na kaiwo medurafo.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusupi mireha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yusupi tuti ne doroifosa tuti ene munurorongfo, enayaia epapayai na Mesiri, tuti Yusupi darang fuina piaring sura (110). <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Yusupi wiro mireha kaharai mae, deti Efraimi ne arikang tuti ne tafuisa paria sobu riria bo botorufoi. I kontai deti Manasyei ne kaisung Makiri ne arikang mano etaubau enumi na Yusupi ne munurorongfo mani kiasa we mantauni ne arikang.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Yusupi medu we ne doroifosa deyo, “Wiro waroi ahang kaha mae ambori imereha rai, wape Allai ambori Fiata mea tuti Kia mea to boriai weru nu nini, to nu bo Dereri kawurua na Fefora we Abrahami, Isaki tuti Yakupi fo.”<verse eid="GEN 50:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Ainanaya Yusupi demi Israeli ne arikang fosa efafora, deyo, “Allai ambori Fiata mea ki. Na kutu mera to boriaifo mani meha nehu tarai mirehanei weru nu nini.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kel. 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos. 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:22">Ibr. 11:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Mayeai Yusupi mireha na ne fuina piaring sura (110). Netarai mirehafoi enariri na fi nunsai mamporifo, tuti etohongni wiatai na burua (wa) inontarai mararehafoi na Mesiri.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>